\id DEU  
\h Danbu Nina 
\toc1 Danbu Ni Na 
\toc2 Danbu Ni Na 
\toc3 Danbu Ni Na 
\mt1 Mose Lekhabu Ngana  
\mt2 DANBU NINA  
\mt3 Danbu nina sung thu umdan  
\ip Hiche lekhabua kon hin thohgimna, patepna, lung opkaina, kitepna, kinepna leh tahsanna hichengse mudoh in aum'in ahi. Tahsan kiti hi acham'a thilsem banga semthu thei ahipoi, ti vetsahna chule tahsan kiti hi mimal tompanna leh Pathen mingailut kiguijopna akon bou ahi.  
\ip Danbua kon hin Israel te Canaan gam jon a Jordan vadung agalkai nau ahilchen in, Mose’n mipi henga aseijin, Egypt gamsunga thil kidang tah tah Pakaijin akilah sah ho ageldoh sah sohkei uve. Mose chun Pathen thangvahna jeng aseijin, Pathen'in ichan geiya amite akhohsah a chule ahuhdoh ham, ti thudol jong aseijin ahi. Hichea kon hin Pakaijin genthei te, meithai, chaga khohsahna nasatah aneiye, ti muchet ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu jihpa, akijih kum chule akijih lona  
\ip Danbu hi Mose’n 1406 BC kum'a ana jih ahi. Chule Danbu Lekhabu hin Israel te Canaan gam alut kon uva thil umdan ho aseijin, Mose chun Israel mite chu milim semthu ahou nauva konna akiheimangna diuvin temna aneijin, apu apateu khanga Pathen toh kitepna chu athah beh in alah uva akilahsah in ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Mose’n Pathen thupeh banga ahilchah  
\p
\v 1 Mose’n thu hichengse hi Israel mite solam Jordan vadung gamthip noiya aum pet uva aseipeh u ahi. Amaho Jordan phaicham langkhat a Paran aumin, langkhat a Tophel, Laban, Hazeroth le Di-zahab aumin, akikah a Suph kom'a abusa uve.   
\p
\v 2 Sinai molsang apat Kadesh-barnea chan chu angaiya banga nisom le khat kenglam ahin, chule Seir molsang kijotpa ahi.  
\v 3 Ahinlah Israel ten Egypt gamsung ahin dalhah kal'u kum somli jou, lhasom le lhakhat lhinna nikho masapen ni'n, Mose'n Israel mipi ho henga, sei dia Pakaijin athupeh ho chu abonchan asei tan ahi.  
\v 4 Amor mi Leng Sihon in Heshbon avaipoh lai, chule Bashan Lengpa Og in Ashtaroth avaipoh laiya Edrei mun a ajo jouva asei ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Israel mite Moab gam Jordan vadung solam'a aum pet uvin, Pakai thupeh ho chu Mose’n jong chingthei tah in bannei chan ahilchen in ahi.   
\s1 Sinai dalhah dinga thupeh  
\p
\v 6 “Sinai molsanga ium laiyun Pakai I-Pathen uvin eiho dingin aseijin, 'Hiche Mol ahin naum sot tauve.  
\v 7 Tua hi ngahmun phetlhah a chule kitol phat ahitai. Amor mite chenna thinglhang gam chule akinaipi lhaang ho le Jordan phaicham, thinglhang gam, lhumlam gam ho, Negev, chule twikhanglen panga phaicham ho a gache uvin. Canaan mite gam chule Lebanon, chule Euphrate Vadung chan geijin cheuvin.  
\v 8 Vetan, Keiman hiche gam leiset jouse hi nangho kapeh nahiuve! Cheuvin lang galo uvin, ajeh chu Pakaijin napu napa teu Abraham, Isaac chule Jacob chule achilhah te jouseu lodinga akihahselna gam ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Mose'n ama phung cheh lamkai alhendoh  
\p
\v 9 Mose’n aseijom'in, “Hiche phatlai chun kana seiyin, 'Nangho jouse chunga kavaihomna pohgih hi keima din alen behseh jeng tai.  
\v 10 Pakai na Pathen'in na punsah uvin, ahsi jat in na semdoh tauve!  
\v 11 Chule napu napa khanga pat Pakai na Pathen chun asang sang'in napunbe sah uhen, akitepna bangin phatthei naboh uhen!  
\v 12 Nangho vetsui hi abai tapoi! Naboina hou le na kinahna hou iti kachanga ka suhlhap jou ding ham?  
\v 13 Hijeh chun ama ama insung kaiya kon'in miching le thu hethem upa jana chang phabep lheng doh uvin, keiman amaho chu nangho lamkaiya ka pansah ding ahi.' tin kana seijin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin nei donbut uvin, ‘Na thilgon hi aphalheh jenge,' natiuvin ahi.  
\v 15 Keiman upa ching le thil hethem phabep ama insung kaiya konna na lhendoh hou chu nangho thutan vaihom dinga ka pansah ahi. Mi phabep chu mi asang chunga, mi jakhat chunga, mi somnga chunga chule mi som chunga dinga vaihom din apangun ahi.   
\p
\v 16 “Hichun keiman thutan vaihom ho henga ka seiyin, ‘Nanghon na sopiu Israel mite le gamdang mi nalah uva hung cheng hoa konna thutan ding nahin mudoh diu ahi. Na dinmun cheh uva dettah in pang cheh uvin  
\v 17 chule thutanna hoa sihneina ima nei hihhel uvin. Ahao hihen avai ho chung hijongleh thutan ding chu phatah in kholchil sohkeiyun. Mi khattou lunghan jeh in kicha hih uvin, ajeh chu adih e tia thu natan uchu Pathen dei ahi. Amavang thutan ding ahahsa behseh aum leh keima henga hin lhut uvin, keiman hichu katan ding ahi.'   
\p
\v 18 Hichun keiman ijakai bol ding jouse naheng uva ka seipeh sohkeiyun ahi.   
\s1 Gamvelhi hon gam aga kholchil'u  
\p
\v 19 Chuti chun, Pakai I-Pathen uvin eithupeh bangun, Sinai Mol dalhan tijat umtah gamthip noiya ikitol uvin, Amor mite chenna lam ijon tauvin ahi. Kadesh-barnea ilhun uchun,  
\v 20 najah uva kaseijin, ‘Tun nangho Amor mite chenna gam Pakai I-Pathen'in eipeh nau gam ilhung tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Veuvin! Pakaijin na masang lam uva gam nakoi peh tauvin ahi. Cheuvin lang galo tauvin ajeh chu Pakai, napu na pate Pathen chun nangho dinga kitepna anei ahi. Kicha hih uvin! Lungthoi hih un!'” ati.   
\p
\v 22 “Ahinlah nabon'un kaheng'a nahung sei uvin, ‘Amasan, agam kholchil dingin mi sol masaute. Ama hon hoiche lampia iche uva, hoiche khopi a ilut diu chu aphapen dia eithumop diu ahi,'” natiuve.   
\p
\v 23 “Hichu keiya din geldan phatah ahin, hijeh chun gam velhi ding mi som le ni ka lhengdoh in, ama ama insung kailhah a konna mikhat cheh ahiuve.  
\v 24 Amaho gamthip lama chun achepeh uvin chule Eshcol phaicham alhungun akholle tauvin ahi.  
\v 25 Ama hon agam gasoh phabep ahinpo uvin ahi. Chule ama hon thu ahinlhut un, 'Pakai, Pathen'in eipeh nau gam khu tahbeh in apha lheh jenge'” atiuvin ahi.   
\s1 Pakai douna a Israel phunchelna  
\p
\v 26 Ahinlah nang hon Pakai, na Pathen'u thupeh nadeh uvin agamsunga che ding nanom pouve. \x + \xo 1:26 \xt Danbu Ni Na 9:23; Heb 3:16\x*  
\v 27 Na ponbuh sung uva na kiphin'un nasei uvin, ‘Pakaijin eimudau hinte. Hijeh a chu Amor mite khut a pehdoh a satchen sah ding bep a Egypt gam apat eihin puidoh u ahi.  
\v 28 Hoiya iche diu hitam? Isopi hou hin thulhut chun ima ihilou u akihe tai. ‘Agam mite khu eiho sang'in asangjo uvin chule eiho sangin athahatjo uve, chule akhopi hou alen theijin, khopi bang hon jong vanthamjol aphai! Hiche gam achun keihon Anak chilhah milentah ho chu kahin mu uve!’” atiuve.   
\p
\v 29 Ahinlah keiman nangho ka seipeh uvin, ‘Amaho jeh chun tija hih un chule ki jong kicha hih un!  
\v 30 Na masang uva Pakai na Pathen'u achenai. Egypt gam'a athilbol namu bang uva Pakaijin nangho dinga gal asat ding ahi.  
\v 31 Mipan acha akhohsah bangin Pakai na Pathen uvin najot nau gamthip noiya iti nahinpui u namu tauve. Tua hi Aman hilai mun'a hi nahin pui u ahi.' \x + \xo 1:31 \xt Act 13:18\x*   
\p
\v 32 Ahinlah hichan geiya anatoh jouvin, nang hon Pakai na Pathen'u na tahsan hih laiyuve, \x + \xo 1:32 \xt Heb 3:19\x*  
\v 33 ama chu na masang lam uva achen munpha laipen achun ngahmun asemin, janteng meivah khoma naveng jiuvin chule sunteng meibol khoma na lhonpi jiuvin ahi.’   
\p
\v 34 Pakaijin na phunchelna hou ahin jadoh tan ahileh, alunghang lheh jeng tan ahi. Aman lungtheng tah in kitepna aneijin,\x + \xo 1:34 \xt Heb 3:18\x*  
\v 35 'Nang ho khanga gilou miten napu napa teu khanga pat peh dinga katepsa gam khu mu dinga hing nalai naum louhel diu,  
\v 36 Jephunneh chapa Caleb bouvin amu ding ahi. Aman hiche gam hi amu ding ahi ajeh chu lunglha louva Pakai thupeh juijing ahi. Ama le achilhah ten hiche gam sung phabep masanga agamu masat bang uva alo diu ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Nangho jeh in keima chung jenga jong Pakai alung phamo tai. Aman aseijin, “Mose, nangma jeng jong Gamtep Gam nalut louding ahi!”  
\v 38 Nangma khela, Nun chapa Joshua chun, mipi aboncha gamsung chan a alamkai ding ahi. Ama chu tilkhouvin, ajeh chu aman Israel miten alodiu gamsung chan a alamkai ding ahitai.  
\v 39 Keiman gam khu na chate kho hepha loulai ho ka chensah ding ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon eimat gam diu ahi tin na kichauve, hinlah ama hon alo diu ahi.  
\v 40 Tun nangho kileuvin gamthip jotpeh un, Twipi San lam jonin che tauvin.   
\p
\v 41 “Chule na chonset phong uvin, 'Pakai douna a chonse kahi tauve! Pakai ka Pathen uvin eithupeh bang uva, gamsunga khu kache uva gal kaga sat diu ahi.' Ajeh chu na mite hon agal manchah cheh akichoiyun, gamsung lo ding khu baikhen chan agel un ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Amavang nangho seipeh ding Pakaijin kakoma thu aseiye, ‘Gal nakon loudiu ahi, ajeh chu keiman ka lhonpi pouvin ahi. Nangho cham a na cheuva ahileh, nagal miteuvin nasat gam diu ahi.'   
\p
\v 43 Hiche hi keiman ka seipeh nahiuve, hinlah na ngaisah pouvin, avelin Pakai doumah bolin galsat in nakon un ahi.  
\v 44 Chuin Amor mite chu khoite jat bangin ahung kon tauvin, Seir le Hormah chan geiyin nahin delkhum tauve.  
\v 45 Chuin Pakai henga kappum in nakile uvin, hinlah Aman na taonau asang tapoi.  
\v 46 Hiti chun Kadesh mun'a phat sottah nacheng tauvin ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 Gamthip noiya kum phabep  
\p
\v 1 Chuin gamthip lang jondin ikiheiyun Twipisan lam jonin icheuvin, Pakaijin eiseipeh bangin, Seir molsang lama chun phat sottah lungdong in ivahle leuvin ahi. \x + \xo 2:1 \xt Minbu 21:4\x*   
\p
\v 2 Hichun Pakaijin hiti hin eiseipeh in,  
\v 3 'Nangho gamthip lah a lungdong in naum sot lheh tauve; sahlam gamkai mano tauvin.  
\v 4 Thupeh hichengse hi mipi henga seiyin: “Nanghon na sopiu Esau chilhah Edom mite chenna Seir mun na jotpa diu ahi. Edom mite chu kichat nan alhun den theiju ahi, ching theiyun.” \x + \xo 2:4 \xt Semtilbu 36:8\x*  
\v 5 Aheng uva ima na ngeh lou diu ahi. Ajeh chu keiman Seir gam jouse amaho kapeh ahitan, nangho gambeh neocha jong na kipe theilou diu ahi.  
\v 6 An leh twi na ngaichat uva ahileh, aman napeh uva na kichoh cheh diu ahi.  
\v 7 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin nabol natoh jouseu phatthei abohtai. Aman gamthip noiya kal nason chan geiyuva pat ave lhi jinge. Kum somli sungin Pakai na Pathen uvin ima lhasam louvin na umpiuve.   
\p
\v 8 Chuin Esau chilhah ho chenna Seir mun igalkai uvin ahi. Arabah phaicham kiti Elath le Ezion-geber akon hungna lampi vang ipeldoh uvin ahi.  
\p Hiti chun sahlam nelgam lam juijin Moab lam ino tauvin ahi.  
\v 9 Chuin Pakaijin eigih uvin, “Lot chilhah Moab mite na suhgim lou diu, gal jong nabol khum louhel diu ahi. amaho gou dia Ar kapeh ahitan, amaho gambeh neokhat jong nangho kapeh theilou diu ahi.'” \x + \xo 2:9 \xt Semtilbu 19:37\x*   
\p
\v 10 (Mihat Emim mite chu Ar mun'a ana cheng kha uvin ahi. Amaho chu asang thei un chule atha ujong ahat in Anak mite tobang chu ahiuve.  
\v 11 Emim te le Anak ho chu Rephaim tinjong akiheuvin, Moab miten vang Emim tin akou un ahi.  
\v 12 Masang chun Hor mite chu Seir mun'a ana cheng uvin, hinlah amaho chu Esau chilhah teho toh gal ana kibol uvin, Hor mite chu ana jamdoh tauvin ahi. Israel miten Canaan mite adel gam uva agam pumpi Pakaijin apeh tobang’u ahi.)   
\p
\v 13 Mose’n aseijomin, ‘Chuin Pakaijin iheng uva aseiye, 'Kipatdoh un. Zered lui galkaiyun,' ati. Chuin igalkai tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 “Kadesh barnea ihin dalhah uva kipat Zered Luidung ilhun chan uvin kum somthum le get achetai! Pakaijin hunglhung dia atep bangin pasal galsat thei jouse gamthip lah a athigam tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 2:14 \xt Minbu 14:28-35\x*  
\v 15 Pakaijin asuhmanghel kahseuvin, amaho chu adou in ahi.”   
\p
\v 16 “Galbol thei pasal jouse athi gam phat chun,  
\v 17 Pakaijin kaheng'a aseijin,  
\v 18 Tunia hi Ar mun'a Moab gamgi na galkai diu  
\v 19 chule Lot chilhah, Ammon mite chenna nalut diu ahi. Hinlah amaho na suhgim lou diu gal jong nabol khum lou diu ahi. Hiche gam hi Ammon mite kapeh ahitan, agam hi nang ho kapeh thei louding ahitai.” \x + \xo 2:19 \xt Semtilbu 19:38\x*   
\p
\v 20 (Hiche gam chu Rephaim mite gam'a ana kihe ahin, Ammon miten vang Zamzummim mite tin akou uve.  
\v 21 Amaho jong chu asang thei un chule athau ahat thei uvin Anak mite tobang ahiuve. Hinlah Pakaijin amaho chu asugamhel tauvin ahileh Ammon miten agam alo tauve.  
\v 22 Pakaijin Seir mun'a Esau chilhah te dinga na atoh bang bangin abol in chule Hor mite asugam in ahileh hiche mun'a chun amaho acheng tauvin ahi. Hijeh chun Esau chilhah te tuni chan geiyin hiche mun achun acheng tauvin ahi.  
\v 23 Hiche tobang hin Crete apat Caphtorit mite chunga thilsoh ana lhungin, Avvit mite chu anasu-gam hel uvin, amaho chu Gaza gamkol kho ho a cheng anahiuve. )   
\p
\v 24 Mose’n aseijom nalaijin, “Chuti chun Pakaijin aseiye, 'Tun kipatdoh tauvin! Arnon Vakom galkai uvin. Veuvin, Keiman nakhut uva Amor mi Sihon, Hesbon lengpa kapeh doh ding, chule agam pumpi kapeh diu ahi. Nokhum uvin lang agam khu lo tauvin.  
\v 25 Tu nikhoa kipat nangho jeh a agam a cheng mihem te chunga tijatna kalhun sah ding ahi. Nachung changu thulhut ahin jah doh tengu leh kichat nan alhun den diu ahi.”   
\s1 Sihon chunga galjona  
\p
\v 26 Mose’n aseikit in, ‘Kademoth gamthip apat Heshbon lengpa Sihon henga chamna thuseiyin palai khat kasol in:   
\b  
\pmo
\v 27 'Na gamsung ka jotpa diu ahi. Lampi jeng kajot diu chule akimvel lah kahopa lou diu ahi.  
\v 28 Anneh ding le twidon ding neipe uvin, hichu aman kapeh diu ahi. Thil ijakai chung chona kangai chat pipen uchu ahileh nagam ka jotpa uva kagal kai diu hi ahi.  
\v 29 Seir mun'a Esau chilhah ten agam kajotpa uva ka galkaina diu eiphal peh uvin, hiche tobang chun Ar mun'a cheng Moab mite jengin jong abol uvin ahi. Hijeh chun Pakai ka Pathen uvin eipeh nau gam Jordan vadung ka galkai theina diuvin na gamsung nei jotsah tauvin,' katiuve.   
\b  
\p
\v 30 Hinlah Heshbon mun'a Sihon lengpan agamsung hopa ding chu anom tapoi, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'in Sihon lengpa lungthim chu asutah in chule Pakaijin eiki thopi uvin ahileh galjona chu eipe tauve.   
\p
\v 31 Chuin Pakaijin hiti hin aseijin, 'Vetan, Keiman Sihon Lengpa leh agam leiset na khut uva kapeh doh pan ahitai. Tun kipan uvin agam pumpi lo dingin kon tauvin,' ati.   
\p
\v 32 Chuin Sihon Lengpan eiho chunga gal bol dingin Jahaz mun'ah kholhang asamtai.  
\v 33 Ahinlah Pakai I-Pathen uvin eiho khut a apedoh tan ahileh, achapa te, chule amite jouse isatgam hel tauvin ahi.  
\v 34 Akhopi jouse leh amite jouse abonchan ithat gam hel tauvin—pasal, numei, le chapang jaona ahi. Mihem khat a khat cha jeng jong asohcha tapon ahi.  
\v 35 Khopi sunga gancha jouse abonchan ichom tauvin chule thil ijakai manlu jouse jong ichang tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Pakai I-Pathen uvin eipanpi uvin ahileh Aroer kiti Arnon Vakom, Gorge khopi chule agam pumpi Gilead chan geiyin abonchan ijousoh hel tauvin ahi. Eiho dingin baang lhou tah neiya khopi aumpoi.  
\v 37 Ijeh inem itileh, Ammon mite gam dalhan Jabbok vadung chule gamsunga khopi ho— Pakai I-Pathen thupeh bang banga idalhah jal’u ahi.   
\c 3  
\s1 Og chunga galjona  
\p
\v 1 Chuban in Bashan lam jonin ikitol uvin, hiche Edrei mun'a chun Og lengpa le agalsat mihon eino khum uvin ahi.  
\v 2 Hinlah Pakaijin kaheng'a aseijin, ‘Ama chu kicha hih un, ajeh chu keiman Og lengpa le agalsat ho chunga galjona kapeh diu ahin, chule agam jouse jong kapeh ding nahiuve. Hesbon gamvaipo Amor mite Sihon Lengpa nabolna bang bang uvin bol'un,' ati.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin Pakai, Pathen'in Og lengpa le amite abonchan eiho khut a apedoh in, amaho chu ithatgam keiyuvin ahi. Mihem khatcha jeng jong ahing tapoi.  
\v 4 Alalna khopi somgup ijousohkei tauvin—hichu Argob gamkai Bashan lenggam pumpi ahi. Khopi khat jeng cha jong asohcha tapoi.  
\v 5 Hiche khopi ho jouse chu akimvel aboncha pal phatah a kigen le kelkot phatah a kisem sohkei ahi. Chule kho phabep akimvel'a pal kigen lou jong ilo tauvin ahi.  
\v 6 Hesbon lengpa Sihon isuhgam bang uvin, Bashan lenggam pumpi jong abonchan ijousoh hel tauvin ahi. Khopi tin’a mihem jouse —numei, pasal le chapang ithat sohkei uvin ahi.  
\v 7 Khopi jousea gancha ho ihinghoi uvin, thil ijakai manlu jouse jong ichom tauvin ahi.  
\v 8 Amor mite lengpa lalna gam lhumlam Jordan vadung jong ilo’uvin, hichu Arnon Gorge apat Hermon molsang chan gei ahi.  
\v 9 (Sidon mite chun Hermon molsang chu Sirion tin akou un chule Amor miten Senir tin akou uve.)  
\v 10 Tun eihon Gilead le Bashan gamkai pumpi ijousoh tauvin, Og lengpa gamvai pohna Salecah le Edrei chan geiyin ijousoh hel tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 (Bashan lengpa Og chu Rephaim mite dinga leng nukhah pen ahitan. Alupna chu thih a kisem ahin, chule asan dan adung feet som le thum, availam letdan feet gup alhing in ahi. Hiche lengpa lim hi Ammon mite khopi Rabbah mun'a aum nalayin ahi.)   
\s1 Jordan solam gam kihop  
\p
\v 12 Hiche gam pumpi chu ilo tauvin ahileh, keiman Reuben le Gad insung adingin Aroer apat Arnon Gorge chan gei in chule Gilead gam kehkhat le khopi phabep jaonan kapedoh tan ahi.  
\v 13 Manasseh chilhah te dingin Gilead gam kehkhat le Bashan gam pumpi—Og lengpa lalna masa gam chu—Manasseh phung kehkhat ho ka pedoh tan ahi. (Hiche hi Bashan gam Argob gamkai pumpi hi Rephaim te gam'a kihe ahi.  
\v 14 Manasseh insunga lamkai amin Jair, ama hin Bashan, Argob gamkai pumpi ajousoh hel in, Geshur mite le Maacah mite gamgi chan gei ahi. Jair chun hiche gam chu ama min aputsah in, Jair Khopi ho asah tan, tuni chanin akihe jing na laiyin ahi.)  
\v 15 Keiman Gilead chu Makir phung kapedoh tai.  
\v 16 Chule keiman Reuben le Gad phung a dingin Gilead gam phabep jong kapen ahi. Arnon Vakom lhanglam lailung apat Ammon mite chenna Jabbok vadung chan ahi.  
\v 17 Jordan phaicham, Galilee dillen apat Twi thi dillen chan, Jordan Vadung chu lhumlam gamgi in apang'e. Solam langa din Pisgah lhaang chu ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hiche phatlai chun keiman ama phung cheh chu lhumlam Jordan a cheng dingin thupeh ka neiyin ahi: Hiche gam pumpi hi Pakai na Pathen uvin nangho gou dia napeh sau hijongleh, na galsat hou chu Jordan galkai uva gal manchah toh amaho khel dia gonsa a um diu ahi. \x + \xo 3:18 \xt Joshua 1:12-15\x*  
\v 19 Chule najiteu, nachateu chule na gancha jouseu keiman kapeh nau khopi hoa um diu ahi.  
\v 20 Pakaijin nang ho banga Israel mite jouse dinga venbitna napeh uva chule agam nalo teng ule Pakai na Pathen uvin Jordan Vadung galkai chan apeh tengu leh, naboncha uva Keiman kapehna gam a chu nakile diu ahi.'   
\s1 Mose’n gam achotlut ding kikham  
\m
\v 21 “Hiche phat chun Keiman Joshua hiche mopohna hi kapen: Nanghon hiche leng teni chunga Pakai na Pathen natoh abonchan namusoh tauve. Aman Jordan lhumlam lenggam ho a chutobang bang abol ding ahi.  
\v 22 Chu a nam ho khu kicha hih in, Pakai na Pathenin nangma dinga gal asat ding ahi.” ati.   
\p
\v 23 “Chuin keima Pakai henga katao vin hiti hin kaseiye, \x + \xo 3:23 \xt Minbu 27:12-14; Danbu Ni Na 32:48-52\x*  
\v 24 'O Thanei chungnung Pakai, nangman keima nasohpa henga naban thahat naki lahsah in ka musoh tai. Koiham pathen dang van leh leiset a hitobang thil kidang bol thei ding?  
\v 25 Nalung ahileh, Jordan hi nei galkai sah inlang, gamhoi tah Lebanon molsang ho nei musah tan,” kati.   
\p
\v 26 “Hinlah nangho jeh in Pakai kaheng'a alunghang tan, ka taona angaisah tapoi. Chuin aman aseijin, 'Hichu aphatai! Imadang seibeda tan,' ati.  
\v 27 Pisgah Molvum'a kaltouvin lang, sim le mal sah le lhang gave tan. Phatah in ven, amavang Jordan vadung na galkai louding ahi.  
\v 28 Nangma khel in, Joshua tilkhouvin lang suhat in chule thaneina petan, ajeh chu Joshua in mipi aboncha Jordan agalkaipi ding ahi. Masanga namusa gam jouse aboncha aman alo diuva mipi apeh ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 29 Chuin Beth-peor kom'a phaicham achun ium tauvin ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Mose’n thunung ahina diuva Israel ahilchah  
\p
\v 1 Ahile tun, Israel, chinthei tah in thupeh le danthu kahil ding hou hi phatah in ngaiyun. Pakai na Pathen uvin napu, napa teu khanga pat napeh nau gam nalhun theina diu le agama nachen theina diuvin jabol'un.  
\v 2 Ka thupeh ho ima lahdoh le koibe bol hih uvin. Pakai na Pathen thupeh chengse chu jabol jengun.  
\p \x + \xo 4:2 \xt Rev 22:18,19\x*  
\v 3 Baal-peor mun'a Pakaijin nangho dinga ipi abol chu namu sohkeiyun ahi. Hiche mun'a chun Pakai na Pathen uvin Baal, Peor pathen hou jouse abonchan asugam sohkeiye. \x + \xo 4:3 \xt Minbu 25:1-9\x*  
\v 4 Hinlah Pakai na Pathen uva kitah jouse tuni chanin nadam nalaiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Vetan, Pakai, ka Pathen a konna jui ding dan hichengse hi nangho dinga thupeh ahi. Ajeh chu hichengse hi gamsung nalut tengu leh phatah a najui kimsohkei diu ahi.  
\v 6 Hichengse hi najui uva ahileh, na kimvel uva cheng namdang te sanga athem leh achinga naum diu ahi. Hitobang nun le khan ahin jahdoh tengu leh, 'Itobanga hiche nam lentah te hi chinga dengchang'u hitam! ati diu ahi.  
\v 7 Ajeh chu nam len te pathen akom cha uva aum banga Pakai eiho Pathen ama chu ikou teng einai jeng theiyu tobang namdang ten anei khah ngai em?  
\v 8 Hitobanga chu keiman jong na masang uva ka koipeh danthu hijatpi hi, kicheh tah a ka koipeh bang uva koi dang nam in hitobang anei khah ngai em?   
\p
\v 9 “Ahinlah veuvin! Nanghon namit tah uva namu uva chun chintheiyun. Hiche hi na damsung uva nalungthim uva konna na kiselmang sah lou diu ahi! Na chateu leh na natu teu chan geiya hilson teiyun.  
\v 10 Chule Sinai Mol a Pakai na Pathen'u masanga nadin nikhou chu sumil hihbeh un, chua chun kaheng'a aseijin, 'Mipi ho abonchan kaheng'a hin kouvin, chule Keiman ka tahsa tah a kahil diu ahi. Chutileh ama hon ahinkho uva keima gin ding dan ajil diu, chule amahon achateu jong ahil uva eigin diu ahi.'   
\p
\v 11 “Nangho nahung nai uvin chule Mol bul'a nahung din uchun Mol'a konin meikong vanthamjol langa akikho touvin ahi. Mol chu meibol vom nasatah in atomlha tan ha thimin athim tai. \x + \xo 4:11 \xt Potdohbu 19:16-18; Heb 12:18,19\x*  
\v 12 Chuin Pakaijin meikong lailunga konin najah uva thu ahin seitan ahi. Nang hon agin naja uvin ahin alim namu pouvin; ogin bou ahi.  
\v 13 Aman kitepna asemin—Thupeh som— nanit jing diuva thupeh, chule songpheng ni chunga ajihdoh in ahi. \x + \xo 4:13 \xt Potdohbu 31:18; 34:28; Danbu Ni Na 9:10\x*  
\v 14 Hiche phat chu ahi Pakaijin eithupeh a nangho kahilson uva chutengleh nang hon gamsung nalut uva nalo tengu leh a danthu najui uva na jabol diu ahi. \x + \xo 4:14 \xt Potdohbu 21:1\x*   
\s1 Milim hou thudol'a gihna  
\p
\v 15 Hijeh chun nangho ching theiyun! Sinai Mol a Pakaijin meikong lailunga pat najah uva thu asei nikho chun nang hon tahmel in namu pouve.  
\v 16 Hijeh chun nang hon milim doi itobang lim'a kisem—numei ahilouleh pasal mel a kisem, \x + \xo 4:16 \xt Potdohbu 20:4; Thempu Dan 26:1; Danbu Ni Na 5:8; 27:15\x*  
\v 17 gancha hihen chungleng vacha hijongleh, \x + \xo 4:17 \xt Rm 1:23\x*  
\v 18 tol-lhang lah a ganhing hihen, twipi thuhpen noiya um nga lim'a kisem hijongleh a angsunga na bohkhup lou diu ahi.  
\v 19 Chule chunglang navet teng nisa, lha, le ahsite chule vanthamjola thil ho jong bohkhup a akin bol ding na ngaito louhel diu ahi. Hichengse khu aboncha Pakai, Pathen'in leiset a cheng mihemte apeh ahi.  
\v 20 Ajeh chu nangho hi Pakaijin Egypt gamsung meilhum lah a kiloidoh a deitum mong mong dinga tunia hi nasemu ahin, hichu nasuhmil lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 4:20 \xt Potdohbu 19:5; Danbu Ni Na 7:6; 14:2; 26:18; Tit 2:14; 1 Pet 2:9\x*   
\p
\v 21 Hinlah nangho jeh in Pakai ka chunga alunghang tai. Aman kitepna asemin chutobanga gam pha Pakai na Pathen uvin gou hoitah a napehna uva khu lutthei louva keima Jordan vadung galkai louding kahi tai. \x + \xo 4:21 \xt Minbu 20:12\x*  
\v 22 Hihe gam lo dinga Jordan na galkai diu, ahin keima kahung galkai louding ahi. Keima vang hiche solam vadung a hi thiden ding kahitai.  
\v 23 Hijeh chun chingthei un Pakai na Pathen uvin kitepna napeh hou sukeh hihbeh un. Itobang lim'a hijongleh pathen lim semthu ding gohih un, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen dinga doumah umtah ahi.  
\v 24 Pakai na Pathen hi mi sumang meikong ahin; Ama hi Pathen thangthip ahi. \x + \xo 4:24 \xt Heb 12:29\x*   
\p
\v 25 Ahunglhung ding phat hoa, tu le cha nahin neiyuva gamsunga na hung chen tengu leh, milim doi kiti sema a-angsunga na bohkhup louhel diu ahi. Hitobang thil hi Pakai na Pathen'u mitmu dinga phalou le lunghan sahna ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Tunia van leh leiset kakou hi nangho hettohsahna ding ahi. Ka kitepna na suhkeh uva ahileh, Jordan vadung galkaiya gamsung nalo uhi hetman louva na manthah jeng diu ahi. Chumun'a chu chomcha bou nachen diu; chuteng na kisumang diu ahi. \x + \xo 4:26 \xt Danbu Ni Na 28:36\x*  
\v 27 Ajeh chu namdang te lah a naki thecheh uva, themcha bou nahoidoh diu ahi.  
\v 28 Chu a, gamdang mite gamsunga, song le thinga milim kisemthu—pathen khomulou, khojalou, netheilou le ima nam jalou chu nahou diu ahi.  
\v 29 Hinlah chu a konna Pakai na Pathen'u nahin hol kit diu ahi. Chule nalungthim pumpiuva nahin hol tengu leh, namu bep diu ahi. \x + \xo 4:29 \xt Jeremiah 29:13\x*   
\p
\v 30 Ahunglhung ding phat hoa, hitobang din mun'a naum uva gim genthei nan nalhun den tengu leh, Pakai na Pathen angsung nahin bel diu, chule athusei jouse na ngai diu ahi.  
\v 31 Ajeh chu na Pakai na Pathen uhi khotona dim Pathen ahin; napu napa teu khang apat akitepna ageldoh jingin Aman na nuse pouvin tin na sumang pouvinte ahilouleh na suhmil lou diu ahi.   
\s1 Pathen khat seh ahi  
\p
\v 32 “Tun leiset ahung kisem apat tuchana Pathen'in ichan geiya mihemte akhohsah ham, ti thusim le vanthamjol'a ijakai jouse kholdoh uvin. Hitobang thil kidang ho hi najah a namu khah uvem?  
\v 33 Nanghon meikonga Pathen akilah a, awgin najah bang uva namdang ten hitobang thil kidang atokhah tah uvem?  
\v 34 Pathen dangin nampi khat gim hesohna a kon apuidoh a, thil kidang ijakai aki lahsah gal asat peh, ban thahat pan a kithopina, kidang tah a na atohna um kha tam? Ahinlah nangho Pakai na Pathen uvin Egypt gam'a naum lai uva anatoh ijakai namu sohkei tauvin ahi.  
\v 35 Aman ijakai na muchen sah tauvin hiche a konna na hetdoh diu chu Pakai chu Pathen ahin ama tobang adang umlou ahi. \x + \xo 4:35 \xt Mk 12:32\x*  
\v 36 Pakaijin van'a kon'in awgin na jahsah uvin, thupeh ijakai aneijin ahi. Pakai meikonga akilah in nangho na houpi uvin ahi.  
\v 37 Ajeh chu Pakaijin napu napa teu angailun chule achilhah te chan gei phatthei aboh ahi. Pakaijin aban thahat apan in, Egypt gam'a konna nahin pui galkaiyu ahitai.  
\v 38 Nangho dingin namdang te gamla tah in achon doh in, Pakaijin nangho chenna ding gamnom tah na peuvin, tunin na cheng tauvin ahi.  
\v 39 Hijeh a chu hiche hi na geldoh jing diu leh na lungthim uva na chin jing diu ahi: Pakai hi van'a jong leiset a jong Pathen ahin, ama tobang dang aumpoi.  
\v 40 Tunia ka thupeh chengse aboncha na juikim sohkeiyuva ahileh, ijakai pha chamkim sohkei ding na chateu chan geiya phatthei chang diu ahi. Imatih chana gamsunga kipah leh lungmonga nachen diu, na hinkhou asotna dinga Keiman thupeh hichengse hi phat jousea dinga kapeh nahiuve.”   
\s1 Solam'a Bitna khopi ho  
\p
\v 41 Chuin Mose’n solam Jordan Vadunga khopi thum asepkhen in ahi. \x + \xo 4:41 \xt Joshua 20:8,9\x*  
\v 42 Koi hileh kitomona masa umlouva mikhat in midang khat atha khah a ahileh, ahoidohna dinga hiche mun a chu jamlut ding ahi.  
\v 43 Khopi thum ho chu: Reuben phunga dinga gamthip noiya Bezer khopi; Gad phunga dinga Gilead gamsunga Ramoth khopi; Manasseh phunga dinga Bashan sunga Golan khopi hi ding ahi.   
\s1 Pathen danthua kihilna  
\p
\v 44 Thupeh hichengse hi Mose’n Israel mite henga aseipeh ahi.  
\v 45 Hichengse hi danthu jui ding’a Mose’n Israel miten Egypt gam adalhah uva apeh,  
\v 46 Beth-peor toh kinai solam Jordan vadung phaicham ngahmun aum laiyuva apeh ahi. (Phat masa chun hiche gam hi Amor mite Lengpa Sihon in Heshbon mun'a konna ana vaipoh ahi. Hinlah Egypt gam'a konna Mose leh Israel mite ahung doh uchun ana sugam hel tauvin ahi.  
\v 47 Chuin Israel miten Bashan lengpa Og lalna gam leh anei agou jouse achom chai keiyuvin, solama Amor mite leng teni jaona ahi.  
\v 48 Israel miten Aroer apat Arnon Vakom chule Sirion mol Hermon tia jong kihe chan geiyin ajousoh hel tauve.  
\v 49 Chuin ama hon solam gamkai Jordan vadung pang leh Twipi Thi chan geiyin ajousoh uvin, Pisgah noilam chan gei ahi.)   
\c 5  
\s1 Thupeh som ho  
\p
\v 1 Mose’n Israel mite akoukhom in aheng uva aseipeh in, “Israel miten phatah in ngaiyun. Tunin Dan thupeh chengse hi jasohkeiyun, kihilnan neiyun lang najui kimsohkei diu ahi!  
\v 2 Pakai I-Pathen uvin Sinai Mol a kimaiton kitepna eisempi tauvin ahi.  
\v 3 Pakaijin hiche kitepna hi ipu-ipateu toh asem ahipon, amavang tunikhoa eiho toh asem ahi.  
\v 4 Mol achun Pakaijin kimaiton meikong lailunga konin nangho na houlimpi uvin ahi.  
\v 5 Nangho leh Pakai kah a keima ka dinge, ajeh chu nang hon meikong nakicha uvin mol chu na nailut ngam tapouve. Pakaijin kaheng'a thu aseijin, athusei doh aboncha nangho kapeson in ahi. Pakai thuseidoh chu hiche hi ahi:   
\b  
\li1
\v 6 Keima Pakai na Pathen kahin, Egypt gam'a soh a konna na huhdoh pau chu kahi.   
\li1
\v 7 Kei tailou pathen dang nanei lou diu ahi.   
\li1
\v 8 Nang hon nangho dinga lim semthu, itobang lim a hijongleh van le leiset chule twikhanglen sunga nanei theilou diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:8 \xt Thempu Dan 26:1; Danbu Ni Na 4:15-18; 27:15\x*  
\v 9 Hitobang lim semthu ho angsunga chu naboh khup uva nahou louhel diu ahi. Ajeh chu keima Pakai na Pathen u kahin, pathen dang semthua konna thangtomji kahi, hiche chonsetna chu na chateu khang geiya pap kalhunsah ding; keima ei pam pai insung pumpi chunga, khangthum leh li chan geiya lethuhna ka lhunsah ding ahi. \x + \xo 5:9 \xt Potdohbu 34:6,7; Minbu 14:18; Danbu Ni Na 7:9,10\x*  
\v 10 Hinlah ka thupeh nit a keima eingailu jing ho chunga, akhang akhanga ngailutna kalhunsah ding ahi.   
\li1
\v 11 Pakai na Pathen min na suhboh louhel diu ahi. Koi hileh Pakai min suboh chan chu ngaidam chang louding ahi. \x + \xo 5:11 \xt Thempu Dan 19:12\x*   
\li1
\v 12 Pakai na Pathen thupeh banga Sabbath nikhotheng chu nanit jing diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:12 \xt Potdohbu 16:23-30; 31:12-14\x*  
\v 13 Natohna ding nigup naneiyun ahi, \x + \xo 5:13 \xt Potdohbu 23:12; 31:15; 34:21; 35:2; Thempu Dan 23:3\x*  
\v 14 hinlah nisagi lhinni Sabbath nikho hi Pakai na Pathen dinga kicholdona nikho theng ahi. Hiche nikhoa hi koima chan insung natoh abol theilou ding ahi. Hiche hi nangho nahiuvin, na chapa teu le na chanu teu, nasoh pasal ho le numei hou, bongchal ho leh sa-ngan ho chule na gancha jouse jaona, chule gamdang mi nalah uva hung cheng ho jaona hi ding ahi. Nangma banga nasoh numeiho le pasal ho jong kichol diu ahi.  
\v 15 Hiche hi nasuhmil lou diu ahi, khatvei chu Egypt gamsunga soh a um nahiuvin, hinlah Pakai na Pathen uvin aban thahat pan a nahin puidoh u ahi. Hiche jeh a chu Pakai na Pathen uvin Sabbath nikhoa na kichol diuva thupeh anei ahi.   
\li1
\v 16 Pakai na Pathen thupeh bangin nanu, napa jabol un. Chutileh Pakai, Pathen'in napeh nau gamsunga na hinkhou sot ding ahi. \x + \xo 5:16 \xt Danbu Ni Na 27:16; Matt 15:4; 19:19; Mk 7:10; 10:19; Lk 18:20; Eph 6:2; \xt Eph 6:3\x*   
\li1
\v 17 Toltha nabol lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:17 \xt Semtilbu 9:6; Thempu Dan 24:17; Matt 5:21; 19:18; Mk 10:19; Lk 18:20; Rm 13:9; Jac 2:11\x*   
\li1
\v 18 Jonthanhoi nabol lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:18 \xt Thempu Dan 20:10; Matt 5:27; 19:18; Mk 10:19; Lk 18:20; Rm 13:9; Jac 2:11\x*   
\li1
\v 19 Guchat nabol lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:19 \xt Thempu Dan 19:11; Matt 19:18; Mk 10:19; Lk 18:20; Rm 13:9\x*   
\li1
\v 20 Naheng nakom douna hettohsah a napan lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:20 \xt Potdohbu 23:1; Matt 19:18; Mk 10:19; Lk 18:20\x*   
\li1
\v 21 Naheng nakompa ji na deichat lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 5:21 \xt Rm 7:7; 13:9\x* Chule naheng nakompa in ahilouleh gam na deichat lou diu, asoh numei hihen pasal hijongleh, abongchal hihen asangan hijongleh, naheng nakompa nei ipi dang hijongleh na deichat lou diu ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 22 Hichengse hi Mol bul'a na kikhop lai uva Pakaijin aseidohsa ahitai. Meibol le muthim in atomna sunga meikong lailunga pat osangtah a Aman aseidoh ahi. Hiche aseidoh ho chu aboncha songpheng nia ajihlut a keima eipeh ahi. \x + \xo 5:22 \xt Heb 12:18,19\x*   
\p
\v 23 “Ahin nanghon muthim lah a konna a awgin najah uva, mol chu meikong kongjeju a aum pet chun na phung lamkaihou le upaho kaheng'a ahung uvin ahi.  
\v 24 Ama hon asei uvin, 'Veuvin! Pakai I-Pathen uvin aloupina le aletna eimusah uvin, chule meikong lailunga konin a awgin kajauve. Tunin Pathenin mihem keiho jah a thu aseije ti kamu uvin, chule keiho kahing nalai uve!  
\v 25 Tunvang ipi dinga thi ikichat kit diu ham? Pakai I-Pathen uvin iheng uva thu asei kit a ahileh, thinan eilhun den uva meikonga iki govam jeng theiyu ahi.  
\v 26 Haina hu neiya hing itobang hijongleh, eiho banga hingjing Pathen awgin ja a thi louva hing thei aum dem?  
\v 27 Nangho cheuvin lang Pakai I-Pathen uvin ipi asei em ga ngai tauvin. Chuteng hung kile kit unlang Pakaijin ipi asei em ti kaheng uva hung seiyun, keihon kangai uva kajui diu ahi.'   
\p
\v 28 Keima henga na ngeh chan’u Pakaijin ajasoh tan ahi. Pakaijin hiti hin aseiye, 'Mipi hon nangma henga ipi asei uvem ti keiman ka hesoh keiyin, chule ama hon thudih aseiyu ahi.  
\v 29 Oh, hitia hi ama hon lung ngaichatna anei jing diu chule hiche banga chu ama hon keima eigin jing diu, ka thupeh jong anit jing diu ahi! Hitia chu achon jing uva ahileh, amaho leh achilhah teu chan geiya phatthei chang jing diu ahi.  
\v 30 Chen lang aheng uva gasei tan, “Na ponbuh cheh uva kile tauvin.”  
\v 31 Hinlah nangma hiche mun'a hin ding den nalaiyin chonna dan thupeh aboncha ka seipeh ding nahi. Chule hichengse hi aboncha mipi ho henga na seipeh ding chutileh ama hon achen nau gamsunga chu gouva anei diu ahi.'”   
\p
\v 32 Chuin Mose’n mipi ho henga aseijin, “Nang hon chingthei tah in Pakai na Pathen thupeh aboncha jui ding go uvin.  
\v 33 Pakai na Pathen uvin na thupeh nau lampi chu jui jing uvin. Chutileh nalut uva nalona diu gamsunga hinkho sot tah nachen thei diu na phatthei diu ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Lungthim pumpia kipelut dinga kouna  
\p
\v 1 Pakai na Pathen uvin nangho seipeh dinga danthu eipeh hichengse hi ahi. Hiche gamsung nalut tengu leh, najui kimsohkei diu ahi,  
\v 2 chutileh nadam sung uva natu nacha teu khang geiya keima eigin jing diu ahi. Pakai thupeh aboncha nanit sohkei uva ahileh, lungmonga naum diu chule na hinkhou jong sot ding ahi.  
\v 3 Phatah in ngaiyun, Israel, ajeh chu hichengse hi najui kimsel diu ahi. Chutileh ijakai phachamkim sohkei ding, Pakai, napu napa teu Pathen kitepna banga khoiju le bongnoi lonna gam'a chu nachen diu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 O Israel ngaiyun! Pakai hi I-Pathen’u ahi, chule Pakai ama bou ahi. \x + \xo 6:4 \xt Mk 12:29\x*  
\v 5 Hijeh chun Pakai le na Pathen'u na lungthim pumpiu le na thanei sunin ngailu uvin. \x + \xo 6:5 \xt Matt 22:37; Mk 12:30; Lk 10:27\x*  
\v 6 Tunia ka thupeh chengse aboncha chunga kipehna nanei uva najui kimsohkei diu ahi. \x + \xo 6:6 \xt Danbu Ni Na 11:18-20\x*  
\v 7 Hichengse hi na chateu henga avel vel'a na seipeh diu ahi. Inmun'a na umpet u hihen, lam najot pet u hihen, nalup konu hihen, na kithodoh pet u hijongleh, aheng uva na seipeh jing diu ahi.  
\v 8 Hichengse chu na khut uva kikhi jingun lang chule na chalpang uva jong nakhi chah jing diu, hitia chu na suhmil lou diu ahi.  
\v 9 Na inkot phung uva jong jih unlang chule kelkot mai ajong najih sohkei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ajeh chu Pakai, na Pathen uvin napu napa teu Abraham, Isaac le Jacob henga akitepna gamsunga na puilut vah diu ahitai. Hiche khopi hoa hi ijakai bukimsel, hichu nang hon man beiya namu diu ahi. \x + \xo 6:10 \xt Semtilbu 12:7; \xt Semtilbu 26:3; \xt Semtilbu 28:13\x*  
\v 11 Insung hoa chu nei leh gou ijakai akilamsa hi ding ahi. Twikul ho jong akilaisa ahin, Olive thingphung le adang hoa konna jong aga naneh diu, hiche ho jouse hi nang hon tulouhel a aga nalo diu ahi. Hiche ho hi naneh tengu leh gamsung pumpi nalodim diu ahitai.  
\v 12 Pakai, Egypt gam'a soh a naum laiyuva na huhdoh pau na suhmil louna diuvin chingtheiyun.  
\v 13 Nanghon Pakai, na Pathen'u nagin diu chule ama kin jenga na kisah lel diu ahi. Kihahselna nanei ujongleh Pakai min bou napat diu ahi. \x + \xo 6:13 \xt Matt 4:10; Lk 4:8\x*   
\p
\v 14 Na kimvel uva namdang te pathen semthu angsunga na bohkhup lou diu ahi.  
\v 15 Ajeh chu nalah uva cheng Pakai na Pathen uhi thangthip Pathen ahi. Ana lunghanna chun leiset chunga konna natol mang jeng theiyu ahi.  
\v 16 Nanghon Massah mun'a na patep bang uva Pakai na Pathen'u na patep lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 6:16 \xt Matt 4:7; Lk 4:12; \xt Potdohbu 17:1-7\x*  
\v 17 Nanghon Pakai na Pathen'u thupeh phatah a nanit jing diu, Dan jouse najui kim sohkei diu ahi.  
\v 18 Pathen mitmua apha jeng bol uvin, chutileh ijakai pha chamkim sohkei ding ahi. Chuteng Pakaijin napu napa teu peh dinga akitepna gampha a chu nalut uva nalo diu ahi.  
\v 19 Pakaijin asei bangin, hiche gamsunga na galmi teu aboncha na delmang diu ahi.  
\v 20 Khonung le nacha teuvin nahin doh diu, “Hiche dan le thupeh hohi ipi tina hiya Pakai I-Pathen uvin jabol dinga eithupeh uham?' ahinti diu ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Chuteng nang hon hitia hi na donbut diu, 'Keiho Egypt gamsunga Pharaoh soh kana hiu ahi, ahinlah Pakaijin aban thahat a eihin puidoh u ahi.  
\v 22 Pakaijin Egypt gamsunga Pharaoh le amite henga thil kidang ijakai akilahsah in, ipu ipateu khanga pat akitepna gamsunga cheng dia eihin puiyu ahi.  
\v 23 Pakaijin Egypt gamsunga konna eihin puigal kaiyu ahi, ajeh chu ipu ipateu henga akitepna chu eipeh theina diu ahi.  
\v 24 Hijeh achu Pakai I-Pathen uvin hiche dan thupeh jui ding jouse hi eipeh uva, hichengse ijuikim sohkei uva ahileh ihinkhou sot ding chule imatih chan a phatthei ichan diu ahi. Hichu tuni chan geiya idamnau ahi.  
\v 25 Pakai I-Pathen uvin eithupeh hou ijabol uva ahileh eiho jouse them changa eisim diu ahi.   
\c 7  
\s1 Pathen nam lhen  
\p
\v 1 Pakai na Pathen uvin gamsunga nahin pui tengu leh, namdang tampi: Hit mite, Girgash mite, Amor mite, Canaan mite, Periz mite, Hiv mite le Jebus mite khu asuhtheng ding ahi. Hiche nam sagi ho hi nangho sanga hatjo le pungjo ahiuve. \x + \xo 7:1 \xt Act 13:19\x*  
\v 2 Pakai na Pathen uvin akhut a konna nangho nahin pehdoh tengu leh, nang hon abonchauva na suhgam sohkei diu ahi. Amaho toh kichamna ima semlouva abonchauva na thagam diu ahi.  
\v 3 Chule amaho toh chun na kichen theilou diu ahi. Na chanu teu le na chapa te hou chu amaho chanu te le chapa te toh na kichen sah louhel diu,  
\v 4 ajeh chu ama hon semthu pathen hou dia na chateu apuimang diu ahi. Chuteng Pakai lunghanna nachung uva hung chu jeng ding, chomlou kah a na manthah lo diu ahi.  
\v 5 Hitia hi nabol tei diu ahi. Amaicham phung hou le akhom ho aboncha naphuh lhuh peh diu ahi. Chule Asherah khom ho jong naphuh lhuh uva alim semthu u pathen ho meiya na halvam diu ahi. \x + \xo 7:5 \xt Danbu Ni Na 12:3\x*  
\v 6 Ajeh chu nangho mitheng te nahiuvin, Pakai na Pathen a nahiuve. vannoiya mijouse lah a hi Pakai na Pathen uvin ama gou phapen dia nalhen'u ahi. \x + \xo 7:6 \xt Potdohbu 19:5; Danbu Ni Na 4:20; 14:2; 26:18; Tit 2:14; 1 Pet 2:9\x*   
\p
\v 7 Pakaijin namdang te sanga thalhing le hatjo nahi jeh uva nalhen'u hilouvin, amavang nam neopen nahi jeh uva nalhen joh u ahi!  
\v 8 Ajeh chu Pakaijin akitepna ageldoh jingin, nachung uva ngailutna anei jingin ahi. Hijeh achu Pakaijin athahat pana Egypt gam Pharaoh akon suhgimna nachan nauva konna na huhdoh u ahi.  
\v 9 Hijeh chun hethem un Pakai na Pathen uhi Pathen dihtah ahi. Pakai ngailua athupeh nit jing mite chunga, akhang akhanga akitepna akoi jingin ngailutna jong anei jingin ahi. \x + \xo 7:9 \xt Potdohbu 20:5,6; 34:6,7; Minbu 14:18; Danbu Ni Na 5:9,10\x*  
\v 10 Hinlah Pakai nahsah louva umho chunga gim genthei alhunsah in asumang jin ahi.  
\v 11 Hijeh chun tunia thupeh kapeh chengse hi aboncha na juikim sohkei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Dan le thupeh aboncha na juikim sohkei uva ahileh Pakai na Pathen uvin na chung uva alungsetna longlou chu akoi jing ding ahi. Ajeh chu napu napa teu khanga pet akitepna ahi. \x + \xo 7:12 \xt Danbu Ni Na 11:13-17\x*  
\v 13 Pakaijin phattheina leh Ami ngailutna chun naumpi jing diu chule cha jong tampi nahin diu ahi. Pakaijin gam phatah gaphasona ding leh na gancha teu kivahna ding napeh diu, napu napa teu khanga peh dinga akitepna gam nalhun tengu leh louga phatah nachom khom diu, lengpi thah leh Olive thao chule bonghon tampi leh kelngoi hon tampi jaona nanei diu ahi.  
\v 14 Chutengleh vannoiya namdang te jouse sanga phatthei nachan diu ahi. Numei, pasal hihen na gancha teu hijongleh chanei louva khatcha na umlou diu ahi.  
\v 15 Chule dammo veisetna a konna Pakaijin navenbit jing diu ahi. Egypt gam'a gim genthei nathoh bang uva nathoh sah lou diu, na doumah jouseu aboncha asuhmang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Pakai na Pathen uvin namdang te nakhut uva apehdoh chengse aboncha na suhgam diu ahi. Ngailutna beiya nabol diu chule amaho pathen angsunga na bohkhup louhel diu ahi.  
\v 17 Amavang nang hon hitia hi nasei diu, 'Hiche nam mite hi eiho sang'in ahatjo uvin, iti iki doupi thei diu ham?'  
\v 18 Hinlah na kichat theilou diu ahi! Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin Egypt gam Pharaoh henga ichan geiya na atoh ham ti na geldoh diu ahi.  
\v 19 Pakai na Pathen uvin amaho chunga tijat umtah a na atoh geldoh jingun, hichu nangho mitmu tah a thilsoh ahi. Chule thil kidang ijakai akilahsah ho geldoh jing uvin, aban thahat pan a anatoh thil kidang hoa konna Egypt gam'a pat nahin puiyu chu na suhmil lou diu ahi. Hiche banga chu Pakai na Pathen uvin tua na galmi teu chunga na atoh ding ahi.  
\v 20 Pakai na Pathen uvin nalah uva kisel themlhat um nalaiho nomangna dinga tijatna ahin sol ding ahi!   
\p
\v 21 Hiche nam mite chunga chu kichatna nanei louhel diu ahi, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin na umpi jing uve, Pathen thilbol thei kidang ahi.  
\v 22 Pakai na Pathen uvin hiche nam mite ho hi athem athem'a asuhmang ding ahi. Khatvei pansa na suhmang jeng thei lou diu ahi. Achuti louva ahile gamsa te hung punglha jeng ding ahi.  
\v 23 Hinlah Pakai na Pathen uvin abonchauva nangho khut a apeh doh ding ahi. Amaho abeikahse uva Pakaijin asuhnoh phah diu ahi.  
\v 24 Pakaijin aleng hou nangho khut a apehdoh ding, chuteng nang hon leiset a amin hou na suhmang diu ahi.  
\v 25 Chule a milimdoi semthu hou aboncha na halvam peh diu, milimdoi tomna a kimang sum-eng hijongleh khat jeng cha na kilah theilou diu ahi.  
\v 26 Na insung'u suboh thei ima nanei theilou diu ahi, achuti louleh amaho banga na kisumang diu ahi. Hitobang thil hoa konna gamna kipan ding chule na kidalse jing diu ahi.   
\c 8  
\s1 Pathen sumil hih un  
\p
\v 1 Tunia ka thupeh chengse hi chingthei tah in jui bukim sohkei uvin. Chutileh nahin thei uva napun diu, Pakaijin napu napate khanga pat peh dinga akitepna gam nalo thei diu ahi.  
\v 2 Pakai na Pathen uvin kum somli gamthip lah a konna nahin puidoh nau geldoh jingun, ajeh chu Pakai thupeh ijakai nanit kimsohna diuva nangho patepna ahi.  
\v 3 Henge, Pakaijin gilkiel'a naum pettah uvin manna na peuvin ahi. Hiche tobang an hi napu napa teu khanga jong um khalou ahi. Ajeh chu mihem te hi changlhah jengseh a hing jou ahipoi ti, Pakaijin nahetsah nau ahin; amavang Pakai kam sunga konna hung potdoh thuchenga bou hinga nahiuve. \x + \xo 8:3 \xt Matt 4:4; Lk 4:4\x*  
\v 4 Kum somli sungin von-ah ding jong na ngaicha pouvin chule nakeng ujong apom pon ahi.  
\v 5 Hichu geltem uvin: Minu mipan acha ahilna banga, Pakai na Pathen uvin nangho phatchomna dinga bou na khoukhah u ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun Pakai na Pathen'u thupeh chengse abonchan nit kimsoh keiyun lang, Pakai ging jinga hinkho naman diu ahi.  
\v 7 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin na gam'u phatah twi nenna thinglhang le phaicham a vacha twi le twikul, twisam putna mun a napuilut u ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche gam pumpi hi mimchang le kolbulei jeng ahin; theiba phung, kolbuthei phung, Olive phung leh khoiju lonna gam ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche gamsung hi anneh thalhinna imacha vatlou ahi. Agamsunga thih jong song banga kimang ahin, thinglhang gam songmantam jeng uma ahi.  
\v 10 Agamsungga naneh tengu leh Pakai na Pathen'u thangvahna napeh jing diu ahi.   
\s1 Kiletsah jeh a gihsalna  
\p
\v 11 Hinlah hiche phat chu chingthei tah a um phat ahi! Na ninglhinna jal uvin tunia kapeh u Pakai na Pathen'u thupeh na suhmil louna diuvin chingtheiyun. \x + \xo 8:11 \xt Hosea 13:5,6\x*  
\v 12 Nanghon innom nahin kisah doh diu chule haosatah a na inchen diu,  
\v 13 chule na gancha teu jong hung pung cheh cheh ding, sana leh dangka ijakai kimsel'a nahin nei diu, chuteng chingtheiyun.  
\v 14 Chutengleh kiletsah hoithona le Egypt gamsunga soh a konna na huhdoh pau Pakai na Pathen'u na suhmil lou diu ahi.  
\v 15 Aman gamgo le gamsa tijat umtah gamthip noiya aipi hang leh gulse holah a nahin puidoh nau na geldoh jing diu ahi. Aman songpi a konin twi nape uvin ahi.  
\v 16 Aman gamthip noiya manna in navah uvin, hichu napu napa teuvin ahet khahlou anneh ahi. Hiche hi na kineosahna diu leh patepna dinga Aman nangho phatna dinga abol ahi.  
\v 17 Hiche ho hi 'Keima hatna a gou kaki lamdoh ahi' tia nasei louna diuva Aman abol ahi.  
\v 18 Pakai na Pathen'u na geldoh jing diu ahi. Pakai bouvin nangho lolhin theina dinga tha napeh u ahi, ajeh chu napu napa teu khanga pat kitepna guilhun sahna ding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hiche hi nahet jing diuva ka thupeh ahi: Pakai na Pathen'u sumila pathen dang nahou uva ahileh, na kisumang jeng diu ahi.  
\v 20 Pakai na Pathen nahsah louva naum uva ahileh, Pakaijin namdang asuhmang ho banga nangho jong na suhmang diu ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 Pathen hepina vanga galjona  
\p
\v 1 Ngaiyun, O Israel! Tunia hi nangman Jordan vadung galkaiya namdang te chenna nalut ding ahitan, amaho khu nangho jouse sanga hatthei ahiuve. Khopi sunga acheng uvin chule akhopi kimvel uva pal kigen jouse jong vanthamjol chan'a sang ahi!  
\v 2 Amaho khu nangho sang'in asang jouvin chule athahat jouvin abonchauva Anak chilhah ahiuve. 'Anak mite kidintepi ding koi ham?' tia thu kisei naja tauve.  
\v 3 Ahinlah nahe sohkei uve tunikhoa hi Pakai na Pathen'un kidangtah a aluchung vum uva meikong akilah sah ding asuh gamhel diu ahi. Aman ahin suhnem diu chuteng Pakaijin atepna banga nang hon gangtah a najo uva na nomang diu ahi. .   
\p
\v 4 Pakai na Pathen'un nangho dinga hitobang natoh ahin chaisoh tengleh, 'Mipha te kahi jeh uva Pakaijin hiche gam hi eipeh u ahi!' tia nasei louhel diu ahi. Ajeh chu hiche nam mite phatlou jeh a Pakaijin agam uva konna asoldoh joh ahi.  
\v 5 Nangho chonphat vanga hiche gam hi nalo diu ahipoi. Hinlah hiche nam mite phatlou jeh a adelmang ahin chule Pakai na Pathen'un napu napa teu Abraham, Isaac le Jacob henga akitepna asuh bukim ahi.  
\v 6 Nangho chonphat vang uva Pakaijin hiche gam hi napeh u ahipoi ti nakihet diu ahi, ajeh chu nangho milouchal te nahi bou uve.   
\s1 Sana a kisem bongnou geldohna  
\p
\v 7 Gamthip noiya Pakai na Pathen'u ichan'a alunghan chu geldoh uvin chule sumil hihbeh uvin. Egypt gam nahin dalhah nikho uva pat tuni chanin Ama dounan nachon jing uve.  
\v 8 Sinai Mol jenga jong nasatah in Pakai na lunghansah un Ama nangho sumang dinga gotsa anahi.  
\v 9 Hiche hi molchung kaumlaiya thilsoh ahin, Pakayin songpheng ni ah imatih chan'a dingin nangho toh kitepna chu asem tan ahi. Nisomli le jansomli jen an nelou twidon louvin kaum'in ahi. \x + \xo 9:9 \xt Potdohbu 24:18\x*  
\v 10 Mol bul'a na kitit laiyun Pakaijin songpheng ni eipen hichu meikong lailunga pat athu seidoh jouse aboncha akhuttah a ajih ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ni somli le jan somli lhin nikhon Pakaijin ajih kitepna songpheng teni chu eipe tan ahi.  
\v 12 Chuin Pakaijin kaheng'a aseijin, 'Kipatdoh in! Gangtah in chesuh in, ajeh chu Egypt gam'a konna nahin puidoh miten doumah jeng abol tauve. Chomlou kah in ka thupeh nahsah louvin akihei manggam tauve! Sana asujun uvin amaho ding limsemthu akisem tauve!' ati.   
\p
\v 13 Pakaijin kaheng'a asei kit in, ‘Hiche mite lungtah le thungai louna ka muchen tai.  
\v 14 Tun keima che ingting hiche mite hi vannoiya ka suhmang jeng diu ahi. Amaho sanga hatjo le chungnung joa keiman na chilhah te ka tundoh ding ahi, ati.   
\p
\v 15 Chuin molchung vum'a mei akong jeng tan ahile, keima ka hung kumsuh in monmang theilou kitepna songpheng teni chu kahin choijin ahi.  
\v 16 Keiman kahin vesuh in ahileh, Pakai douna chonset nabol tauve ti ka muchen tai. Sana mangchan bonglim doi nakisem thu tauvin ahi. Pakaijin na thupeh nauva kon'in chomlou kah in na kiheimang tauve!  
\v 17 Chuin keiman songpheng teni chu tol lham'a kasep lhan na mitmu tah uvin kasep in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hinlah Pakai angsunga nisomli le jan somli masang chun keiman an jong ka nepon chule twi jong ka don poi. Ajeh chu nang hon Pakai doumah bol in hinkho namang tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Pakai lunghanna na chung uva ahung chuh a na thagam diu chu keima ka kicha lheh jenge, hinlah Pakaijin ka taona eisanpeh kit in ahi. \x + \xo 9:19 \xt Heb 12:21\x*  
\v 20 Pakai chu Aaron chunga alung phamo lheh jeng tan, tha ding agon ahi. Aaron dingin ka taovin ahileh Pakaijin ahing hoi tan ahi.  
\v 21 Na chonset nau bonglim chu kalan mei lah a ka halvam tan vut kaso tan ahi. Mei kihalna vutvai abonchan kalan molchunga konna vadung twi a ka seplha tan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Massah, Taberah le Kibroth-hattaavah mun'a Pakai doumah nabol uvin ahi. \x + \xo 9:22 \xt Minbu 11:3; \xt Potdohbu 17:7; \xt Minbu 11:34\x*  
\v 23 Chule Kadesh-barnea mun'a Pakaijin hiche thupeh mangchan nasol tauvin ahi: Chetou un keiman kapehna gam khu galo tauvin. Hinlah Pakai na Pathen thupeh nahsah louvin hinkho namang uvin ahi. \x + \xo 9:23 \xt Minbu 13:17; \xt Danbu Ni Na 1:21; \xt Minbu 13:31; Danbu Ni Na 1:26; Heb 3:16\x*  
\v 24 Henge, Pakai doumah jeng nabol uve tihi keiman kahin he jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hijeh a chu nisomli le jan somli Pakai henga ka bohkhup in ahi, ajeh chu Pakaijin na boncha uva suhmang ding nagot u ahitai.  
\v 26 Pakai henga hiti hin kataove, O thaneipen Pakai, hiche mite hi sugam hih un. Amaho hi namite ahiuve. Chule amaho hi na goulupen, Egypt gam'a na huhdoh a naban thahat pan a nahin puidoh ahiuve.  
\v 27 Hiche mite chonsetna leh louchalna a kon'in ngaidam tan, chule ka puluiyu Abraham, Isaac le Jacob geldoh in.  
\v 28 Hiche mite hi na suhmanga ahileh, Egypt miten hitia hi asei diu, “Israel mite athi gam tauve, ajeh chu Pakaijin akitepna gam'a chu apui lhung joulou ahitai.” Ahilouleh “Hiche mite hi Pakaijin avetda jeh a asuhgam ahi tauve; thagam dinga apuile ahi, tia asei diu ahi.”  
\v 29 Ahinlah amaho hi na mite ahiuvin nagoulo ding, Egypt gamsunga konna naban thahat pan a nahin puidoh ahiuve.   
\c 10  
\s1 Kitepna thah  
\p
\v 1 Hiche phat lai chun Pakaijin kaheng ah aseijin, Songpheng ni masanga toh kibang chat hin choiyin chule Thingkhong khat phatah in sem inlang asunga khum ding ahi. Hiche na ding chun molchunga kaheng'a hung kaltouvin,  
\v 2 chule songpheng chunga chu masanga na sekeh chunga thucheng kijih bang banga kajih lut ding ahi. Chutengleh Thingkhong sunga nakoi ding ahi, ati.   
\p
\v 3 “Keiman thinggi Thingkhong in kasemin chule amasa a bang bangin songpheng ni ka suitoh in ahi.  
\v 4 Chuin Pakaijin avelin thupeh som ho chu ajih lut in, keima eipe tan ahi. Thucheng ho chu thakhat ahin, Pakaijin mol bul'a nakikhop nikho uva meikong lailunga pat ana sei chu ahi.  
\v 5 Molchunga kon kahung kiheisuh in, kitepna songpheng teni chu kitepna Thingkhong sunga kakoi tan, hichu Pakai thupeh banga keiman kabol ahi. Songpheng teni chu thingkong sunga aum nalaije.”   
\p
\v 6 (Israel mite chu Jaakan twikul mun'a kon'in Moserah kiti Aaron kivuina mun'a chun akitol tauvin ahi. Achapa Eleazar chun thempu chungnung natoh atoh ahi. \x + \xo 10:6 \xt Minbu 20:28; 33:38\x*  
\v 7 Hiche mun'a pat chun Gudgodah mun ajon tauvin, aban'in Jotbathah, vadung le vacha tampi lonna gam ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche phat lai chun Pakaijin Levi insung mite chu Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong pu dingin achomkhen uvin, chuleh Pakai angsunga ding diu Pakai min'a thempu na atoh diu, Ama min a phatthei bohna aphon diu ahi. Hiche ho hi amaho natoh ding ahi. \x + \xo 10:8 \xt Minbu 3:5-8\x*  
\v 9 Hiche jeh achu Israel mite lah a Levi insung chu chenna ding gamtum nei louva um ahiuve. Pakai na Pathen'un asei banga Pakai Ama tah chu agou lupen'u ahi.)   
\p
\v 10 “Keima chu, amasa a bangin nisomli le jan somli molchunga Pakai henga kaum in ahi. Pakaijin avelin ka taona asang'in nangho suhmang louding pha asah tan ahi.’ \x + \xo 10:10 \xt Potdohbu 34:28\x*  
\v 11 Chuin Pakaijin kaheng'a aseijin, 'Kipat inlang na kholjin nau jom tauvin, chule napu napa teu peh dinga kakitepna, gou lodin mipi ho lamkai tan,” eiti.   
\s1 Ngailut le jabol dinga kouna  
\p
\v 12 Chule tun, Israel, Pakai na Pathen'un nanghoa konna adei chu ipi ham? Aman adei chu Pakai na Pathen, nagin uva chule Pakai lunglam jeng nabol diu, na lungthim pumpiuva Pakai lam jeng nakat diu hi ahi.  
\v 13 Chule tunia najah uva kasei, Pakai thupeh chengse aboncha na juikim sohkei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 14 “Veuvin, van sangpen leh leiset chunga thil ijakai jouse hi Pakai na Pathen uva bou ahi.  
\v 15 Ajeh chu Pakaijin na pului teu ana ngailun hijeh a chu, achilhah teu nangho jouse jong namdang jouse sanga Pakaijin na khohsah joh u ahi.  
\v 16 Hijeh chun na louchal nauva kon'in, nalung heiyun.   
\p
\v 17 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uhi pathen jouse Pathen chule pakai jouse Pakai ahi. Ama chu Pathen thupi, thahat le jaum Pathen, sihnei langneina neilou ahi. \x + \xo 10:17 \xt 1 Tim 6:15; Rev 17:14; 19:16; Act 10:34; Rm 2:11; Gal 2:6; Eph 6:9\x*  
\v 18 Aman meithai ho leh chaga ho chunga thutah aumsah in ahi. Aman gamdang mi nalah uva chengho angailun, neh le chah chule sil le chen ding apeuvin ahi.  
\v 19 Hijeh a chu nang hon jong kholjin mi na ngailut diu ahi, ajeh chu nangho tah jong Egypt gam'a kholjin mi na-na hiu ahi.  
\v 20 Nanghon Pakai na Pathen'u nagin uva nahou diu Ama natuh chah diu ahi. Na kitepna hou chu Ama min'a bou nanei diu ahi.  
\v 21 Ama bou na Pathen ahin, chule Ama bou choi-at dinga lom, ama bouvin thil kidang ijakai abol in, hichu namit tah uvin namu sohkei uve.  
\v 22 Napu napa teu Egypt gam'a achesuh uchun amaho mi somsagi bou ahiuve. Hinlah tun nangho Pakai na Pathen'un van'a ahsi jat in na semdoh tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 10:22 \xt Semtilbu 46:27; \xt Semtilbu 15:5; 22:17\x*   
\c 11  
\p
\v 1 Nanghon Pakai na Pathen'u na ngailut diu chule Pakai dan leh thupeh aboncha najui tei diu ahi.  
\v 2 Na lungthim'un ching jingun, keiman tua hi na chateu Pakai na Pathen'u sinsah dan hekha loulai ahilouleh aloupina le aban thahatna mukha loulai ho heng'a kasei ahipoi.  
\v 3 Amahon Egypt gam'a Pharaoh le agamsung douna a melchihna kidang le detmah thil kibol ho amu hih uve. \x + \xo 11:3 \xt Potdohbu 7:8—12:13\x*  
\v 4 Amahon Egypt sepai te le sakol ho le akangtalai hou—nahin del lai uva Twipi San a iti alhah lhum sah ham ti amu hih uve. Aman amaho asuhmang uva, chule tuni chan'a kimudoh talou ahiuve! \x + \xo 11:4 \xt Potdohbu 14:28\x*   
\p
\v 5 “Na chateuvin ichan a Pakaijin gamthip noiya pat hilai nahung lhun chan uva na khohsah u amu pouve.  
\v 6 Na chateuvin Dathan le Abiram insung mite (Reuben chilhah, Eliab chapa teni), aponbuh ule anei agou jouseu chunga athilbol, leiset in akamsah le avallhum amu pouvin ahi. \x + \xo 11:6 \xt Minbu 16:31,32\x*  
\v 7 Hinlah nang hon Pakai natoh kidang abonchan namit tah uvin namu sohkei tauvin ahi!   
\s1 Jabolna jeh a phattheina ho  
\p
\v 8 Hijeh chun chingtheiyun, tunia thupeh chengse aboncha na juikim sohkei diu, chutileh na thahat diu na lutna diu gamsung nalo thei diu ahi.  
\v 9 Jabolna nanei uva ahileh Pakaijin napu napa teu khanga peh dinga akitepna gam napeh diu ahi, ajeh chu achilhah ten hiche khoiju leh bongnoi lonna gam khu alo diu ahi!  
\v 10 Hiche gam nalo diu khu nahin dalhah u Egypt gam tobang ahipon, hiche honsung'a muchi nalhah tengu leh kenga twilam le kotong nasem tobangu ahipoi.  
\v 11 Amavang, nalo diu gam hi thinglhang le phaicham a go aneng in—  
\v 12 agamsung pumpi hi Pakai na Pathen'un kumlhung lhalhunga avetkolna gam ahi!   
\p
\v 13 “Tunia naheng uva ka thupeh chengse phatecha ahile najui uva ahile, chule Pakai na Pathen'u hi na lungthim pumpiu le na lhagao pumpi uva akin nabol uva ahileh, \x + \xo 11:13 \xt Thempu Dan 26:3-5; Danbu Ni Na 7:12-16; 28:1-14\x*  
\v 14 Pakaijin phat bichin kikhel dungjuiya gomasa le gonukhah ahin juhsah ding, chuteng chang le mim, lengpiga thah le olive ga thah nahin pohlut diu ahi.  
\v 15 Na gancha te diuva anpha tah tah napeh diu chule nang hon nadu chan’u naneh thei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 16 “Hinlah chingtheiyun. Na lungthim'u kilhep lhah sah hih uvin, ajeh chu Pakaiya konna kiheimang a pathen dang nabel lo diu ahi.  
\v 17 Achuti louva ahileh Pakai lunghanna chun na halvam jeng diu, Pakaijin vankot akha ding gotwi aum lou teng nang hon ahina banga chang na khop tup theilou diu ahi. Chuteng hiche gampha mun'a chu hetman louva na thigam jeng diu ahi.   
\p
\v 18 “Hijeh chun ka thupeh chengse hi na lungthim cheh uva koiyun. Na geldoh jingna diuvin na khut uva kibu uvin chule na chalpang uva kikan uvin. \x + \xo 11:18 \xt Danbu Ni Na 6:6-9\x*  
\v 19 Na chateu henga na seipeh sohkei diu ahi. Insunga na umpet u hihen, lam najot pet, imut kon chule na thodoh kon teng ujongleh na seipeh diu ahi.  
\v 20 Thupeh chengse chu kotphung leh kelkot jousea najih diu ahi,  
\v 21 chutileh vanthamjol um laisea, Pakaijin napeh nau gamsunga nangho leh na chateu chule na chilhah teu chan geiya lungmonga na chen diu ahi.   
\p
\v 22 “Ka thupeh jouse hi chingthei tah a najui diu ahi. Na ngailut nau chu Pakai na Pathen lama nache nau leh na tuhchahna uva musah un.  
\v 23 Chuteng Pakaijin na masang uva namdang jouse adelmang ding, amaho lenjoh uhen hatjo jongleu, agam'u nalah diu ahi.  
\v 24 Nakal sondohna chan u chu nangho gam hi ding ahi. Na gamgiu kilhun ding dan chu lhanglam'a gamthipnoi apat sahlam'a Lebanon chan, chule solam'a Euphrates Vadung apat lhumlam'a Mediterranean Twipi chan hi ding ahi. \x + \xo 11:24 \xt Joshua 1:3-5\x*  
\v 25 Nangho dounan koima ding ngam ponte, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin akitepna banga na chena chan uva miten na ginna diu le kichatna akoi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 26 “Veuvin, tunia phattheina leh gaosapna nakilhen diuva kapeh diu ahi!  
\v 27 Pakai na Pathen'u thupeh chengse hi nanit sohkei uva ahileh nangho phatthei nachan diu ahi.  
\v 28 Hinlah Pakai na Pathen'u thupeh na nuse uva ama a konna kiheimang'a tumasanga nahet khah lou u pathen dang ho nahou uleh naki gaosap diu ahi.   
\p
\v 29 “Pakai na Pathen uvin gamsung'a napuilut uva chule goulo dia napanpi tengu leh, phattheina ho Gerizim Mol'a nasap diu chule gaosapna Ebal Mol'a nasap diu ahi. \x + \xo 11:29 \xt Danbu Ni Na 27:11-14; Joshua 8:33-35\x*  
\v 30 (Hiche molsang teni hi Canaan mite gam Jordan Phaicham a lhumlam Jordan Vadung, Gilgal khopi toh kinai cha, Moreh gangpiphung apat kigamlat talou ahi.)  
\v 31 Ajeh chu nang ho Pakai na Pathen'un peh dinga atepsa gam lut dinga Jordan vadung na galkai ding koncha nahi tauve. Agamsung nalhun uva nachen tengu leh,  
\v 32 tunia keiman kapeh u dan jui ding jouse, chingthei tah a nahin jui sohkei diu ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Houna mun dinga Pakaijin alhen  
\p
\v 1 Hichengse hi Pakai napu napa teu Pathen'in dan leh thupeh jui dinga napeh u ahin chinthei tah a najui diu ahi. Nadam sung uva jana neitah a nabol diu ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Hiche gam khu nalhun uva, namdang te abonchauva nano mang tengu leh, a pathen milim semthu jouseu molchunga hihen, gammang lah chule thingphung tinchenga hijongleh na suhmanghel diu ahi.  
\v 3 Amaicham hou nasuh set diu chule maicham phung jouse jong nasuh chim diu ahi. Asherah ho jong meiya nahalvam diu chule a pathen min jouseu aboncha na suhmanghel diu ahi! \x + \xo 12:3 \xt Danbu Ni Na 7:5\x*   
\p
\v 4 Hiche lim semthu hou miten apathen'u ahou bang uva nang hon nahou lou diu ahi.  
\v 5 Amavang nang hon Pakai na Pathen houna ding mun'a Israel insung aboncha kikhop khomna mun'a chu gin leh jabol tah a nahou diu ahi.  
\v 6 Hiche mun'a chu nacham tah uva pumgo thilto nahin choi diu, na thilto diu som’a khat, kitepna suh bulhitna ding thilto chule na gancha penglha masa jouseu jong na todoh cheh cheh diu ahi.  
\v 7 Hiche mun'a chu nang leh na insung miten Pakai ansunga anneh khom nanei diu, Pakai phatthei na ho nachan diu ahi, ajeh chu nangman Pakai na Pathen thupeh nanit jal ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Pakai kin nabol danu jong kikhel ding ahi. Tunin nangho dei danin nabol uvin,  
\v 9 ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un atumbeh a napeh nau gam nangho jouse dinga choldona gam chu na lhun nailou u ahi.  
\v 10 Hinlah nang ho chomlou kah a Jordan vadung na galkai diu Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gam'a chu nachen diu ahi. Aman nagal miteuva konna na kicholngah sah uva chule gamsunga chu bittah a a na khosah tengu le,  
\v 11 naboncha uva keiman ka thupeh chengse nahin choi diu—pumgo thilto, na thilto diu ho, kitepna suh bulhitna ding thilto hichengse hi, Pakai na Pathen min jabolna dinga alhenna mun'a chu nahin choi sohkei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hiche mun'a chu na chanu teu ahin, na chapa teu chule nasohte jouseu jaona Pakai na Pathen henga thangvahna nanei khom diu ahi. Chule khopi sunga nachen khompiu Levi mite na geldoh jing diu ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon gam chanvou anei lou’u ahi.  
\v 13 Nangho chingtheiyun, ajeh chu mun jousea pumgo thilto na todoh theilou diu ahi.  
\v 14 Na insung miteu chenna mun, hichu Pakaijin adeilhenna mun'a vang chu natodoh thei diu ahi. Hiche mun'a chu pumgo thilto natodoh diu chule ka thupeh aboncha na bolkim sohkei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Na ganchate vang chu na kitha uva khopi nadei dei nauva naneh jeng theiyu ahi. Pakai na Pathen'un phatthei aboh ganchaho chu naneh jeng theiyu ahi. Hou thudol'a thenpet hihen bohpet hijongleh nabon uva Sakhisa leh Sapeng tua naneh bang uva hi naneh thei diu ahi.  
\v 16 Ahin gan thisan vang chu naneh lou diu, chule tollham a twi banga nasun lhah diu ahi. \x + \xo 12:16 \xt Semtilbu 9:4; Thempu Dan 7:26,27; 17:10-14; 19:26; Danbu Ni Na 15:23\x*   
\p
\v 17 Hinlah nang hon na thilto hou chu na khopi sung uva naneh theilou diu, hichu som’a khat ahin, gathah, Olive thao, na gancha asoh masaho ahin chule kitepna thilto, chule mimal kipehna thilto ho hijongleh khopi dunga naneh lou diu ahi.  
\v 18 Hichengse chu Pakai na Pathen utoh aman adeilhen na mun'a chu naneh diu ahi. Na chateu ahin, nasoh teu ahin chule khopi sunga Levi mite jaona a nabol jouseu Pakai na Pathen'u umpina a nabol diu ahi.  
\v 19 Chule na damsung uva Levi mite na geldoh jing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Pakaijin akitepna banga nagam'u ahin kehlet tengleh, nang hon sa na duchat tengu leh itih hijongleh naneh thei diu ahi.  
\v 21 Pakai na Pathenin ama houna dinga adeilhenna mun chu na chenna a konna lamsao tah hi ding hijongleh na jabol diu ahi. Chutia lamsao chu ahileh, keiman ka thupeh bang uva gancha lah a na kelcha hon, na kelngoi hon chule na bong hon lah a nadei na kitha uva naneh jeng theiyu ahi.  
\v 22 Nalah uva koi hijongleh atheng hihen aboh hileh tua Sapeng le Sakhisa naneh jiu banga hichu naneh jeng thei diu ahi.  
\v 23 Ahin gan thisan vang naneh louhel diu ahi, ajeh chu thisan hi hinna ahin, hinna thisan chule asa naneh kop lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 12:23 \xt Thempu Dan 17:10-14\x*  
\v 24 Hiche sang chun, athisan chu twi banga tol lhama nasun lhah diu ahi.  
\v 25 Gan thisan chu naneh lou diu ahi, chutileh nangho leh nacha teu chunga ijakai pha sohkei ding ahi, ajeh chu Pakai lunglam chu nabol diu ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Atumbeh a na thilpeh diu leh kitepna thilto chu choiyun lang, Pakaijin adei lhenna mun'a chu naga koi diu ahi.  
\v 27 Nanghon Pakai na Pathen adia pumgo thilto gan thisan naga todoh teitei diu ahi. Gan thisan jouse chu Pakai maicham'a nasun khum diu, asa vang naneh diu ahi.  
\v 28 Ka thupeh jabolna dingin chingtheiyun, chutileh nangho leh nacha teu chunga ijakai pha sohkei ding ahi, ajeh chu Pakai lunglam chu nabol diu ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Pakai na Pathen na masang uva ache a namdang ho asuhmang tengleh nanghon na nomang uva agam uva nachen diu,  
\v 30 achon chan’u jui ding nagot louhel diu chule apathen hou kin jong nabol louhel diu ahi. A pathen hou chung chang hetnomna jong nei louva, 'Hiche nam mite hin pathen iti ahou uham? A chon dan u kajui nom'e' tia jong nakhol lou diu ahi.  
\v 31 Nanghon namdang ten apathen’u ahou bang uva Pakai na Pathen nahou louhel diu ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon Pakai lama dinga doumah jeng abol uvin, achapa teu leh achanute hou jeng jong apathen diuva akatdoh jiu ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Hijeh chun ka thupeh jouse hi chingthei tah a najui diu ahi. Nanghoa konna ima kilahdoh sah hih unlang chule imacha lah ding nagot lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 12:32 \xt Danbu Ni Na 4:2; Rev 22:18,19\x*   
\c 13  
\s1 Milim hou gihna  
\p
\v 1 “Nalah uva gaothusei ho khonunga hunglhung ding aseiyun, ama hon thil kidang melchihna ho akilahsah uva,  
\v 2 hiche banga chu gaothua asei doh jouseu agui lhun'a ahileh, Amaho chun hitia hi asei uva, ‘Hungun, tumasanga nahet khahlou u pathen ho—keiho pathen hou tau hite—  
\v 3 atiu leh na nahsah lou diu ahi. Ajeh chu na lungthim pumpiu le na lhagao pumpi uva na ngailut u hinam tia Pakai, na Pathen uvin na patep nau ahi.  
\v 4 Pakai, na Pathen'u kin jeng nabol uva nagin diu ahi. Athupeh ho nit uvin, a ogin ngaiyun, chule Ama tuhchah uvin.  
\v 5 Alam louva gaothu seidoh a khonung ding thilmu ho abonchauva thina chang diu ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon na huhhing pau Pakai, na Pathen'u Egypt gam'a konna nahin puidoh pau doumah jeng abol tauvin ahi. Pakai, na Pathen'u thupeh a kon'in puimang ding nagouvin, hijeh achu thina na chansah teitei diu ahi. Hitia chu nalah uva konna phatlouna ho natol mang diu ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Mikhat touvin guhthim in nahin lhem uhenlang—na sopipa, na chanu, na chapa, na ngailuttah na jinu, ahilouleh naloi ngaipen chun, ‘pathen dang hou din cheu hite' tihen—hinlah hiche pathen ho hi napu, na pateu jengin jong ana het khah lou ahi.  
\v 7 Nahin lhep patep diu, napu napa teu khanga pat le leiset a nahet khah lou pathen hou tauvin, ati diu ahi.  
\v 8 Hinlah athu uva nanun louhel diu ahi. Chule hepina jong nanei lou diu, ven jong na venbit thei louhel diu ahi.  
\v 9 Amaho chu thina na chansah teitei diu ahi! Amasa tah in kholhangsam leu chun mipin nahin kithopi diu ahi.  
\v 10 Athemmo a chu songa naselih diu ahi ajeh chu ama hon Egypt gam'a nasoh channa uva konna na huhdoh pau Pakai na Pathen uva kon'in puimang ding nagouve.  
\v 11 Chuteng Israel pumpin ajah uva kicha diu, chule ngolhoitah a chon kit talou ding ahiuve.   
\p
\v 12 Pakai na Pathen uvin napeh nau khopi sunga nachen tengu leh, nang hon hitia thu kisei najah diu,  
\v 13 nalah uva michavai hon nasopi hou henga 'Nahet khah louhel'u pathen ho gahou uhite' tia asei uva apuimang diu ahi.  
\v 14 Hitobang dinmun hoa konna hi atah chu chingthei tah a na kholchil diu ahi. Nalah uva hitobang thulhut hi adih in aum mong tai ti aki cheh tengleh,  
\v 15 hiche khopi chu nalonvuh uva achilhah te jouseu le agancha jouseu geiya na suhmanghel diu ahi.  
\v 16 Mun kihong laiya chu thil kichom ho naset uva aboncha na halvam hel diu chule khopi chu Pakai na Pathen uva dinga pumgo thiltoa pang ding ahi. Hiche khopi chu itih a jong sahphat kit louding, ase a um jing ding ahitai.  
\v 17 Khopi sahdohna thei thil khat cha jong na umden sahlou diu ahi. Chuteng Pakai milungsetna chu nachan diu chule hepina dimset a napu napa teu khanga akitepna banga nam lentah naso diu ahi.   
\p
\v 18 A ogin na ngai uva tunia athupeh jouse nanit uleh Pakai na Pathen'u hepina nachan diu, chutia nabol uchun Ama alunglhai sah ding ahi.   
\c 14  
\s1 Hou lamdol'a Satheng leh saboh  
\p
\v 1 Nangho Pakai na Pathen a nahitah jeh un thipul douna nanei tengu leh chalsam kitan ahilouleh kivomui nabol louhel diu ahi.\x + \xo 14:1 \xt Thempu Dan 19:28; 21:5\x*  
\v 2 Pakai na Pathen diuva nangho atheng dia khindoh nahi tauve, chule Aman leiset chunga nam jouse lah a Ama goulupen a na lhendoh u ahitai. \x + \xo 14:2 \xt Potdohbu 19:5,6; Danbu Ni Na 4:20; 7:6; 26:18; Tit 2:14; 1 Pet 2:9\x*   
\p
\v 3 Chule gancha boh kiti phot naneh theilou diu ahi.  
\v 4 Hichengse vang hi naneh thei diu ahi: bongchal, kelngoi, kelcha,  
\v 5 sajuh, pelkai, sakhi, gam kel, chule molchunga kelngoi ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Nanghon atin kika leh a-ih lhaikit tapou sa naneh thei diu,  
\v 7 hinlah hiche teni neilou sa vang chu naneh lou diu ahi. Hijeh a chu sangongsang, talep, bui amaho cheng naneh lou diu ahi. Amaho hin ihdoh an alhaiyun ahin akengtin'u akika pon ahi. Hijeh achu hiche gancha ho hi nangho dinga sathenglou ahi.  
\v 8 Chule vohcha naneh lou diu ahi. Akengtin akika nan ahin ihdoh an alhai pouve, hijeh a chu nangho dia sathenglou ahiye. Hiche gancha ho hi asa jong naneh theilou diu chule athilong jong na tohkhah lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Twikhanglen'a cheng ganhing lah a alip leh alha nei jouse naneh thei diu ahi.  
\v 10 Twikhanglen'a um alip leh alha neilou jouse naneh lou diu ahi. Amaho chu nangho dia sathenglou ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Nang hon chungleng vacha atheng jouse naneh thei diu ahi.  
\v 12 Hichengse hi naneh theilou diu ahi: muthong, mubong, muvom,  
\v 13 muthi, sumbupi,  
\v 14 va-ah leh ama tobang jouse,  
\v 15 muvanlai, muthi-muhchom chule ama tobang jouse,  
\v 16 sumbupi nou, sumbupi len, sumbu changlit,  
\v 17 muthibong, sumbupi, Egypt mite muthi,  
\v 18 bah chule adang phabep jaona naneh lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Tollham a vahle lung lhanei jouse hi nangho dia athenglou ahiuvin naneh theilou diu ahi.  
\v 20 Hinlah vacha hihen lung hijongleh alhanei ahivanga hou thudol'a atheng kitiphot chu naneh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Ganhing ama macham'a thi naneh theilou diu ahi. Nakhopi sung uva kholjin miho napeh thei diu ahilouleh na hetkhah lou mikom'a najoh thei diu ahi. Amavang nang hon naneh theilou diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen adia athenga kichom khen nahi tauve. Chule nang hon kelchanou chu kelchapi noitwiya nahon lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 14:21 \xt Potdohbu 23:19; 34:26\x*   
\s1 Hopsom peh ding dan  
\p
\v 22 Gasoh lah a som’a khat ding nakoi doh diu gasoh jouse lah a, som’a khat kumseh le na todoh diu ahi. \x + \xo 14:22 \xt Thempu Dan 27:30-33; Minbu 18:21\x*  
\v 23 Hiche som’a khat chu Pathen houna mun'a nahin choi diu Pakai Pathen'in amin dopsangna dinga alhenna mun'a chu nahin choi diu, hichu Ama angsunga naneh diu ahi. Hitia nabol diu chu chang le mim, lengpiga, olive thao, chule gancha peng masa achal hi ding ahi. Hiche nabol uva hi Pakai na Pathen ginje nakihil diu ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Pakai na Pathen uvin phatthei nahin boh tengu leh mun gamla tah hijongleh lousohga tamtah nalo diu, chuteng hoilai mun'a kon hijongleh som’a khat nahin choi diu ahi.  
\v 25 Amun chu agamlat behseh a ahileh, hiche gasoh chu najoh diu najohna man u vang chu Pakai na Pathen'u houna mun'a chu nalhut diu ahi.  
\v 26 Nahung lhun tengu leh, nang hon nadei chan nasum uva na kichoh diu bongchal, kelngoi, kelcha, lengpitwi chule adang donthei nachoh jeng theiyu ahi. Chuteng nangho leh na insung miteuvin Pakai ansunga an najon khom diu ahi.  
\v 27 Chule nalah uva Levi mite nahebol jing diu ahi. Ajeh chu amaho chenna ding gam nei louva um ahiuve.   
\p
\v 28 Kumthum lhinsih leh som’a khat achombeh a nahin choi diu, hichu akinaipen khopia nakhol khom diu ahi.  
\v 29 Hichu Levi mite napeh diu, nalah uva cheng gam dang miho, naochaga ho, chule khopi ho a meithai ho jong napeh diu, hichu aneh uva lungkim diu ahi. Chuteng Pakai na Pathen uvin phatthei naboh diu ahi.   
\c 15  
\s1 Sabbath kum chamlhatna  
\p
\v 1 Kum sagi kichai seh leh min nasum abat chu abat a na simpeh louding ahitai.  
\v 2 Hiche thudol chu hitia hi bol ding ahi. Mijousen a Israel mi chanpi bat chu abat sah tah louding ahi. Koiman asopi aheng kom'a asuh thei louding ahitai. ajeh chu Pakai phattep dungjuiya lha ongna phat hunglhung ahitai.  
\v 3 Hiche bat kisim louna hi Israel mite insunga ding bou ahin—nalah uva cheng kholjin miho a ding ahipoi.   
\p
\v 4 Koima vaichatah a umlou ding, Pakai na Pathen uvin gou lutah napeh nau gamsunga phatthei naboh diu ahi.  
\v 5 Pakai Pathen keiman tunia kapeh u thupeh ho hi chingthei tah a najabol uva ahileh phatthei nachan diu ahi.  
\v 6 Pakai na Pathen uvin akitepna banga phatthei naboh tei diu ahi. Nam tampin naheng uva sumpa ahinlah diu chule nang hon vang bat a ima nalah lou diu ahitai. Nam tamtah vaihoma napan diu, hinlah amahon nangho chunga vai ahop lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hinlah Pakai na Pathen uvin napeh nau gam nalhun uva Israel insunga konna avaicha aum khah leh ama chu nadal bol louhel diu ahi. \x + \xo 15:7 \xt Thempu Dan 25:35\x*  
\v 8 Chusang chun, hongphal tah a amaho chu angaichat chan'u namansah diu ahi.  
\v 9 Bat a thilpeh ding hijongleh itlouhel a napeh diu ahi. Ajeh chu khat leh khat bat a konna kilepehna phat chu nakhut uva um jing ahi. Bat a peh ding nada uva mikhat nachung uva lhisona aneiya ahileh, phat louna chonset a chu lhalut nahi tauve.  
\v 10 Vaichaten angaichat banga hongphal tah a napeh diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai, na Pathen uvin natohna lam lam uva phatthei naboh diu ahi.  
\v 11 Na chennau gamsunga chu vaicha um jing ding ahi. Hijeh a chu hiche thupeh hi Israel mite lah a vaicha hon angaichat uchu manbeiya nahop diu ahi. \x + \xo 15:11 \xt Matt 26:11; Mk 14:7; Jn 12:8\x*   
\s1 Hebrew Soh ho kilhadoh  
\p
\v 12 Hebrew mite lah a konna numei hileh pasal hileh soh dinga kiphal aum leh kum gup sunga nangho najen diu, kum sagina leh ama chu chamlhatna napeh diu ahi. \x + \xo 15:12 \xt Thempu Dan 25:39-46\x*  
\v 13 Soh pasal chu na soldoh tengu leh, khutgoh keova nasol lou diu ahi.  
\v 14 Lhahna thilpeh dia na gancha lah a kon, na changphol a kon, na lengpi hehna a konna napeh diu ahi. Pakai na Pathenin phatthei nabohna a konna chan naneipi diu ahi.  
\v 15 Egypt gam'a khatvei chu soh nahi nauva konna Pakai na Pathen uvin na lhatdoh u ahi chu geldoh jingun! Hijeh a chu keiman hiche thupeh hi nangho kapeh nahiuve.   
\p
\v 16 Hinlah soh chun ‘Keiman ka dalhah louding nahi’ tia aseiya ahileh, ajeh chu aman nangma leh na insung mite angailut jal ahi.  
\v 17 Hitobang dinmun'a chu, kotphung a thihhem a abil navu ding ahi. Chujou leh, ama chu hinkhoa nasoh hi ding ahitai. Chule chutobanga chu sohnu jong abil navu ding ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Nasoh uchu na soldoh tengu leh hahsa tah a nagel lou diu ahi. Na suhmil lou diu chu kum gup sunga nagoi u soh chun akop a na natohpeh u ahitan, Pakai na Pathen uvin natohna lam lam uva phatthei naboh diu ahi.   
\s1 Gancha peng masa kitohdoh  
\p
\v 19 Na ganchate lah uva konna apeng masa jouse Pakai na Pathen a dinga nachom khen diu ahi. Na gancha teu lah a apeng masa kiti phot chu nalouva na natoh sah lou diu, chule amul navo lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 15:19 \xt Potdohbu 13:12\x*  
\v 20 Hiche sanga chu, Pakai na Pathen umpina a hiche gancha ho chu nang leh na insung miten kumseh leh aman alhenna mun'a naneh diu ahi.  
\v 21 Hinlah hiche gancha pengmasa chu a elbai ham ahilouleh mitcho ahikhah leh nang hon Pakai na Pathen'u henga na todoh lou diu ahi.  
\v 22 Hiche sanga chu, na insung mite toh na inmun uva naneh diu ahi. Koi hileh hou thudol'a miboh hihen mitheng hijongleh sajuh le sakhisa naneh bang uva naneh thei diu ahi.  
\v 23 Ahin athisan chu naneh lou diu ahi. Hichu tol lham'a twi banga nasun lhah diu ahi. \x + \xo 15:23 \xt Semtilbu 9:4; Thempu Dan 7:26,27; 17:10-14; 19:26; Danbu Ni Na 12:16,23\x*   
\c 16  
\s1 Kalchuh Kut le Chol Solou Changlhah Kut  
\p
\v 1 Pakai na Pathen u jabolna in, kumseh leh khal kipat til Abib lha a Kalchuh lopna nabol diu ahi, ajeh chu hiche lha a hi Pakai na Pathen'un jan muthim noiya Egypt apat nahin puidoh u ahi. \x + \xo 16:1 \xt Potdohbu 12:1-20; Thempu Dan 23:5-8; Minbu 28:16-25\x*  
\v 2 Na Kalchuh satha diu chu na gancha teu lah a kon aman amin kijabolna dia adeilhenna mun a chu Pakai na Pathen'u houna a na todoh diu ahi.  
\v 3 Hichu cholsolou changlhah toh naneh tha diu ahi. Nisagi sunga naneh diu changlhah chu chol kisolou hi ding, ajeh chu Egypt gam'a konna kinotah a nahung nau avetsah ahi. Hiche changlhah chu neuvin—suhgim vetsahna changlhah ahin—na damsung uva Egypt nahin dalhah u na geldoh diu ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche nisagi sunga hin koima in'ah chol kimu hih hen. Chule Kalchuh Kut adia nikho masapenni nilhah a kelngoi na todoh tengu leh, asa chu ajing jingkah geiya ahalsi cha jong na umsah loudiu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Kalchuh Kut a todoh ding hi Pakai na Pathen uvin napeh u khopi ho lah a khat pen a nato jeng lou diu ahi.  
\v 6 Pakai na Pathen'un—amin kijabolna dinga adeilhenna—ama houna ding mun a bou chu na todoh diu ahi. Nisa alep lhah tengleh hichu Egypt gam'a nahung potdoh nau vetsahna na todoh diu ahi.  
\v 7 Sa chu na sahgep uva Pakaijin alhenna mun'a chu naneh diu ahi. Chule jingkah lam leh na ponbuh mun cheh uva nakile diu ahi.  
\v 8 Aban nigup sunga chu chol jaona changlhah naneh lou diu ahi. Anisagi lhinni chu Pakai na Pathen'u jabolna nikho thenga na phondoh diu, koiman na atoh thei louding ahi.   
\s1 Lho Lhun kut  
\p
\v 9 Lousohga khoptup laiya chang le mim na at masatpen uva pat hapta sagi na simdoh diu ahi. \x + \xo 16:9 \xt Thempu Dan 23:15-21; Minbu 28:26-31\x*  
\v 10 Chujou tengleh Pakai na Pathen uva dinga Kalchuh Kut golvah nabol diu ahi. Pakaiya konna phatthei na channa hou ijakai nahin choi sohkei diu ahi.  
\v 11 Hiche phat hi Pakai na Pathen uvin adeilhenna mun'a chu ama min kijabolna phat hi ding ahi. Na chanu teu leh na chapa teu, soh numei le pasal, khopi ho a Levi mite, gamdang miho, chagate, chule meithai ho toh golvah nabol khom diu ahi.  
\v 12 Egypt gam'a sohchanga hinkho mang nahiuve ti nageldoh jing diu, hijeh a chu chingthei tah a thupeh ho hi na jabol diu ahi.   
\s1 Lhambuh kut  
\p
\v 13 Lhosohga na khoptup chai uva lengpiga naheh chai tengu leh nisagi sunga Lhambuh Kut naman diu ahi. \x + \xo 16:13 \xt Thempu Dan 23:33-36,39-43; Minbu 29:12-38\x*  
\v 14 Kipa umtah hiche golvah hi na chanu teu leh na chapa teu, soh numei le pasal, khopi ho a Levi mite, gamdang miho, chagate, chule meithai ho toh naman diu ahi.  
\v 15 Nisagi sunga Pakai na Pathen'un alhenna mun'a chu golvah nabol diu ahi, ajeh chu ama a konna phatthei na chan uva natohna jouseuva na lolhin'u ahi. Hiche kut hi mijousea dinga nasatah a kipana phat hi ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Kumseh leh Israel miten hiche kut thum ho hi aman jing diu ahi: Changlhah Kut, Lholhun Kut chule Lhambuh Kut ahi. Hiche kin ho a hi, pasal jouse Pakai na Pathen uvin alhenna mun a kilah cheh diu, ahin koiman khutgoh keuva Pakai angsung anailut thei louding ahi.  
\v 17 Pakai na Pathen uvin phatthei abohna dungjuiya ajokham khama apeh cheh diu ahi.   
\s1 Thudih a vaihom  
\p
\v 18 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau khopi jousea nangma phung cheh in thutan vaihoma pang ding naki lhen sohkei diu ahi. Amaho chun miho chunga chamdel'a thu atan diu ahi.  
\v 19 Koima chunga langnei sihneiya thil ima nabol lou diu ahi. Nehguh nalah lou diu ahi, ajeh chu nehguh in miching ho mit achotsah in Pathen dei banga thulhuh semna asuse in ahi. \x + \xo 16:19 \xt Potdohbu 23:6-8; Thempu Dan 19:15\x*  
\v 20 Adih a kivaihomna chu um jing hen, chutileh Pakai na Pathen uvin napeh nau gamsunga lungmonga nachen diu ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Pakai na Pathen maicham nasem nau vel a chu Asherah khom na tundoh louhel diu ahi. \x + \xo 16:21 \xt Potdohbu 34:13\x*  
\v 22 Chule hou dinga khom dang naphu louhel diu ahi, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen adia hitobang chu thet umtah ahi. \x + \xo 16:22 \xt Thempu Dan 26:1\x*   
\c 17  
\p
\v 1 Ana damlou gancha kiti phot Pakai na Pathen henga na todoh theilou diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakaiya dia hitobang thilpeh ho hi thet um ahi.  
\v 2 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gam'a nachen tengu leh, nalah uva konna numei hileh pasal hileh Pakai na Pathen'u mitmua aphalou nabol theilou diu chule kitepna na suhboh theilou diu ahi.  
\v 3 Semthu pathen dang angsung, nisa chule ahsiho vamthamjol kitiho jouse angsunga na bohkhup theilou diu ahi. \x + \xo 17:3 \xt Potdohbu 22:20\x*  
\v 4 Hitobang ho hi na kholchil sohkei diu ahi. Ajeh chu Israel mite lah a hitobang hi umkha get inte.  
\v 5 Numei hileh pasal hileh hitobanga chon chu, khopi pam lama nodoh ding songa selih ding ahi.  
\v 6 Hinlah mikhat jeng seh thutan nan mi that hih un, mithum beh thutanna a chu thina nachan sah thei diu ahi. \x + \xo 17:6 \xt Minbu 35:30; Danbu Ni Na 19:15; Matt 18:16; 2 Crth 13:1; 1 Tim 5:19; Heb 10:28\x*  
\v 7 Thutanpa chun songa ase masat ding, chuteng mipin ase ding ahi. Hitia chu nalah uva konna aphalouva chon chu na nodoh diu ahi. \x + \xo 17:7 \xt 1 Crth 5:13\x*   
\p
\v 8 Nalah uva thilsoh chung thutanna ahahsat behseh a, hichu phatlouna, tol-that, mithat chule dan chung kalval'a chon achungthu a boina chom chom neiya auma ahileh, hitobang chu Pakai na Pathen henga nalhut diu ahi.  
\v 9 Chule hitobang ho chu danthempuho henga aphatcha napui diu ahi. Ama hon achung chang thu angai diu chuteng thulhuhna asem diu ahi.  
\v 10 Ama hon thulhuhna asem uchu Pakai muntheng lama nahin lhut diu, ama hon asei bang uva nabol diu ahi.  
\v 11 Dan dungjuiya thulhuhna chu ahin phondoh tengu leh, thulhuhna jouse chu ahina banga chelha ding, imacha na hapbe thei tah lou diu ahi.  
\v 12 Koi hileh Pakai na Pathen angsunga thutan vaihom ho natohna deilou vetsahna jal'a kisa auma ahileh, thina chang ding ahi. Hitia chu phatlouna kiti phot Israel mite lah a konna na nomang diu ahi.  
\v 13 Hitobang chu mijousen ahin jah sohkei diu, chuteng koima aphalouva chon ngam talou ding ahi.   
\s1 Leng ding kilhenna  
\p
\v 14 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsung nalhun diu ahitai. Hiche gamsung nalhun tengu leh, ilamkai diuvin leng khat, namdang te kivaipohna bangin tungdoh tau hite tia nasei diu ahi. \x + \xo 17:14 \xt 1 Samuel 8:5\x*  
\v 15 Chutengleh Israel mite lah a Pakai na Pathen'un atundoh ding ahi. Hichu nalah uva mikhat pen pang ding, amavang kholjin mi nalhen theilou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Lenga pang ding pen chun, sakol kangtalai ngaichat jeh a mikhat tou Egypt gam'a sakol kangtalai cho dinga asol theilou ding ahi. Ajeh chu nangho Egypt gam nakile kit theilou diu ahitai. \x + \xo 17:16 \xt 1 Lgt 10:28; 2 Thusimbu 1:16; 9:28\x*  
\v 17 Lengpa chun jitampi anei theilou ding ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon Pakai a konna apuimang thei u ahi. Chule ama ding jenga jong sana leh dangka akikhol theilou ding ahi. \x + \xo 17:17 \xt 1 Lgt 11:1-8; \xt 1 Lgt 10:14-22,27; 2 Thusimbu 1:15; 9:27\x*   
\p
\v 18 Leng touna mun alo tengleh, amapa chun danbu akilah ding, alal-touna mun'a chu akikoi ding ahi.  
\v 19 Hiche danbu lekhajol chu akom'a akoi ding adamlai sunga asim jing ding ahi. Hichea konna chu dan leh thupeh ijakai Pakaiya kon'in aum'e ti amu chet ding, dengchang tah a ajui jing ding ahi.  
\v 20 Hiche lekhajol asima konna chu kiletsahna pum'a, achenkhompi mijouse sanga chungnung kahi tia umlou ding ahi. Chule hichea konna hi lamchom'a kihei mang louva um jing ding kahi tijong ahetdoh thei ding ahi. Keima leh ka chilhah ten Israel sung hi akhang akhanga ka vaihop diu ahi, tijong hetdohna anei thei diu ahi.   
\c 18  
\s1 Thempuho chanvou  
\p
\v 1 Thempu hon hiche hi na geldoh jing diu ahi, ajeh chu Israel insung mijouse lah a Levi insung kailhah hi chenna ding gam changlou ahiuve. Hijeh a chu Thempua pang Levi mite hon Pakaiya dia kitodoh chengse hi chang diu ahi.  
\v 2 Israel nam sunga konna gamtum neilou ahiuvin, Pakai hi amaho dinga agoulupen'u ahitan, hichu aheng uva Pakai kitepna ahi. \x + \xo 18:2 \xt Minbu 18:20\x*   
\p
\v 3 Hichengse hi mihon gancha dinga ahin choi lah a thempu ho chan ding chu ahi: bongchal ahin kelngoi hijongleh ama hon adah, abieng, agilpi chengse chu thempupa henga apehlut diu ahi.  
\v 4 Nanghon jong na lousoh gau lhung masaho, lengpitwi, chang, thaotwi chule na kelngoi mul kivou masapen chu napeh diu ahi.  
\v 5 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un phung jouse lah a Levi insung mite hi imatih chan'a ama lhacha a pang dia alhen doh ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Chule Israel mite chenna khopiho lah a chu Levi miten adeisah laiyu Pathen houna mun'a ahin lhendoh diu ahi.  
\v 7 Levi dang ho banga kigel'a Pakai na Pathen min pan a akin bol'a pang jeng thei diu, chuteng Pakai angsunga natong jing Levi mite banga akin bol'a pang diu ahi.  
\v 8 Ama insung mite a kon thilpeh ijat um jongleh, thil kitohdoh jouse aneh khopset aneh thei diu ahi.   
\s1 Atheng dinga kouna  
\p
\v 9 Nangho Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsung nahin jot tengu leh, chingtheiyun hiche gamsunga namtin vaipi chonna dan thet umtah tah ho khu najui louhel diu ahi.  
\v 10 Nangho lah a konna koiman achanu ham achapa ham khat chu meiya agoa kilhaina a amanchah thei louhel ding ahi. Doithu hihen, phunsanna hihen, ipi doi mangcha hijongleh, \x + \xo 18:10 \xt Thempu Dan 19:26; \xt Potdohbu 22:18\x*  
\v 11 bum'a bolna hihen, thilha a konna gao boltheina hihen, mitphel doithepna chule thilha a konna gaothem kiti jong khat jeng cha nalah uva konna um thei louding ahi. \x + \xo 18:11 \xt Thempu Dan 19:31\x*  
\v 12 Hitobanga chon mihem chu Pakaiya dinga thet umtah ahi. Hijeh a chu Pakai na Pathen'un nangho masanga hiche lai mun'a cheng ho jouse ana delmang ahi.  
\v 13 Chule nangho Pakai na Pathen uva dia mikitah nahi tei diu ahi. \x + \xo 18:13 \xt Matt 5:48\x*  
\v 14 Ajeh chu hiche mun'a cheng mite hon doithem ho thusei angaiyun, amavang Pakai na Pathen'un hitobang hoa na chon diu aphal pon ahi.   
\s1 Themgao atah le alhem ho  
\p
\v 15 Mose'n avelin aseikit in, Israel te lah a konna Pakai na Pathen'un kei bang banga thempu khat nahin tundoh peh diu ahi. Chuteng nang hon ama thu chu na ngai uva na khohsah cheh diu ahi. \x + \xo 18:15 \xt Act 3:22; 7:37\x*  
\v 16 Nanghon Sinai Molchunga mipi ho kikhop nikhon Pakai na Pathen'u henga nadei, nangai chan hiti hin na seiyun ahi. Pakai ka Pathen'u awgin leh ama a konna meikong kilah chu neijah sah kit hih hel un, ajeh chu hitobang kajah uva kamu uva konna chu keiho ka thilo jeng theiyu ahi, natiuve.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin Pakaijin keima henga aseijin, ama hon asei chan uhi adih lheh jeng'e, ati.  
\v 18 Chule Pakaijin aseijin keiman na sopite lah a konna hi nang tobang khat ka tundoh ding, hiche themgaopa kamsunga chu ijakai ka thumop sohkei ding, hichea konna chu keiman ama ka thumop bang banga aman jong mite jouse athupeh son ding ahi.  
\v 19 Koi hijongleh hiche themgaopa thusei nahsah lou aum'a ahileh, amapa chunga chu lhenchilna lhung ding ahi. \x + \xo 18:19 \xt Act 3:23\x*  
\v 20 Keima thupeh kalval'a chon auma chule pathen limsemthu minpan'a thuseiya pang themgao khattou aum ngei ngeiya ahileh, amapa chunga chu thina lhung teitei ding ahi, tin aseiye.   
\p
\v 21 Hichea chu nang hon Pakai thusei ahipoi, tia lung opkaina na lungthim sung uva nanei khah uva ahileh,  
\v 22 themgao khat in thu aseiya athu seidoh aguilhun'a ahilouleh adihlou tengleh, hitobang chu Pathen akon mong ahipoi ti photchetna ahi. Themgaopa chun ama macham cham'a asei ahin, hitobang themgao chu gin jong nagin louhel diu ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Bitna khopi ho  
\p
\v 1 Pakai na Pathen'un nangho napeh nau gamsunga cheng mite ahin suhgam teng, nang hon agamsung pumpiu chuleh a in jouseu nalo diu akhopi uva nachen diu ahi. \x + \xo 19:1 \xt Joshua 20:1-9\x*  
\v 2 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsunga na chenlut tengu leh, nang hon hiche gamsung chu chenna dinga khopi thum na lhendoh diu ahi.  
\v 3 Hitia chu Pakaijin napeh nau gamsung chu gamkai thum naso diu, hiche gamkaiya chu khopi khat cheh um ding ahi. Nalah uva konna koi tobang mithat auma ahileh, ama chu hiche sunga chu jamlut a kihuhdoh thei ding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Mikhat touvin kidoupi beiya, khat chu amoh tha khah tah a ahileh, khopi khat pen pen achu jamlut a kihuhhing thei ahi.  
\v 5 Tekahnan, mikhat chu asopipa toh gamlah lama thing phuh dinga akon doh a thing aphuh laitah a aheicha lap chu aki khodoh a, asopipa chu akhokhah jeng tah a ahileh, aheicha chun asopi chu akho khah a thina atokhah a ahileh, mithat khapa chu khopi thum holah a khat pen pen a jamlut a ahinkho aki huhdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Chule kihuhdohna dinga khopi chu agamlat behseh a ahileh, akahlah a phula thei khat touvin ahin delkhum'a atha jeng thei ahi. Hinlah mithat khapa chun akidoupi hilouvin, khutsoi jeh a atha khah ahi.  
\v 7 Hitobanga kon kivendoh theina ding chun, keiman naheng uva khopi thum sem uvin kati ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Pakai na Pathen'un napu napa teu khanga pat napehsau gamsung hi akehlet ding, agamsung hi aboncha na pehdoh diu  
\v 9 chuteng nang hon khopi thum na lhendoh bediu ahi. (Chingthei tah a ka thupeh na ngaiyuva Pakai na Pathen na ngailut uva alampi nache uva ahileh Aman hiche gam pumpi hi napeh diu ahi).  
\v 10 Hitia chu nabol uva ahileh, Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau hiche gamsunga hi mona beihel'a thina umlou ding ahi. Chuteng monabei ho thina jal'a mo nachan lou diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 11 Hinlah koitobang khat chun asopi ahotbol'a, chang lhih jinga aum a, adel khum jenga ahileh, hiche tolthatpa chu khopi ho lah a khat pen'a chu jamlut a kisel jeng thei ahi.  
\v 12 Chuteng upa chense chu kon uva mithat pa chu khopi sunga aga holdoh diu, ama hon aga mudoh diu amapa chu phulahna a ahin lhut diu, athina ding chan gotna apeh uva, thina achansah diu ahi.  
\v 13 Tolthatpa chunga chu lainatna ima na neilou diu ahi! Hichu Israel mite lah a konna thisan sona chu na suhbei diu; hichu nangho dinga aphalam'a pang ding joh ahi.   
\s1 Adih a thutan khohsah ding  
\p
\v 14 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsung nalhun tengu leh nanei nagou hou, napu napa teuva pat gamgi song kitung ho chu khat jeng cha jong na bodoh lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 19:14 \xt Danbu Ni Na 27:17\x*   
\p
\v 15 Themmona jouse lah a konna mikhat sehseh in themmo thu aseiya konna, adang khat chu themmo namoh chansah lou diu ahi. Hitobang chu hettohsah mini ham mithum ham ahi tengleh bou themmo kichan sah bep ding ahi. \x + \xo 19:15 \xt Minbu 35:30; Danbu Ni Na 17:6; Matt 18:16; Jn 8:17; 2 Crth 13:1; 1 Tim 5:19; Heb 10:28\x*   
\p
\v 16 Midang khat chu muda man maimaiya konna adih louva bol jeng louding, hettohsah tothoa doumah a abolthei louding,  
\v 17 chule mini chu akidouva ahileh anigel'a Pakai angsung leh thempu ho masang leh thutan vaihom ho henga hung cheh ding ahi.  
\v 18 Chutengleh thutan vaihom hon achan chin thu chu giltah a akhol diu ahi. Hinlah jou leh nal thua Israel khattou ahehset a ahileh,  
\v 19 hitobanga ahehsepa chu gotna peh chang ding ahi. Hitobang thil phalou chu nalah uva konna na suhmang diu ahi.  
\v 20 Chuteng midang jousen ahin jah sohkei uva, kichat nan alhun den diu, nangho jouse lah a thilse kiti him him abolkit tah lou diu ahi.  
\v 21 Hiche ho tobang gitlouna ahin koima khoto hih un! Gotna chang dia dan chu, hinkho khel'a hinkho, mit khel'a mit, ha khel'a ha, khut khel'a khut chule keng khel'a keng lah ding ahi. \x + \xo 19:21 \xt Potdohbu 21:23-25; Thempu Dan 24:19,20; Matt 5:38\x*   
\c 20  
\s1 Galsat miho dinga dan kisem ho  
\p
\v 1 Na galmi teu toh kisat dinga na kondoh tengu leh, sakol ahin kangtalai, nanghoa sanga tamjo namu diu, hinlah na kichat loudiu ahi. Ajeh chu nangho Egypt gamsunga konna nahin puidoh pau Pakai na Pathen'un naumpi jing uve!  
\v 2 Galmun nalhun kahseuva, nalah uva thempupa chu mipi jouse masang lam'a na makai sah diu ahi.  
\v 3 Chule mipi henga thu asei ding, 'Ngaiyun, vo Israel te ! Kichatna jong neihih un, ajeh chu tunia nangho nacheuva amaho khu naga kisatpi diu ahi! Na galmi teu kichat nan kihot hih unlang, gin jong nagin loudiu ahi.  
\v 4 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un nangho na lhonpi diu ahi! Na masang lam uva lamkai jing ding, galjona nachan diu ahi!'   
\p
\v 5 Chuphat leh gal vaipoa pang hon mipi henga hitia hi asei diu, 'Koiham inthah tungdoh a thenso louva koi? Nalah uva hitobang mihem chu auma ahileh, ama chu in a kile hen! Galmun'a na athiden khah tah a ahileh, na in chu midangin athenso khah ding ahi.  
\v 6 Lengpilei laiya natonga lengpi thei tepkha lou koiham? Amapa jong chu inlama kile jeng thei ahi. Achuti louva ahileh galmun'a thina ato jeng thei, alengpi lei jeng jong midang chan lo ding ahi.  
\v 7 Hiche bang chun pasal koi tobang khat chu jinei dinga kigosa dem a umta, ahinlah jinei loulai koi ham? Ama jong chu in kilea jinei thei ahi. Ajeh chu galmun'a thina nachan'a naji ding nu chu midang chang jeng thei ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Chule sepai vaihom natonga pang hon mipi henga hitia hi asei nahlai diu ahi. Meidoi, kichase um em? Aumleh in a kile hen, ajeh chu midang asuh meidoilo ding ahi, tia asei diu ahi.  
\v 9 Sepai vaihom natonga pangho chun sepai ho henga hitia chu asei chai sohkei tengu leh, aloi loiya lamkai alhendoh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Chule khopi khat na bulu kon uleh, amasan hiche khopi chu kichampi din tem un.  
\v 11 Hiche khopi chun natep nau ahin ngaiyuva, kelkotpi chu na honpeh uva ahileh, na vaihomna noiyuva um diu, nakin'u bollea pang diu ahi.  
\v 12 Ahinlah kicham ding gel louva kidoupi ding joh agel uva ahileh, khopi chu nabulu tei ding ahi.  
\v 13 Chuteng Pakai na Pathen'un hiche khopi chu nangho khut a ahin pehlut ding, na chemjam uva pasal jouse natha diu ahi.  
\v 14 Hinlah numei le chapang, thilkeo ho nakikoi khom diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un khopi sunga konna chu nopsa tah a na manchah diuva napeh u ahitai.   
\p
\v 15 Nachen nauva konna gamla tah a um khopi ho, hitia chu nabol sohkei diu ahi.  
\v 16 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau hiche khopi chengsea chu naum tengu leh, ahing thei jouse na suhgam diu ahi.  
\v 17 Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un naseipeh bang uva, Hit mite, Amor mite, Canan mite, Periz mite, Hiv mite chule Jebus mite hijongleh abonchauva na suhgam hel diu ahi.  
\v 18 Chutileh hiche mite a konna chu milim doi kisemthu ho a konna na kihei mang thei diu, amaho pathen semthua konna na kiventup uva, nalhah lutlou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Khopi khat bulu dinga phat sotpi naum kim tengu leh thingphung naphuh lou diu ahi. Aga neuvin, hinlah aphung phuh hih un, thingphung ho chu na galmi teu ahipoi.  
\v 20 Hinlah thingphung aphachompoi tia nagel houvang chu naphuh uva, khopi sunga gal mite toh kidouna gal manchah a naman theiyu ahi\f + \fr 20:20 \ft \f*.   
\c 21  
\s1 Toltha jeh a dan  
\p
\v 1 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsunga chu thise khat tou auma, ahivanga hiche thise chu koitha pen ham ti kihedoh theilou ahi.  
\v 2 Chutobang dinmun chu aum khah tah a ahileh, na upateu leh vaihom natong chengse chu hung diu, na khopiu leh akimvel'a khopi chengse chu phatah a atetoh sohkei diu ahi.  
\v 3 Hitia chu abol diu thina tohpa umna a konna chu, khopi akinaipi pen chu mo kichan ding ahi. Bong ala khat lou natong khaloulai hichu agakai diu ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche mochanga khopi sung mite chun, bongla chu phaicham lah khat a ahin kai diu, hiche phaicham chu lou natohna a kimang khalou hi ding, phaicham mun'a chu bongla gol chu angong chang aheboh diu ahi.  
\v 5 Chuteng Levi thempuho abonchauva amasang lama hung masa diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un amaho chu akin natong dinga alhendohsa ahin, Levi thempu ho thusah bang banga kinopmona leh kinah baotam jouse aboncha thuchaina um ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Thisepa umna toh kinaina mun'a bongla kithana mun'a chu, khopi sunga upaho jousen twiya akhut akisop cheh diu ahi.  
\v 7 Hichu amaho dinga hettohsahna a pang ding, “Keiho khut a konna hiche thise hi thisan kiso ahipoi, thisan kiso pet jeng jong kamu hih hel uve,” tia asei diu ahi.  
\v 8 O Pakai, nangman nahuhdohsa nami Israel mite hi ngaidam tan, hiche themmona thisan kisona ho jal'in nami Israel te chunga lethuhna neihih helin, thisan kiso jal'a amaho chunga lethuhna achan nalou dinga, taona anei peh teitei diu ahi.  
\v 9 Hitia chu nangman jong mona beihel'a thisan kisona chung changa konna Pakai, mitmua adih a natohna chu nabol tengu leh suhthengna jong nanei diu ahi.   
\s1 Numei kimanho thu  
\p
\v 10 Na melma teu toh gal kisat dinga na kondoh tengu leh Paka na Pathen'un na melma teu chu nangho henga ahin pehdoh khah tah uva ahileh, nangman jong amaho chu gal hinga nahin kai ding ahi.  
\v 11 Chule hiche gal hing lah a konna chu numei mel-hoitah na kimudoh uvin, naji diuvin nadeiyun ahi.  
\v 12 Hichu ahitah leh, inlam'a nahin pui diu, alu avotol ding, atin akitan ding,  
\v 13 gal hinga akivonna von chu akikhel ding ahi. Na insunga chu cheng ding, ahinlah lha lhungkeiya anu leh apa pul adou ding ahi. Chuteng amanu chu na kichenpi ding, amanu najinu hi a chule nangma amanu jipa nahi ding ahi.  
\v 14 Ahin amanu naki chenpia amanun na lunglhaisah louva ahileh, amanu chu man beiya nasol ding ahitai. Amanu chu najoh ahilouleh soh banga nabol louding ahi, ajeh chu amanu chu na suhchulsa ahitai.   
\s1 Chapa tah ho goulo  
\p
\v 15 Koitobang pasal khat chun numei ji ni akop in, khatnu alungset in khatnu vang chu alungset poi, ahivangin chapa ahing cheh lhon tan ahi. Chule tekah in chapa apen masa chu adeimo nun ahin ahi.  
\v 16 Mipa chun khonunga achapa te thil leh lo ahin hoppeh nikho tengleh, adeimo johnu chapa sanga chu adeinu chapa chu gelkhohna aneiya langneina jong anei thei louding, apeng masa chu apeng masa bang banga abol thou thou ding ahi.  
\v 17 Adeimo johnu chapa chu achapa lah a atah pen ahi tia aphondoh ding, anei agou jouse lah a chan nia tam joa apeh ding ahi. Ajeh chu ama dia chapa masapen ahin, mi-upa chan ding chu achansah thou thou ding ahi.   
\s1 Sei ngailou chapa  
\p
\v 18 Tekah khat in mipa khat in chapa louchal, thunun tei agot vangun anu apa jalouvin aumtai.  
\v 19 Chutobang dinmun a chu, achapa chu anu leh apan jong khopi kelkot lama, thutan vaihom ho henga ahin puilut jeng lhon ding ahi.  
\v 20 Chuteng anu leh apan jong khopi vaihom ho jah a, 'Hiche ka chapa hi doumah jeng aboldoh tan chule kathu lhon jong angai hih hel in, milop tah le phatseh a jukhamna a hinkho mang jeng ahitai,' ati lhon ding ahi.  
\v 21 Chutengleh hitobang miphalou chu khopi sunga cheng mipi ho chun songa aselih jeng diu ahi. Hiche hi Israel pumpin amu sohkei uva, kichaa um diu ahi.   
\s1 Dan dang dang ho  
\p
\v 22 Mihem khat touvin thina chan gotna pehna thei chonset a alhah khah tah a, amapa chu tha teitei ding ahi tah leh, ama chu thing chunga konna na khailih jeng theiyu ahi,'  
\v 23 amavang hiche na khailih pau chu khovah chana na khaiden theilou diu, anikho mama a navuidoh diu ahi, ajeh chu koi hileh akikhailih chu Pathen mitmu a gaosapna ahi. Pakai na Pathen'un goulo dinga napeh nau gamsung chu gaosapna a konna hitia chu naven diu ahi. \x + \xo 21:23 \xt Gal 3:13\x*   
\c 22  
\p
\v 1 Na sopi bongchal ham khat tou avahmang namu a ahileh, hichu nakimu mosah lou diu, don nahsahmo a na koilou diu, amavang namu chan uchu na sopi henga nahin kailut joh diu ahi. \x + \xo 22:1 \xt Potdohbu 23:4,5\x*  
\v 2 Hiche gancha neipa chu nangma inlam toh kigamla a um ahia, achenna nahet lou uva ahileh agancha chu nang hon na inlam uva nahin kai diu, aneipa na sopi pan ahung hol kahsea na ventup peh diu ahung hol tengleh phate cha a na lepeh diu ahi.  
\v 3 A sangan ham, asangkhol ham, ipi hitaleh namu u chu hitima a chu nabol peh diu ahi. Na mopoh nau chu nahsahmo a nabol lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Na sopi khat sangan ham, bongchal ham khat chu lampia alhusa namu khah uva ahileh, hichu napanpi tei diu ahi. Na sopi gancha alhua chu na phohdoh peh diu, na huhdoh diu ahi.  
\v 5 Chule nalah uva numeijin pasal chunga kaisa akivonna ponsil chu kivonna a aman thei louhel ding, hitobanga chon chan chu Pakai na Pathen dinga thet umtah ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Vabu hamkhat chu na tokhah uva hichu tollham ham thingchung ham khat a um, vabu sunga chu atwi ham anou ham khat chu vapin aop khum lai ahileh, hichu anousen puma namat thauva na suhgam lou diu ahi.  
\v 7 Ahinlah vapi chu nadel mang uva ahileh, anou chengse chu nakilo thei diu ahi, achutileh phattheina jong nachan diu chule nangho dinga hinkho sotna a pang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Chule nang hon in thah nasah tengu jongleh, bilha nunga konna mi akheh lhahna louding, thisan jal'a themmona achuh louna dinga, bilha gol jousea aki taan denna ding na sempeh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chule na lengpilei laiyuva muchi ni na tukop theilou diu, muchi ni natu kop uva ahileh hichu munthenga todoh dinga kisang thei louding ahi. \x + \xo 22:9 \xt Thempu Dan 19:19\x*   
\p
\v 10 Bongchal ham sangan ham khat chu, lou kainaa naman kop theilou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Tupat kihel leh patchom kihel khom jong mangcha a kisilna a naman theilou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Na kivonna diu na sangkhol chol mongu ningli a chu, pat hol khat cheh naba diu ahi. \x + \xo 22:12 \xt Minbu 15:37-41\x*   
\s1 Jonthanhoina chunga dan kisem  
\p
\v 13 Pasal khat chun numei aji dinga akipuija, alup khompia chujou le numeinu chu athet bol jeng louding ahi.  
\v 14 Hiche numei nu chu jachatna leh jumna dimset a alha jenga, 'Hiche numei nu chu ka kichenpin ahileh, athenglou ahitai,' tia asei khah ngei ngeiya ahileh,  
\v 15 hiche numei nu chu anu leh apan jong khopi sung lam kelkot a thutan vaihom ho henga chu apuilut lhon ding, amanu hi atheng mong mong ahi nai, ti photchetna agabol lhon ding ahi.  
\v 16 Chuteng numeinu pan jong hitia hi aphondoh ding, hiche pasalpa toh hin kicheng ding mong monga kana pehdohsa chu ahitai. Ahinlah pasal pan vang muda in solmang ding ago e, tia asei ding ahi.  
\v 17 Hiche pan amanu dingin jachatna umtah in achonin, “Hiche na chanu chunga hin nungah thengsel ahina ima ka mudoh tapoi,” tin aseije. Ahin apan jong ka chanu hi nungah theng mong mong ahi, tia photchetna upaho henga alupna ponpha avetsah diu ahi.  
\v 18 Chujou tengleh khopi sunga upa hon jong hiche pasalpa chu amat uva gotna apeh diu ahi.  
\v 19 Chule pasalpa chu dangka shekel jakhat a aleusah diu, hiche dangka shekel jakhat chu nungahnu hingpa chang ding ahi. Ajeh chu hiche pasalpa chun Israel nungah khat aminset sah jeh ahi. Chule numeinu jong jia anei ding, ahinkho lhum keiya dinga ajia pang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Amavang nungahnu chunga chu, atheng'e ti photchetna aum thei tapoi.  
\v 21 Amaho chun hiche nungahnu chu apa in kotphunga konna ahin kaidoh diu, chuteng khopi sunga cheng jousen amanu chu songa aselih jeng diu ahi. Ajeh chu hiche numeinu chu chondih louna mangchan aki ngolsah tan, Israel insunga, apa insunga hiti chun ana chon tan ahi. Hitobanga chon chan phalou jouse chu na suhdih jing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Chule pasal khat chun pasal dang jikhat chu aluppi khah tah a ahileh, numeinu ahin pasal pa ahin anigel lhonna thina chang lhon ding ahi. Hitobanga chu Israel sunga thil dihlou chonna jouse na suhbei diu ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Chule khopi sunga nungah thengsel khat chu pasal khat touvin, kholai dung ham khat a chu aki timatpi jeng tah a ahileh,  
\v 24 amani chu khopi sung lam kelkot phunga nahin kaidoh diu, ani lhona songa na selih jeng diu ahi. Ajeh chu min apanpi theina dingin amanu apeng pon ahi. Pasal pa chu thi ding ahi ajeh chu aman midang ji asuh set jeng ahi. Hitobanga chu, nalah uva konna chon chan phalou na suhtheng diu ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hinlah pasal khat in jinei dia khaokhisa nungah khat atokhah a asuhset a ahileh, pasalpa bou chu thi ding ahi.  
\v 26 Numeinu chunga hi ima kilo theilou ding ahi; ajeh chu numeinu chunga hin thina chan gotna peh ding aumpoi. Amanu chu khohelou kithat insung tobang ahi.  
\v 27 Ajeh chu hiche numeinu chu pasal pan gamlah a adel khum a akitimatpi ahin, numei khangdong nun jong kithopi ding ngaicha in apengin, hinlah koiman ajah pehlou ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Tekahnan pasal khat touvin nungahtheng jinei dia khaokhi loulai khat chu akitimatpin ahi. Amaho chu akimat doh a ahileh, \x + \xo 22:28 \xt Potdohbu 22:16,17\x*  
\v 29 hiche pasalpa chun nungahnu pa chu dangka shekel somnga apeh ding ahi. Ajeh chu amapa chun numeinu chu akitimatpia asuhchul ahitan, ahinkho lhum keiya ji dinga akipui ding ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Pasal khat chun apa jimasa chu akichenpi theilou ding ahi, ajeh chu hichu pa nahsah louna ahi.   
\c 23  
\s1 Hou chungchanga chon dan ho  
\p
\v 1 Pasal khat chu til lahsa leh hinpi kitansa ahileh, amapa chu Pakaiya kikhopna mun'a pang theilou ding ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nalah uva danngai louva peng aum'a ahileh, ama ahilouleh achilhah chu khang som chan Pakaiya kikhopna mun'a pang theilou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ammon mite ahilouleh Moab mite ahilouleh koipen hijongleh achilhah teu chu khang som chan Pakaiya kikhopna mun'a pang theilou diu ahi. \x + \xo 23:3 \xt Nehemiah 13:1,2\x*  
\v 4 Hiche nam mite hon Egypt gamsunga konna nahung potdoh uchun an le twijin nana lamto pouvin ahi. Chusangin. Aram-naharaim gam Pethor a Beor chapa Balaam chu na gaosap diuvin athalah uvin ahi. \x + \xo 23:4 \xt Minbu 22:1-6\x*  
\v 5 Ahinlah Pakai na Pathen'un Balaam thusei chu anahsah poi. Ama'n gaosapna chu phatthei nan aheidoh e ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un na ngailu uvin ahi. \x + \xo 23:5 \xt Minbu 23:7—24:9\x*  
\v 6 Na hinlai chan uva nang hon Ammon mite ahilouleh Moab mite cham lenna ding leh ahaosatna diuva lampi ima nasem doh peh theilou diu ahi.  
\v 7 Amavang Edom mite ahilouleh Egypt mite nanol theilou diu ahi, ajeh chu Edom mite chu na kinaipiu Egypt te lah a gamdang mi na khosah khompi teu ahiuve.  
\v 8 Edom le Egypt mite chengse vang khang thum alhin tengleh Pakaiya kikhopna mun'a lha thei diu ahi.   
\s1 Dan dang ho  
\p
\v 9 Chule na melmateu toh gal kisat dinga na kondoh tengu leh, nangho jong thil boh kiti phot a naki kangse diu ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Pasal khat chu jankhang laijin apasal hina thisan pot tahen lang hileh houlam dol'a aboh ahitan ama chun nilhum'a ngahmun adalhah ding ahi.  
\v 11 Nilhah lam tengleh vang ama chu twiya kisutheng ding, nilhum lam teng ngahmun sunga hung lut thei ding ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Ngahmun polama chu mun kicheh khat nanei diu hiche a chu na kisuh navah thei diu ahi.  
\v 13 Nang hon na thil nei lah uva tupheng hi nanei cheh diu ahi. Nangma cheh na kisuh navah jouteng uleh tupheng a lei nalai uva navuh diu ahi.  
\v 14 Ngahmun chu theng ding ahi, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin nang ho ventupna le na galmi teu sat dinga ngahmun avelkol ke ahi. Aman nalah uva jachat um thil amudoh louding, achuti louleh nangho a konna kiheimang ding ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Aneipa a konna hung jamdoh soh chu, nang hon aneipa chu namoh peh jeng theilou diu ahi.  
\v 16 Ama toh chun na chenkhom jing diu, hoilai mun'a hijongleh na khopi sung uva chu aman adeilhenna mun pen a chu nachen sah jeng diu ahi. Chule hiche soh chu nang hon jong achunga gimna ima nalhun sah theilou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Israel mite numei hihen pasal hijongleh noti um theilou ding ahi. \x + \xo 23:17 \xt Thempu Dan 19:29\x*  
\v 18 Kitepna suh bulhitna dinga thilto nachoi ding tengleh, numei hihen pasal hijongleh noti hina a kimu sum chu Pakai na Pathen in'a nachoi theilou diu ahi, ajeh chu hiche teni hi Pakai na Pathen uva dinga thet umtah ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Na Israel mi chanpi henga sumpa, anneh, ipi hijongleh napeh teng akan um'a napeh theilou ding ahi. \x + \xo 23:19 \xt Potdohbu 22:25; Thempu Dan 25:36,37; Danbu Ni Na 15:7-11\x*  
\v 20 Amavang hitobang chu gamchom miho chunga nabol thei diu, ahinlah nasopi kiti pou chunga athoi neiya napeh theilou diu ahi. Athoi nalah lou uva ahileh tua na chenlutna diu mun'a khu Pakai na Pathen'un phatthei naboh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Pakai na Pathen uva dia thil khat peh ding natiuva ahileh hichu napeh ding tengu leh lungkihna ima nanei louhel diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'un nangho chunga ahin del khum jeng ding, napeh lou uva ahileh hichu nangho dinga chonset a kisim ding ahi. \x + \xo 23:21 \xt Minbu 30:1-16; Matt 5:33\x*  
\v 22 A ipi chu hitaleh, kitepna nanei lou uva ahileh hichu chonset a kisim lou ahi.  
\v 23 Ahinlah kiphalthehg tah a na kitem nahi tah a ahileh, Pakai na Pathen'u kom'a chingtheijin bulhit un.   
\p
\v 24 Naheng nakom lengpi leiya nalut tengu leh nadei chanin neuvin, ahin na paipeh uva na pohdoh lou diu ahi.  
\v 25 Chule naheng nakom loulaiya nache lut tengu leh, avui chu na kisi theiyu ahi, amavang, koite a na-at theilou diu ahi.   
\c 24  
\p
\v 1 Vetsahnan pasal khat in numei khat akichenpi'n numei nun alunglhai sah pon ahi. Amanu chunga thil dihlou amudoh in, ama pan dana lekha ajih in, amanu khut a apen, chule a in'a konin amanu asoldoh tai.\x + \xo 24:1 \xt Matt 5:31; 19:7; Mk 10:4\x*  
\v 2 Amanun in adalhah chun, hiche pa a konna chamlhat ahitan pasal dang khat toh kicheng thei ahitai.  
\v 3 Ahin pasal anina pa jong chun dana lekha apen, amanu khut a apen, asoldoh in, ahilouleh amapa chu athi khah tah leh,  
\v 4 aji masapa chun akichenpi kit thei tah louding ahi, ajeh chu akisuboh ahitai. Hitobang thil ho hi Pakaiya dia thet umtah ahi. Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsunga hitobang thil dihlou ho hi na pohlut lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Pasal khat chu ajinei thah ahileh, amapa chu galsat mia panda hen chule natoh dang jong bolsah louding ahi. Kum khat lhingset a inmun'a um ding, alungdei pennu chutoh nom'a um khom ding ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Thil bat a kiphaldoh hung kisah kah a umden dia chang goina song teni ahilouleh achungnung pa hijongleh lah ding hi adihpoi, ajeh chu aneipan hinna a anei ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Koi hileh asopi Israel mi khat tou aguh a soh banga abol a, ahilouleh akijoh mang jenga ahileh agupa chu thi ding ahi. Hitia hi, nalah uva chona phalou ho chu na suhtheng diu ahi. \x + \xo 24:7 \xt Potdohbu 21:16\x*   
\p
\v 8 Vun natna khoh tah jouse thudol hi, Levi thempu hon nahilna bang uvin chingtheiyun, thupeh kapeh jouseu abonchan nit uvin.\x + \xo 24:8 \xt Thempu Dan 13:1—14:54\x*   
\p
\v 9 Egypt gam'a konna nahung potdoh uva Pakai na Pathen'un Miriam abolna chu geldoh un. \x + \xo 24:9 \xt Minbu 12:10\x*   
\p
\v 10 Ipi thil hitaleh naheng nakom thil bat a napeh tengleh, ahin sahkit kah a umden dia thil nahin peh chu la dingin lut jeng hih in.\x + \xo 24:10 \xt Potdohbu 22:26,27\x*  
\v 11 Ama insunga lut a na henga ahin choidoh kah a pam langa na nga ding ahi.  
\v 12 Naheng nakompa chu mi vaicha ahi a chule bat hinsah kah a umden dia asangkhol chol ahin peh leh, jan khovah a jong asangkhol chol chu nakoi louding ahi.  
\v 13 Nilhum tengleh sangkhol chol neipa chu na nungpeh ding hiche jal a chu aman jan khovah a lum asah a phatthei naboh ding, chule Pakai na Pathenin chonpha a nasim ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Na khopi uva na Israel chanpi hihen gamdang mi hijongleh, mi vaicha le lengvaiya natong mi chunga phatchomna nahol louhel diu ahi. \x + \xo 24:14 \xt Thempu Dan 19:13\x*  
\v 15 Atohman uchu anikho kho a nilhum masang napeh diu ahi ajeh chu vaicha leh hiche a chu kingai ahiuve. Achuti louva ahileh, amaho jong Pakai anga kap uva nangho douna soh thei ahin, chule hichu nang ho dinga chonset a kisim ding ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Minu le mipa ho chu achate chonset jal'a thina ki chansah lou diu, achate chonset jal'a jong anu apate thina ki chansah louding ahi. Amavang koi hileh ama ama chonset jal'a bou chu thina kichan sah ding ahi. \x + \xo 24:16 \xt 2 Lengte 14:6; 2 Thusimbu 25:4; Ezekiel 18:20\x*   
\p
\v 17 Nalah uva cheng gamdang miho leh chagaho chunga adih a thutanna nabol diu, meithai ho ponsil jong thilbat khel a koiden ding thil a na lahpeh thei louhel diu ahi. \x + \xo 24:17 \xt Potdohbu 23:9; Thempu Dan 19:33,34; Danbu Ni Na 27:19\x*  
\v 18 Egypt gamsunga soh nana hiu ahin Pakai na Pathen'un nasoh channa uva konna na-na lhatdoh u chu geldoh jing jengun. Hijeh a chu hiche thupeh hi kapeh nahiuve.   
\p
\v 19 Loulaiya chang at a nakon uva chule na changpal chop hai aum tengleh, hiche chomtup dinga na nungche kit lou diu ahi. Hiche ho chu chaga gamdang mi, chaga le meithai ho dingin dalhan. Chuteng Pakai na Pathen'un nabol natohna jouseuva phatthei naboh diu ahi. \x + \xo 24:19 \xt Thempu Dan 19:9,10; 23:22\x*  
\v 20 Olive thing na vohlhah tengu leh, nivei kal vohih un. Aumden cheng chu gamdang miho, chagaho, methai ho dingin dalha peh un.  
\v 21 Lengpi leiya lengpiga naki chopkhom tengu leh, na dalhah nung uva akhai chengse chu na donlou diu ahi. Ajeh chu gamdang miho, chagaho, methai ho dingin dalha peh un.  
\v 22 Egypt gamsunga ana soh changsa nahiu geldoh jingun. Hijeh a chu hiche thupeh hi kapeh nahiuve.   
\c 25  
\p
\v 1 Vetsahnan mihem tutanna a akiheh lhon leh, thutan ho chun khat chu adih in khat amo e tin aphondoh uvin ahi.  
\v 2 Chule athemmo pa chu voh ding alhah khah tah a ahileh, thutanpa chun athemmo pa chu alupsah ding, them changpa mitmua chu athemmona jat dungjuiya avoh ding ahi.  
\v 3 Ahinlah somli kal navoh theilou diu ahi; hiche kal achu thoh thei louding ahi. Ajeh chu amapa chu miho masang'in kijep jep jing tahen lang hileh, aki neosah behseh jeh achu muset a naum thei diu ahi. \x + \xo 25:3 \xt 2 Crth 11:24\x*   
\p
\v 4 Chang chil a pang bongchal chun aneh theilouna dinga amuh nasom lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chule insunga pasal ni chengkhom teni chu khat joh sang chu chapa beiya thina ato khah tah a ahileh, athipa jinu chu pasal dang angsunga chea jinei thei louding ahi. Amavang, numei nu jipa sopipan akichenpi a akitimatpi ding asopi pa kin chu abulhitpeh ding ahi. \x + \xo 25:5 \xt Matt 22:24; Mk 12:19; Lk 20:28\x*  
\v 6 Hichea chapa ahin masat pen chu asopipa chapa a kisim ding, Israel insunga ama min chu suhmanga um louding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ahinlah adam nalaiya sopipa chun athipa jinu chu deilouva, ji dinga akipui nom tah louva ahileh, asopipa jinu jong che ding kelkot phung lama thutan vaihom ho henga 'Ka jipa sopipan athisa asopipa hi Israel insunga amin ajop nompon eikichenpi poi,' tia agasei ding ahi. \x + \xo 25:7 \xt Ruth 4:7,8\x*  
\v 8 Chuteng hiche khopi sunga upa chengse chun amapa kouna anei diu akihoupi diu ahi. Amavang hichan nunga jong ‘Keiman hichenu hi kaji dinga ka kipui louding ahi’ tia asei nah laiya,  
\v 9 chule asopi jinun jong upa masanga chu anailut ding, amapa kengchot asut peh ding, amai changa chil aset den ding ahi. Chutengleh amanun aphondoh ding, ‘Pasal koi hijongleh asopipa khela insung khat sem doh nomlou chu hitia hi kibol ding ahi,’ tia asei ding ahi.  
\v 10 Hiche jou kalse leh Israel insunga 'akengchot kisut lhah peh pa' insung tia kihe ding ahi!   
\p
\v 11 Pasal khat leh khat chu akinah a pasal khatpa jinu chun khatpa a konna chu ajipa chu huhdoh ding gotna a khatpa chu atilchang a amat a ahileh,  
\v 12 numei chu akhut natan peh diu ahi. Khotona nanei lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Sumkolveina a thil gih tena dihlou naman lou diu, \x + \xo 25:13 \xt Thempu Dan 19:35,36\x*  
\v 14 chule nang hon tena lhingset le kitahna naman diu ahi.  
\v 15 Ahi, phat jousea kitahna a thil nate diu, chuti henlang hileh Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsunga nahin sot diu ahi.  
\v 16 Jou leh kitahna beiya thil teho chu Pakai na Pathen dinga thet umtah ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Egypt a konna nahung potdoh uva Amalek miten nabol nau chu na suhmil louhel diu ahi. \x + \xo 25:17 \xt Potdohbu 17:8-14; 1 Samuel 15:2-9\x*  
\v 18 Ama hon thabei le lhasam'a naum laitah uvin nalonkhom uvin, chule nung langa cheh chaova umho ajeplhu uvin ahi. Ama hon Pathen ginna anei pouve.  
\v 19 Hijeh chun, Pakai na Pathen'un gouupen napeh nau gam'a nagal miteu jousea konna na kikcholdo sah teng ule, nang hon jong vannoi leiset a Amalek mite chenna jouse chu na suhmang hel diu ahi. Hiche hi sumil hihbeh uvin!   
\c 26  
\s1 Lhosoh thilto ho le hopsom ho  
\p
\v 1 Nangho Pakai na Pathen'un goulutah napeh nau gamsung najo uva na chenlut tengu leh,  
\v 2 na lhosoh-gau masa a konna phabep khat na pucha sung uva nakoi khom diu, chuteng ama houna dia Pakai na Pathen'un amin kijabolna dia adeilhenna mun a chu nahin pohlut diu ahi. \x + \xo 26:2 \xt Potdohbu 23:19\x*  
\v 3 Hiche laimun'a thempu natongpa kom'a chu nache uva, 'Hiche thilpeh a hi Pakai na Pathen henga ipu ipateu khanga akihahselna gamsunga keima ka hunglhung tai,' tia ahenga nasei diu ahi.  
\v 4 Thempu pan jong na pucha uchu nalu uva pat na doplhah peh diu Pakai na Pathen'u maicham maiya nakoi peh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Nang hon Pakai na Pathen'u henga hitia hi nasei diu, 'Kapuluiyu Jacob chu Aramea kholjinmi Egypt gam'a gamdang mi banga ana cheng ahi. Ahunglhun uchun a insung mijat jong lhomcha bou ahi, hinlah Egypt gamsunga nam lentah le thahattah ahung hidoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 6 Egypt miten soh a suhgim le engbolna einei tengu leh,  
\v 7 Pakai kapu kapa teu Pathen henga kakap uvin ahi. Aman kakanau ajatan chule ka hahsatnau, ka thoh gimnau jouse amu sohkei tan ahi.  
\v 8 Chutah chun Pakaijin aban thahat apantan, kichat umtah leh melchihna kidang tamtah toh thon Egypt gamsunga kon chun Pathen'in eihin puidoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 9 Hichea kon chun eihin pui galkai uvin ahileh, khoiju le bongnoi lonna gamsunga chun kahung lhung tauvin ahi!  
\v 10 Chule tun, Vo Pakai, leiset a konna gamasa nangin neipeh chu naheng kahin lhut tai. Chutengleh Pakai na Pathen'u angsunga hi natun doh diu, a angsunga dilsua chibai naboh diu ahi.  
\v 11 Hiche jouleh na che uva Pakai na Pathen'un nang leh na insung mite thilpha napeh hou jeh a kipa golnop nabol diu ahi. Kipa golnop a chu Levi te le kholjin miho jaosah ding hi na suhmil lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Kum thum lhin seh leh na anche louhing uva konna achombeh a hopsom napeh diu ahi. Hiche kum chuleh na hopsom uchu Levi te, kholjin miho, naochaga ho le meithai ho napeh diu na khopi houva amahon anneh ninglhinga anei diu ahi.\x + \xo 26:12 \xt Danbu Ni Na 14:28,29\x*  
\v 13 Chutengleh Pakai na Pathen'u angsunga na phondoh diu, 'Keiman nei thupeh bangin ka in'a konin thilpeh theng chu kalan chule hichu Levi te, kholjin miho, naocha ho le meithai ho kapeuvin ahi. Keiman na thupeh ho kasuhmil ahilouleh ka nahsahlou imacha aumpoi.  
\v 14 Ka lunghem pet in hiche ho chu imacha kanepoi; theng louva kaum laiyin jong ka tham poi; chule mithi opnan a jong thilpeh a imacha kamang khapouve. Pakai ka Pathen thupeh chu ka jabolin chule kabol dia eithupeh abon chan kabolin ahi.  
\v 15 Tun na mi Israel te leh kapu kapa teu henga peh dinga na kihahselna gam—khoiju leh bongnoi lonna gam chu na chenna van muntheng'a kon chun hin ven chule phatthei nei boh tauvin.   
\s1 Pakai thupeh jabol dia kouna  
\p
\v 16 Tunin Pakai na Pathen'un hiche thupeh chondan ho hi na jabol diuvin nape tauve. Hijeh chun na lungthim pumpiuva jabol dingin chingtheiyun.  
\v 17 Tunin Pakai chu ka Pathen'u ahi tin na phongdoh tauvin ahi. Chule alampia lamlha ding, achondan le adan thupeh ho jabol ding le asei jouse bol dinga nakitep u ahitai.  
\v 18 Tunin nang ho hi akitepna banga ama mite, ama goulu mong mong nahiu Pakaijin aphongdoh in, chule nang hon athupeh jouse na jabol diu ahiye.\x + \xo 26:18 \xt Potdohbu 19:5; Danbu Ni Na 4:20; 7:6; 14:2; Tit 2:14; 1 Pet 2:9\x*  
\v 19 Chule chutia chu nabol uva ahile, aman asemsa nam jouse lah a na dopsang diu ahi. Chuteng nang hon choiatna, jabolna le minthanna nanei diu ahi. Akitepna banga nang ho Pakai na Pathen uva dinga nam theng nahi diu ahi.   
\c 27  
\s1 Ebal Mol a Maicham  
\p
\v 1 Chuin Mose le Israel lamkai hon mipi ho hiche thu hi apeuvin: “Tunia kapeh u thupeh ho hi aboncha nanit diu ahi.  
\v 2 Jordan Vadung na galkai uva Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsung nalut tengu leh, song len phabep natun diu hiche ho chu apumpia na suhnam diu ahi. \x + \xo 27:2 \xt Joshua 8:30-32\x*  
\v 3 Pakai na Pathen'un vadung galkaija khoiju leh bongnoi lonna gam'a nalut tah jeh uva Pakai, napu napa teu Pathen henga na teppeh nau banga song ho a chu hilchahna thu ho najih diu ahi.  
\v 4 Tunia kathupeh bang uva Jordan na galkai tengu leh songho chu Ebal Mol a natun uva nasuhjol diu ahi.   
\p
\v 5 “Hiche mun'a chu Pakai na Pathen dinga maicham khat natun doh diu, ama ngaina a um, akitanbong hilou naman diu ahi. Song ho suhtohna thih khutchoi naman lou diu ahi. \x + \xo 27:5 \xt Potdohbu 20:25\x*  
\v 6 Akitantoh lou song ho a maicham mun nasem uva Pakai na Pathen uva dia pumgo thiltona a naman diu ahi.  
\v 7 Chule hiche maicham chunga chu chamna thilto jong natodoh diu, Pakai na Pathen'u angsunga kipa golnop nabolkhom diu ahi.  
\v 8 Song kisunam ho a chu hilchahna thu ho kichehsel'a najih diu ahi.”   
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun Mose le Levi thempu hon aban ban chan Israel jouse heng'ah: “Vo Israel, thipkhen'un chule ngaiyun! Tunin Pakai na Pathen mite nahi tauve.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun Pakai na Pathen'u jabolna a tunia kapeh u thupeh ho leh thulhuh ho hi nanit diu ahi.”   
\s1 Ebal mol a kon gaosapna ho  
\p
\v 11 Hiche nikho ma-ma chun Mosen jong mipi ho chu hiche mopohnna hi apen ahi:  
\v 12 Jordan vadung na galkai tengu leh, Gerizim Mol'a mipi phatthei bohna samphonga ding ding chu phung ho lah a Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Joseph chule Benjamin hi diu ahi. \x + \xo 27:12 \xt Danbu Ni Na 11:29; Joshua 8:33-35\x*  
\v 13 Chule Ebal Mol'a gaosapna sam dia ding ding chu phung ho lah a Reuben, Gad, Asher, Zebulun, Dan chule Naphtali hi diu ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chutengleh Levi miten Israel mipi ho jah a asap diu:   
\b  
\li1
\v 15 'Koi hileh lim semthu sem'a guhthim'a tungdoh a chu gaosap chang hen. Hiche khutthem ho lim semthu chu Pakai dia thet um ahi.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:15 \xt Potdohbu 20:4; 34:17; Thempu Dan 19:4; 26:1; Danbu Ni Na 4:15-18; 5:8\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 16 'Koi hileh anu le apa jabol lou mihem chu gaosap na chang jeng hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:16 \xt Potdohbu 20:12; Danbu Ni Na 5:16\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 17 'Koi hileh aheng akom agamgi sukeh a thil gu a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:17 \xt Danbu Ni Na 19:14\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 18 'Koi hileh lampia mitcho elbai pui chavai a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi. \x + \xo 27:18 \xt Thempu Dan 19:14\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 19 'Koi hileh kholjin ho, chaga ho, ahilouleh meithai ho chunga adih louva thutan a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi. \x + \xo 27:19 \xt Potdohbu 22:21; 23:9; Thempu Dan 19:33,34; Danbu Ni Na 24:17,18\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 20 'Koi hileh apa jite lah a khat pen kitimatpi a chun apa chon dan lamlhah asuhkeh ahin gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi. \x + \xo 27:20 \xt Thempu Dan 18:8; 20:11; Danbu Ni Na 22:30\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 21 'Koi hileh gancha kitimatpi a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:21 \xt Potdohbu 22:19; Thempu Dan 18:23; 20:15\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 22 'Koi hileh asopinu, apa chanu ahilouleh anu chanu kitimatpi a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:22 \xt Thempu Dan 18:9; 20:17\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 23 'Koi hileh ajinu-nu kitimatpi a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:23 \xt Thempu Dan 18:17; 20:14\x*   
\b  
\li1
\v 24 'Koi hileh a inheng te guhthim'a delkhum a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.   
\b  
\li1
\v 25 'Koi hileh themmona bei mi thana dinga sum kilah a chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.   
\b  
\li1
\v 26 'Koi hileh hiche hilchahna thu ho hi pha salouva jabol lou chu gaosapna chang hen.'  
\q2 Chuteng leh mijousen, 'Amen' tia adonbut diu ahi.\x + \xo 27:26 \xt Gal 3:10\x*   
\c 28  
\s1 Thunun jeh a phattheina  
\p
\v 1 Pakai na Pathen'u thua nanun uva tuni khoa kapeh athupeh jouse aboncha najui sohkei uva ahileh, Pakai na Pathe'un vannoiya nam jouse lah a na dopsang diu ahi. \x + \xo 28:1 \xt Danbu Ni Na 11:13-17\x*  
\v 2 Pakai na Pathen'u thusei aboncha na ngai uva ahileh a phattheina jouse na chan diu ahi:   
\b  
\q1
\v 3 Na khopi hou leh na lou hou  
\q2 phattheina chang ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 4 Na chateu le na anche hou  
\q2 phattheina chang diu ahi.  
\q1 Na bonghon le kelcha hon ho chilhah  
\q2 phattheina chang diu ahi.   
\q1
\v 5 Na thei paipeh hou leh na changlhah khum hou  
\q2 phattheina chang ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 6 Hoiya cheuvin lang ipi bol jong leu chun,  
\q2 phattheina na chan diu ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 7 Na galmi ten nahin lonkhum tengu leh Pakaijin amaho ajo ding ahi. Ama hon lam khat a nahin lonvuh diu, ahin lam sagi a jamcheh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Pakaijin natohna lam jouseuva phattheina na honpeh diu chule na thil kholnau nadip peh diu ahi. Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsunga chu phatthei na chan diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Pakai na Pathen thupeh chengse aboncha nanit sohkei uva alampi ho a na lamlhah uvleh, na heng uva akitepna banga abol ding ama namtheng mite nahi diu ahi.  
\v 10 Chuteng vannoiya nam jousen Pakaijin nam mite ahiuve tichu amu diu ahin, chule nang ho kichatna a ding diu ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Pakaijin napu napa teu peh dinga akitepna gam'a chu vangbohna na chan diu, chate tampi a phattheina, gancha tampi, chule muchi chivo thalhingtah a phatthei naboh diu ahi.  
\v 12 Pakaijin agou kholna van a konin natohna jouseuva aphat cha gotwi nape uvin tin phatthei naboh diu ahi. Nang hon nam tamtah heng'a thil na phal diu, ahinlah nang hon midanga bat dia na ngaichat lou diu ahi.  
\v 13 Tunia kapeh u Pakai na Pathen'u thupeh ho na ngai uva ahileh, chule chingtheiya na jabol uleh, Pakaijin nangho aluchang'a na pansah diu ameiya na pansah lou diu, chule phat jousea achungnungpen a napan uva anoinungpen a napan louhel diu ahi.  
\v 14 Tunia ka thupeh chengsea konna hi khatcha a na kihei mang thei lou diu, pathen dang juiya hou nabol lou diu ahi.   
\s1 Thununlou jeh a sapsetna ho  
\p
\v 15 “Ahin Pakai na Pathen'u thu ngai ding nada uva chule tunia kapeh u thupeh ho leh dan ho jabol louva nakoi uleh, hiche gaosapna ho hi hunglhung ding chule na suhgam diu ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 16 Na khopi hou leh na lou hou  
\q2 gaosapna chang ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 17 Na chateu le na anche hou  
\q2 gaosapna chang diu ahi.  
\q1 Na bonghon le kelcha hon ho chilhah  
\q2 gaosapna chang diu ahi.   
\q1
\v 18 Na thei paipeh hou leh na changlhah khum hou  
\q2 gaosapna chang ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 19 Hoiya cheuvin lang ipi bol jong leu chun,  
\q2 gaosap nachan diu ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 20 “Pakai ama tah in natohna jouseuva gaosapna ho, lung-opkaina, lung lhahna nahin lhutpeh diu, thil phalou nabol jeh uleh keima nei nungsun jeh uva kisumang hel ding nahiuve.  
\v 21 Nalut uva nalona diu gamsunga nachen lut kah uva koimacha khen louva Pakaijin nachung uva natna ho a nasuhgim diu ahi.  
\v 22 Pakaijin khosih, tipom, nichang sat le twi hah, thing nat le thih ehkai natna chom chom'a na suhgim diu ahi. Bolgimna hijatpi hin nathi masang seuva najui le diu ahi.  
\v 23 Na chunga vanthamjol chu sum-eng toh bang ding, nanoiya leiset jong thih banga tah ding ahi.  
\v 24 Pakaijin na gamsunga hungju ding go chu vutbong a akhel'a, chule vutvai chu na kisuhmang hel kah a hunglha jing ding ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Pakaijin na melma teu jo ding bep a nakoi diu ahi. Na melma teu chu lam khat bouva nalonvuh diu, ahin nang ho lam sagi a najam cheh diu ahi! Nang ho chu leiset a lenggam ho dinga kichat um thil khat nahi diu ahi.  
\v 26 Na thilong jouseu chungleng vacha te le gamsa ho an a pang ding, a delmang ding koima um louding ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 27 Pakaijin Egypt a uilut, tipom, uithah ho a na suhgim diu hiti ho a chu nadam kit lou diu ahi.  
\v 28 Pakaijin ngolna, khomulouna, tijatna a naden diu ahi.  
\v 29 Sun jenga jong muthim noiya mitcho banga nakimai le-le diu, hinla na lampi na kimu lou diu ahi. Nang ho na kisugim uva na kichom jing diu, chule koima nahuh diuva hung louding ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 30 Jidia numei nakihol ding, hinlah amanu chu pasal dangin aluppi ding ahi. In nasah ding, hinlah koiham khat cheng ding ahi. Lengpi lei bol in natin, ahinlah aga naneh khah lou ding ahi.  
\v 31 Na masanga na namit mu'n nabongchal ki that intin, ahinlah asa chu khatcha na pekhah louding ahi. Nanga konin na sangan kila intin, hung kinung thah ponte. Na kelngoi le na kelcha te na melma te kipe ding, chule mikhat jeng jong na kithopi umlou ding ahi.  
\v 32 Na chanu te le na chapa te soh dia kikaimang namu ding ahi. Amaho jeh a na lungthim keh ding, hinlah amaho na panpi thei louding ahi.  
\v 33 Imatih a najah khah lou nam dangin chol tah a natu nalou gasoh aneh diu ahi. Gimbol jingna le kijen dan phalou nathoh ding ahi.  
\v 34 Navel'a lungkhamna ho namu jeh a na ngol loding ahi.  
\v 35 Pakaijin nakhup teni le nakeng teni dam theilou uilut a natom ding. Tahbeh a, nalu apat na kengto geiya atom ding ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Pakaijin nangho le napu napa te hetkhahlou nam henga nangho le na lengpau na nomang diu ahi. Chuche mun'a chu thing le songa kisem pathen lim nahou diu ahi!  
\v 37 Pakaijin nalhut nau mun a chu kichat um thil, jaapi u le nuisat hoh a um bep nahi diu ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Tampi natu diu hinlah themcha nalo diu ahi, ajeh chu khaokhopi ten na muchi u aneh chaigam diu ahi.  
\v 39 Lengpi lei nalho uva na kisahlelpi diu, hinlah lengpitwi nadon lou diu aga jong naneh lou diu, ajeh chu lungin asuhmang ding ahi.  
\v 40 Nagam jouseuva olive thing tampi natu diu, ahinlah olive thao naman louhel diu, ajeh chu amin masanga aga kheding ahi.  
\v 41 Chanu chapa nanei diu, ahinlah amaho nachan diu ahi, ajeh chu amaho sohchanga um diu ahi.  
\v 42 Lung hon na thing hou leh na muchi hou asuhmang diu ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Na heng uva hung cheng kholjin miho chu hat jep-jep diu, nangho vang na kheh suh cheh-cheh diu ahi.  
\v 44 Amahon sum nabat sah diu, ahin nang hon amaho nabat sah joulou diu ahi. Amaho chu alu a pang diu, nangho chu ameiya napan diu ahi!   
\p
\v 45 Pakai na Pathen'un napeh u thupeh ho leh dan ho jabol ding nada uva ahile, namanhel kah uva hiche gaosapna hon nadel jing diu chule na khaltan diu ahi.  
\v 46 Nangho leh nakhang khang uva hiche tijatna ho hi amelchihna le gihna a um jing ding ahi.  
\v 47 Phatchomna tampi namu hou jeh a kipah le thanom'a Pakai na Pathen'u kin na bollou uva ahileh,  
\v 48 na galmi teu kin bol dia Pakaijin nang ho douna a ahinsol ding ahi. Gilkel a, dangchah a, keova umna a, imalam jousea nahsah louva na kidalha diu ahi. Pakaijin na ngongchang uva thih namkol akoi ding, na suhmanghel kahseuva hatah a na kisugim diu ahi.   
\p
\v 49 Hitia chu nangho toh kidou dinga Pakaijin leiset kol ninga kon nam khat ahin puiya, muvanlai banga gangtah a hung lenglut jeng diu ahi. Hiche nam mite pao chu het jong na hetthei lou diu,  
\v 50 nam gilou leh lungthim bei, tehse jabolna le khangdong khotona neilou hi diu ahiuve.  
\v 51 Hiche sepai ho chun na muchi hou leh na gancha teu anehgam diu, chule suhmanga naum diu ahi. Amahon na chang le mim, ju thah, olive thao, bongnou te, ahilouleh kelngoi ho, chule nangho jeng jong kisuhmang ding nahiuve.  
\v 52 Amahon na khopi hou ahin lonvuh uva na gam uva na kulpi bang hou—eivengdoh unte tia na kineppiu bang ho—chu ahochim diu ahi. Pakai na Pathen'un napeh nau gamsunga na khopi hou ahin lonvuh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 53 Gal mite lonvuh nasat val a gentheina gimnei behseh jeh a Pakai na Pathen'un napeh u na chanu teule chapa teu sa nahin neh diu ahi.  
\v 54 Nalah uva alungnengpen pan jong asopipa, angailut aji, ahinsa achate jeng jong lainatpina ahin neilou ding ahitai.  
\v 55 Aman ahinsa acha khat tahsaphe chu—aneh diuva amaho jeng jong ahop nom louding—ajeh chu gal mite jeh a na khopiu jouse gentheina hoiset behseh jal'a aman jong ima dang neh dang aneilou ahi.  
\v 56 Chule numei chonnem tah le lungneng nu—achon nem behseh jeh a akeng khotaljum jeng jong tol chotsah nom louhel nu chun—ajipa le achanu leh achapa te jenga jong engsetna anei ding ahi. \x + \xo 28:56 \xt 2 Lengte 6:28,29; Ka La 4:10\x*  
\v 57 Amanun ahinjou jouva anaosen chu amaho a konna asel ding, chutileh guhthim'a aneh diu ahi. Amanun gal khoh sunga khopiho a neh ding imacha anei louding ahi.   
\p
\v 58 Hijeh chun hiche lekhabua danthu kijih jouse hi aboncha nit ding nada uva, chule Pakai na Pathen'u min loupi le tijat um hi nagin lou uleh,  
\v 59 chuteng Pakaijin aseije umlou pul ho a nang leh na chate na suhgam diu ahi. Pul ho chu houise tah le olna umlou hi ding, khoh lheh jeng chule thohjou hoi hilou natna na sempeh diu ahi.  
\v 60 Na kichat tah Egypt gamsunga nat thohlelna jouse nachung uva ahin lhunsah ding, chule olna nanei lou diu ahi.  
\v 61 Pakaijin natna jouse le gamna hise a na suhgim diu, na kisuhmang kahse uva hiche Hilchahna Lekhabu a kiminpat lou adang jong ahin lhunsah ding ahi.  
\v 62 Tam lheh uvin lang van'a ahsi jat phajong leu chun, nangho themcha bou kidalha ding nahiuve ajeh chu nang hon Pakai na Pathen'u thusei na ngailou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 63 “Pakaijin nachung uva phattheina leh pun theina amua alung lhaina ahi bang’a, Pakai chu na kisuhmangna diuva lung-oi ding ahi. Nalut uva nalona diu gamsunga konna chu na botel diu ahi.  
\v 64 Chutia chu Pakaijin leiset ningkhat apat ning langkhat geiya namdang te lah a nathe cheh diu ahi. Chu a chu nangho nahiuvin napu napa teu jengin jong ahet khah lou thing le songa kisem, namdang ho pathen ho nahou diu ahi!  
\v 65 Chumun'a namdang ho lah a chu chamna ahilouleh kicholna mun namulou diu ahi. Chule Pakaijin na lungthim'u kitihot a akoiya, namit uva khomuna aumsah louding, chule na lhagao u kinepna bei aso ding ahi.  
\v 66 Na hinkhou chu seithei hilou dinmun a um jing ding ahi. Sun le jan a na kichat jing diu, kihing ding mong hinam tijong na hetthei lou diu ahi.  
\v 67 Jingkah leh 'Jan hitaleh!' tia nasei diu ahi. Chule nilhah ahiteng 'Jingkah hitaleh!' tia nasei diu ahi. Chutia chu navel uva tijat um namu houvin na kichat sah diu ahi'  
\v 68 Chuteng nanung mukit lou diu ahitai tia kakitepna gam'a chu Pakaijin Egypt lama kong'a na nungtol kit diu ahi. Chumun a nagal mite kom'a chu nangho le nangho soh a nakijoh diu, ahinlah koiman nachoh lou diu ahitai.”   
\c 29  
\p
\v 1 Hiche ho hi Moab gam'a aumlai uva Pakaijin Mose athupeh a Israel mite toh kitepna asem hou chu ahin, aman amaho toh Sinai Mol'a kitepna asem u banjom ahi.   
\s1 Mose'n Kitepna avelsei  
\m
\v 2 Mose’n Israel mite abonchan akou khom'un chule aseijin, “Egypt gamsunga naum laiyuvaPharaoh le asohte chule agamsung pumpi heng'a Pakai thilbol chu na mittah uvin—  
\v 3 patepna hattah ho, vetsahna kidang ho, chule datmo umtah tah ho chu namu tauve.  
\v 4 Ahinlah Pakayin tuni chanin nangho jouse hetkhen theina lungthim, mutheina mit, khojahna bil nape hihlai uve!  
\v 5 Keiman nangho gamthip noiya kum somli sungin kapui leuvin, na ponsil hou leh na kengchut ujong asepon ahi.  
\v 6 Nang hon neh ding changlhah, don ding ju ahilouleh khamna thei dang nanei pouvin, ahinlah ama chu Pakai na Pathen'u ahi na hetdoh theina diuvin aman na peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hilaiya kahung uva hin, Heshbon a Lengpa Sihon leh Bashan a Lengpa Og chu keiho dounan eihung kinahpi uvin, ahinlah keihon kajou uve. \x + \xo 29:7 \xt Minbu 21:21-30; \xt Minbu 21:31-35\x*  
\v 8 Agam'u kalauvin Reuben le Gad phung chule Manasseh phung kehkhat ho gam dingin kapeuvin ahi.\x + \xo 29:8 \xt Minbu 32:33\x*   
\p
\v 9 Chuti ahijeh chun, hiche kitepna thudol'a kisei thudol ho hi, abonchan bol'un chutileh na lolhin diu ahi.  
\v 10 Phung lamkaiho, upaho, migunho, Israel pasal jouse—naboncha uva tunia Pakai na Pathen'u umpina a nadin diu ahi.  
\v 11 Na chateu neo cha-cha ho le najiteu chule gamdang mi nalah uva cheng'a thing natanpeh ule twi nathal peh hou chutoh nahiuve.  
\v 12 Tunia hilaiya nadin uhi Pakai na Pathen'u toh kitepna neikhom dia hunglut nahiuve. Pakaijin hiche kitepna asem hi gaosapna toh asemtha ahi.  
\v 13 Tunia kitepna a nalut uhi, Pakaijin amite hiding Ama chu na Pathen'u ahi chu nangho heng le napu napa teu Abraham, Isaac leh Jacob henga akitepna suhdetna ding ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Ahinlah gaosapna ho toh kisemtha kitepna hi keiman nangho toh keima kikah dinga bou kasem ahipoi.  
\v 15 Keiman kitepna kasem hi tunia Pakai na Pathen'u umpina a hung ho a dinga bou kasem ahipon, khonunga hunglhung ding khang ho a dinga jong kasem ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Egypt gam'a iti ikhosah uva chule ihin dalhah uva igal miteu nam ho gam leiset iti ihin pal'u geldoh uvin.  
\v 17 Nanghon thet umtah chonna ho le thing, song, sum-eng, chule sana a kisem lim semthu pathen ho na musoh tauve.  
\v 18 Keiman nangho toh kitepna kasem hi nalah uva koimacha—pasal, numei, chilhah, ahilouleh phung—Pakai I-Pathen uva konna namdang te limsemthu pathen hou dia na kiheimang lou diu, chuti henlang hileh koima junga konna hung gaadoh a chu akha le thina thei gu umlou ding ahi.\x + \xo 29:18 \xt Heb 12:15\x*   
\p
\v 19 Hiche gaosap adia gihna jaho chu amaho le amahon kipapitona a gel uva, 'Ka louchalna lungchang deisahna lam kajui jeng vangin keima kabit nai.' Hiche hin paodohna dihlou lam'a eilamkai ding ahi!  
\v 20 Hitobang mihem chu Pakaijin angaidam louhel ding ahi. Chuti tah sanga amaho douna a alunghanna leh athangthip nan ahal diu ahi. Lekhabu a kijih gaosapna jouse achung uva hung chuding, chule Pakaijin vannoiya amin'u anoimang ding ahi.  
\v 21 Pakaijin amaho chu Israel phung jousea konna achomkhen ding, Hilchahna Lekhabu a gaosapna jousea kitepna kijihlut chu achung uva kisunglha ding ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Chutileh khang hunglhung ding ho, nangho chilhah hihen hetphah lou gam'a konna hung kholjin miho hijongleh, Pakaijin leiset asuhset leh natna ho a asuhgim nau hi amu diu ahitai.  
\v 23 Amahon, 'Gamsung pumpi hi kath le chi in akisusetai. Hichu imacha kitulou le imacha keh talou, hampa jengjong kehlou pannabei gam ahitai. Sodom le Gomorrah khopi teni toh abangin, Admah le Zeboiim, Pakaijin alunghan pet a asuhmang toh abang'e' tia tijatah a asei diu ahi.\x + \xo 29:23 \xt Semtilbu 19:24,25\x*   
\p
\v 24 Chule akimvel uva namdang hon , 'Ipi jeh pen tah a Pakaijin hiche gamsung hi hitia hi abol jeng hitam? Ipi jeh a hibang loma hi lunghang ahidem? tia adoh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Chule adonbutna ding chu, 'Hiche thil sona jeh chu agamsunga mipi hon Egypt gam'a konna ahin puidoh pau Pakai, apu apateu Pathen toh akitep nau adalhah jeh u ahi.  
\v 26 Chusangin, amaho akiheimangun tu masanga kihe khalou pathen lim semthu, Pakaiya kon hilou pathen ho kin abol'un chule ahou uve.  
\v 27 Hijeh a chu Pakai lunghan nan gamsung akah a, hiche lekhabu a kisun gaosapna ahin sunlhah ahitai.  
\v 28 Nasatah a alungsatna le alunghanna jeh in Pakaijin amite chu abehchang uva gam danga atolmang uva, tuni channa hiche a chu khosa ahiuve!'   
\p
\v 29 Pakai I-Pathen uhin koima hetlou thuguh ho aneijin ahi. Hiche ho a chu mopo thei ihi pouve, ahin aphondoh ho a hi eiho le ichate hou hi atonsot adia mopo thei ihiuve, achutia ahileh eihon hiche hilchahna ho hi ijabol sohkei diu dol ahi.   
\c 30  
\s1 Pakai heng'a kilekit dinga kouna  
\p
\v 1 Khonungleh, nangho dia kagon phattheina ho leh gaosapna ho nahin hetchen uva, chule Pakaijin na Pathen'un na nomang nau namdang ho lah a nachen tengule, hiche hilchahna ho hi abonchan gelkhoh jingun.  
\v 2 Chuche laiya chu nangho le nachateu chengse Pakai na Pathen'u henga na hung kile uva, chule tunia ka thupeh chengse hi na lungthim pumpiu le na lhagao pumpi uva najabol uva ahileh,  
\v 3 chuteng Pakai na Pathen'un vangphatna ahin kilesah ding ahi. Aman na chung uva lungsetna aumsah ding, Pakaijin muntin'a na thecheh nauva konna nahin suhkhom kit diu ahi.  
\v 4 Vannoi tinchenga kithe cheh jong leu chun, hiche mun'a kon chun Pakai na Pathen'un nahin suhkhom uva nahin nungpui kit diu ahi.  
\v 5 Pakai na Pathen'un napu napa teu gam'a chu nahin puilut kit diu, hiche mun'a chu nachen kit diu ahi. Chuteng Aman napu napa teu sanga lolhingjo le pungjoa nasem diu ahi!   
\p
\v 6 Pakai na Pathen'un nangho leh na chilhah jouseu lungthim akhel ding, chutengleh na lungthim pumpiu le na lhagao pumpiuva ama na ngailut diu chule chutia chu nahin diu ahi!  
\v 7 Pakai na Pathen'un hiche gaosapna jouse hi nangho bolgim le vetda na galmi teu chunga athoh sah ding ahi.  
\v 8 Chutengleh nang hon avel'a Pakai najabol uva tunia ka thupeh jouseu nanit diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Pakai na Pathen'in natohna jouseuva na lolhinsah diu ahi. Aman cha tamtah le gancha tamtah napeh diu, chule Aman nalou gaasoh ujong tamtah a apunsah ding, ajeh chu Pakaijin napu napa teu banga nangho jong na kipa thanop sah diu ahi.  
\v 10 Nangho Pakai na Pathen'u henga na lungthim ule na lhagao pumpi uva nakihei uva a ogin na ngai uva Hilchahna Lekhabu a kisun Dan ho leh thupeh ho najabol uva ahile na chung uva Pakai na Pathen'u kipah thanom ding ahi.   
\s1 Thi le Hin Kilhenna  
\p
\v 11 Ajeh chu tunia ka thupeh chengseu hi nangho dinga hahsa lom-lom ahipon, na phahlel diu jong ahipoi.  
\v 12 Hichu van'a kikoi ahipon, 'Ijah ule ijabol theina diuva koi ham van'a gakal'a hin choilha ding? tia chutia gamla a kidohna ding ahipoi.\x + \xo 30:12 \xt Rm 10:6-8\x*  
\v 13 Hichu dillen gal'a kikoi ahipon, 'Ijah ule ijabol theina diuva koi ham ga galkaiya iheng uva hin polut ding? tia chutia gamla a kidohna ding ahipoi.  
\v 14 Ahipoi, hiche thu hi kinaitah a nangho a um ahi bouvin; hichu na jabol theina diuva na nephu uleh na lungthim uva uma ahi bouve.   
\p
\v 15 Tun ngaiyun! Tunia thina le hinna, phattheina le hamsetna na kilhen diuva kapeh nahiuve.  
\v 16 Hijeh a chu tunia Pakai na Pathen'u na thupeh na ngailut diu chule athupeh ho najui uva ama deilam'a na lamlhah diu ahi. Hitia chu nabol uva ahile, nahin uva napun diu, chule nalut uva nalona diu gam'a chu Pakai na Pathen'un phatthei naboh diu ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hinlah na lungthim'u akiheimang'a thungai ding nada ule, chule pathen dang kin bol ding leh houna dinga na kiteldoh ule,  
\v 18 tua hi kagih nahiuve na kisumang tei diu ahi. Jordan galkaiya nalona diu gam'a chu na hinsot lou diu, hinkho pha nanei lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Tunia hinna le thina, phattheina ho leh gaosapna ho na kilhen diuva kapeh nahiuve. Tun na deilhen'u hetoh dinga van le lei kakou ahi. Oh, hinna chu nalhen tei diu ahin, chutia ahileh nangho le na chilhah hou chu nahin tei diu ahi!  
\v 20 Pakai, Pathen ngailutna, Ama jabolna, chule Ama a dettah a na kipehlut nau le ngailutna a hiche deilhenna hi nabol theiyu ahi. Hiche hi na hinna diuva phapen chu ahi. Chule Pakai na ngailut uva na jabol uleh, Pakaijin napu napa teu Abraham, Isaac, chule Jacob henga akihahselna gam'a chu na hinsot diu ahi. \x + \xo 30:20 \xt Semtilbu 12:7; \xt Semtilbu 26:3; \xt Semtilbu 28:13\x*   
\c 31  
\s1 Israel te lamkaiya Joshua ahung pan  
\p
\v 1 Mose’n Israel mipi jouse henga gahna ho apeh jouvin  
\v 2 aman aseijin, 'Tun keima kum 120 a upa kahitan, chule keiman nangho na lamkai jou tapoving'e.' Pakaijin kaheng'a aseijin, 'Nangma Jordan Vadung na galkai louding ahitai.' \x + \xo 31:2 \xt Minbu 20:12\x*  
\v 3 Ahinlah Pakai na Pathen'u tah chu galkaiya na lamkai uva pang ding ahi. Aman chumun'a namdang cheng ho chu asuhmang ding, chule nanghon agam uchu nalo diu ahi. Pakai kitepna banga Joshua in vadung galkaina a na lamkai diu ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Pakaijin Amor mite leng Sihon leh Og asuhmang banga chugam'a cheng nam dang ho jong asuhmang ding ahi. \x + \xo 31:4 \xt Minbu 21:21-35\x*  
\v 5 Pakaijin amaho jouse khu nangho khut a ahin pehdoh ding, chuteng keiman ka thupeh banga hi nabol diu ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun hat unlang chule hangsan'un! Na kichat lou diu chule amaho ang'a natijat lou diu ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'u chu atahsa tah a na masang uva che ding ahi. Ama chu thon ngailou ding na dalhah lou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Chuin Mose’n jong Joshua akouvin, Israel mite jouse mitmun, aheng’a aseijin, “Hat inlang hangsan'in! Ajeh chu hiche mipi hohi nangin na lamkai ding Pakaijin apu apateu peh dinga akitepna gam'a dinga na lamkai ding ahi. Nangma hi nahi agam diuva hin hoppeh dinga chu.  
\v 8 Kicha hih in lunglha hih in, ajeh chu Pakai ama tah in amasa dia na lhonpi ding ahi. Ama nang toh lhon ding ahin, Ama chu thon louding na lhakaang louding ahi. \x + \xo 31:8 \xt Joshua 1:5; Heb 13:5\x*   
\s1 Hilchahna Lekhabu mipi dia sim ding  
\p
\v 9 Chuin Mose’n hiche hilchahna jouse chu lekhabua ajihlut in chule thempu ho, Pakai kitepna Thingkhong puho le Israel upaho chu apen ahi.  
\v 10 Chuti chun Mosen hiche thupeh hi amaho apeuvin: “Kum sagi lhin tengleh, Kilhadohna Kum, Lhambuh Kut lai leh, \x + \xo 31:10 \xt Danbu Ni Na 15:1,2; \xt Danbu Ni Na 16:13-15\x*  
\v 11 Pakai na Pathen'un alhenna mun'a Israel mipi jouse kikhopna masanga nang hon Hilchahna Lekhabu hi na simdoh diu ahi.  
\v 12 Pasal, numei, chapang, le gamdang mi khopia chengho—aboncha na koukhom sohkei diu—chuteng Hilchahna Lekhabu a thu chu ajah uva chule Pakai na Pathen'u genje kijil diu chingthei tah a hiche hilchahna ho chu ajabol diu ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche hi bol'un chutileh hilchahna heloulai na chateu chun ajah uva Pakai na Pathen'u ginje kijil diu ahi. Jordan na galkai uva nalona diu gam'a nachen laise uvin bol uvin.   
\s1 Israel te thunun louna kimasei  
\p
\v 14 Chuin Pakaijin Mose henga aseijin, “Na thina ding phat chu ahung lhung'e. Joshua henga seiyin lang Houbuh sunga hung lut lhon'in, chutengleh keiman chuche mun a chu Joshua ngansena kapeh ding ahi.” Hiti chun Mose leh Joshua jong achelhon'in Houbuh sunga chun agalut lhon tan ahi.  
\v 15 Chutah chun Pakai chu ponbuh theng sunga meibang khom bangin ahung kilah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Pakaijin Mose henga aseijin, “Nangma nathi a napu napate toh na lupkhomna ding phat ahung naitai. Nangma na chenung tengleh, mipi ho hin achena chan uva lei pathen ho, gamdang pathen ho ahin houpan diu ahi. Keima eidalhah uva amaho toh kitepna asuhkeh diu ahitai.  
\v 17 Chutengleh ka lunghanna achung uva hung soudoh jeng ding ahi. keiman amaho ka dalhah ding, amao a konna kamai kasel ding, chule amaho vallhum'a um diu ahi. Achung uva lungkhamna nasatah hung lhung ding, chule hiche nikho chuleh, 'Hiche hahsatna ho hi ichung uva ahunglhung tai ajeh chu Pathenin eiumpi tapouve! tia asei diu ahi.  
\v 18 Hiche phat lechun pathen dang ahou uva thil phalou bol dia akipehlut tahjeh uva amaho a konna keiman kamai kasel ding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hijeh chun hiche lacheng ho hi jihdoh un, chule Israel mite hil'un. Ajilna uva kithopi uvin, chutileh amaho douna a hiche kibol chu keiya dia hettohsah a pang ding ahi.  
\v 20 Ajeh chu Keiman apu apateu peh dinga kakitepna—khoiju le bongnoi lonna gam'a kapuilut dingu ahitan. Chumun'a chu amaho phattheina chang diu, adu-du aneh diu, chule hung thao diu ahi. Hinlah pathen dang houna ahin pat diu; amahon einuse uva kitepna asuhkeh diu ahi.  
\v 21 Chule hahsatna lentah ahunglhun tengleh, hiche la chu ahetoh a pang ding, achilhah ten ahin suhmil louhel diu ahi. Peh dinga kakihahselna gam'a alut masangu tujenga jong hiche mite lungput hi kahet ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Hijeh chun hiche nikho mama chun Mose’n la chu asundoh in, Israel mite ahil tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Chuin Pakaijin Nun chapa Joshua chu hiche thucheng ho hin ngensena aneitai: “Hat inlang chule hangsan'in, ajeh chu nangman Israel mipi ho hi peh dinga ka kihahselna gamsung'a nahin puilut ding ahi. Keiman na lhonpi nang'e” ati. \x + \xo 31:23 \xt Minbu 27:23; Joshua 1:6\x*   
\p
\v 24 Mose’n hilchahna ho aboncha lekhabua asutdoh jouvin,  
\v 25 Aman Pakai kitepna Thingkhong pua pang Levi mite henga hiche thupeh hi apen:  
\v 26 “Hiche Hilchahna Lekhabu hi la uvinlang chule Pakai kitepna Thingkhong panga chun koijun, ajeh chu hiche hi Israel mipi ho dinga ahetoh a umden ding ahi.  
\v 27 Ajeh chu ichan'a douna le louchal'a nahiu kahe'n ahi. Tujengin jong, kadam'a nalah kaumpi jeng uvin jong Pakai dounan nakisa uve. Kathi nungleh ichan lom-lom'in douna hinkho nahin neibe tadiuvem!   
\p
\v 28 “Tun na phung uva upaho le migun jouse hin kouvun, chutileh amaho kom tah a thu kasei thei ding ahetoh dia van le lei kakou ding ahi.  
\v 29 Kathi nungleh nasatah a na chatvai uva najui diuva ka thupeh uva konna jong nakihei mang diu hi kahen ahi. Khonungleh, gim gentheina naheng uva hunglhung ding, hijeh a chu Pakai mitmua thilse nahin bol uva, na chon chan jeh uva nasatah a nahin lunghan sah diu ahi.”   
\s1 Mose La  
\m
\v 30 Chuti chun Mose’n jong ala chu Israel khoppi jouse henga asimlhan ahi:   
\c 32  
\q1
\v 1 Ngaiyun, vo vanho, chule Keiman thu hinsei ing'e!  
\q2 Ja in, vo leiset, Ka thusei ho chu!   
\q1
\v 2 Ka thuhilna thonggo bangin na chung'a juhen;  
\q2 ka seidoh hi daitwi bangin cheng hen.  
\q2 Ka thusei ho thonggo bangin hamnem chunga juhen,   
\q1
\v 3 Keiman Pakai min samphong ingting;  
\q2 I-Pathen'u iti loupi hitam!   
\q1
\v 4 Pathen hi songpi ahin; athilbol ho achamkim tangeiye.  
\q2 Athilbol abonchan adih le ahoi jeng ahi.  
\q2 Ama chu kitah tah adihlou bollou Pathen ahin;  
\q2 ama iti dih a lungtheng hitam!   
\b  
\q1
\v 5 Ahin amaho ama a din dihlou tah in achon'ui;  
\q2 amaho louchal tah a achon teng'u,  
\q2 amaho chu ama chate himong nauvem?  
\q2 Amaho jouva dim le khang kipei mite ahiuve.   
\q1
\v 6 Hiche hi Pakai lethuh dan hinam,  
\q2 nangho mingol le ima hetna neilou miho?  
\q2 Ama chu nangho sempa na Pau hilou ham?  
\q2 Ama chun nasem uva natundoh u hilou ham?   
\q1
\v 7 Nikho masa lai chu geldoh un;  
\q2 achesa khang masa ho jong chu geldoh un.  
\q2 Napa chu dingin, chule aman nahetsah ding ahi.  
\q2 Na upateu dong'un, chule ama hon na seipeh diu ahi.   
\q1
\v 8 Hatchungnung pen in nampi goulo ahop peh chun,  
\q2 Aman mihem chate alhen khen chun,  
\q2 miho din gamgi asekhen peh e  
\q2 ajat dungjuiyun avan'a konin. \x + \xo 32:8 \xt Act 17:26\x*   
\b  
\q1
\v 9 Ajeh chu Israel mite hi Pakaiya ahiuvin;  
\q2 Jacob hi ama goulu ahi.   
\q1
\v 10 Aman amaho chu nelgam'a amudoh in,  
\q2 agoh keovin, manmo gam'a peng leiloijin.  
\q2 Aman amaho aumkim'in avekol'e;  
\q2 aman angahtup in amittah in avetup e.   
\q1
\v 11 Muvanlai in anou avil jinga,  
\q2 anoute chunga akilat le bangin,  
\q2 hijeh chun aman amaho puitouna dingin alhaving teni ajah in  
\q2 chule hiche achun bittah in apolei.   
\q1
\v 12 Pakai ama tah in avekol'un;  
\q2 amahon gamdang pathen ho ajui pouvin ahi.   
\q1
\v 13 Aman mun sang ho a akitolsah un  
\q2 chule louva muchi ho chunga golvah abolsah uvin ahi.  
\q2 Aman songpi a konna khoiju  
\q2 le songhum lah a kon'a olive thaovin avah un ahi.   
\q1
\v 14 Aman amaho chu kel-hon lah a kon'a anoitwi  
\q2 chule bong hon lah a kon'a bongnoi,  
\q2 kelngoi ho thao toh kithoa avah u ahi.  
\q2 Aman amaho deisah Bashan a kelchal ho, chule kelcha ho,  
\q2 deisahpen suhlouchang toh apeuvin ahi.  
\q2 Nang hon ju tuipen nadon'un,  
\q2 Lengpitwi a konna kisem ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 15 Hinlah Israel chu gangtah in athaovin chule akhansen;  
\q2 mipi chu agih lam'ah akhangun, a-uh uvin, chule abingletlut tauve!  
\q2 Chuti chun amahon asempau Pathen adalha tauve;  
\q2 amahon ahuhhing diuvin song vah asem'un ahi.   
\q1
\v 16 Amahon gamdang pathen kin abol jeh un athangset sah uvin,  
\q2 chondan thet umtah tah abol jeh un Ama alunghang sah tauve.   
\q1
\v 17 Pathen hilou, thilha ho henga kilhaina asem uvin,  
\q2 hiche pathen ho chu masang'a ahetphah lou u ahin,  
\q2 pathen athah ho chu tunaicha a hunglhung ahiuvin,  
\q2 hiche pathen ho chu apu apa teuvin aginlouhel'u ahi. \x + \xo 32:17 \xt 1 Crth 10:20\x*   
\q1
\v 18 Nangman pa a nasem Songpi chu na nahsah pon,  
\q2 na pensahpa Pathen chu na sumil tai.   
\b  
\q1
\v 19 Pakaijin hiche hi amu'n chule anungkih e,  
\q2 achanu te le achapa te tah in alunghanna din achoh thou uve.   
\q1
\v 20 Aman aseije, 'Amaho ka donda ding;  
\q2 ipi hungsoh uvem kive ding ahi.  
\q2 Ajehchu amaho hi khang lamvai tah ahiuvin,  
\q2 tahsanna bei chate ahiuve.   
\q1
\v 21 Pathen hilou thil ho ahou jeh uvin ka thangthipna asuthou uve;  
\q2 apanna beiyu limsemthu pathen lunghan nan eichoudoh uve.  
\q2 Tua keiman mipi jong hilou ho chu mipi mangcha a athangthip nau ka suhthou ding;  
\q2 Chidang namdang ho mangcha a alunghan nau ka suhthou ding ahi.  
\q1 \x + \xo 32:21 \xt 1 Crth 10:22; \xt Rm 10:19\x*  
\v 22 Keima kalunghan a kon'in mei ahung kong doh jengin  
\q2 chule lhankhuh thuh chanom akalha e.  
\q2 Hichun leiset leh amuchi jouse avallhum'in  
\q2 mol hung kipatna bul ho jong akalha tai.   
\q1
\v 23 Achung uva hahsatna ho kaset dim peh diu  
\q2 chule ka thalpi a kakap lhah diu ahi.   
\q1
\v 24 Kel'a, meikah sah a, chule thi natna ho a  
\q2 kasuh lhahsam diu ahi.  
\q2 Keiman gamsa aha a gunei ho  
\q2 le vut lah a kitol gul gunei tah ho ka solpeh diu ahi.   
\q1
\v 25 Polam'a, chemjam in thina ahin lhut ding,  
\q2 chule sunglam'a, tijatna in  
\q2 khangdong pasal ho leh khangdong numei ho,  
\q2 naosen ho leh tehse ho ajep ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 26 Keiman amaho ka suhmang diu,  
\q2 alunggel jengu jong ka thehmang ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 27 Hinlah ka gin chu Israel ding'a amelma ten totnopna a ahin nei diu,  
\q2 hetkhel jeh a asei uva,  
\q2 “Eiho tah thaneina in galjona inei tauve!  
\q2 Hiche a hin Pakaijin bolding imacha aneipoi!'” ati diu ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 28 “Ahinlah Israel hi ima helou nam ahin;  
\q2 mipi ho jong ima hethei louva ngol ahiuve.   
\q1
\v 29 Oh, amaho chu ching uva chule hethei tave hileu!  
\q2 Oh, asuhkhel nau hedoh teiyunte!   
\q1
\v 30 Mikhat chun mi sangkhat chu iti adeljam'a,  
\q2 chule mini bouvin mi sangsom iti adeljam ding,  
\q2 Songpi'n ajohdoh u tilouva,  
\q2 Pakaijin apehdoh u tilouvin?   
\q1
\v 31 Ahin igal mite songpi chu eiho Songpi tobang ahipon,  
\q2 ahetdoh jeng vangun.   
\q1
\v 32 Alengpi tu uchu Sodom'a lengpi a kon ahin,  
\q2 Gomorrah lengpi leiya kon ahi.  
\q2 Hiche lengpiga ho chu thina thei jeng ahin,  
\q2 agaboh jouse jong akha ngen ahi.   
\q1
\v 33 Amaho lengpitwi chu gulgu ahin,  
\q2 thina thei gulsoh ho gu ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 34 Pakaijin aseijin, 'Keiman hiche thil ho hi kakhol'a,  
\q2 ka gou umna a chu mohor kanam khum hilou ham?   
\q1
\v 35 Keiman phu kalah ding; Keiman ka lethuh ding ahi.  
\q2 Phat chomkhat jouteng kibalhu diu ahi.  
\q2 Ahamset nau nikho hunglhung ding,  
\q2 chule alhunna diu chun akhal tan diu ahi. \x + \xo 32:35 \xt Rm 12:19; Heb 10:30\x*   
\b  
\q1
\v 36 “Aman ahat nau kichai amu a  
\q2 chule soh hihen chamlhat hijongleh koima kidalhah lou amu teng,  
\q2 chule aman asohte chunga alungput akhel ding,  
\q2 Tahbeh a, Pakaijin amite dihna apeh ding ahi. \x + \xo 32:36 \xt Labu 135:14\x*   
\q1
\v 37 Chuteng aman adoh diu, 'Kihuhhingna dia akisel nau,  
\q2 a pathen hou song ho hoiya um hitam?   
\q1
\v 38 Chuche pathen ho chu tua hoiya um hitam,  
\q2 athilto u sathao kon aneh hitam  
\q2 chule athiltou ju kon adon hitam?  
\q2 Chuche pathen ho chu hungdoh uhenlang na panpi uhen!  
\q2 Amaho chun gena na gonpeh uhen!   
\q1
\v 39 Tun veuvin; ama chu Kei kahi!  
\q2 pathen dang aumpon ahinlah kei kaum'e!  
\q2 Keiman kathaji a chule hinna jong kapehji ahi;  
\q2 Keiman kamavo uva chule ka damsah jiu ahi;  
\q2 koimacha Kaban thahat a konna kihuhdoh louding ahi!   
\q1
\v 40 Tun Keiman vanlam sang'in ka khut kadom'in,  
\q2 chule ka phongdoh e, “Keima kahin laisea,   
\q1
\v 41 Ka chemjam val lah-lah ka kinol hem teng  
\q2 chule thutah boldoh kapat teng,  
\q2 Keiman ka gal mite chunga phu kalah ding  
\q2 chule eithet ho chu ka lethuh ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 42 Keiman ka thalpi chang chu thisan ka donsah ding,  
\q2 chule ka chemjam in saphe avallhum ding—  
\q2 gal hing'a kimanho le akithat ho thisan,  
\q2 chule gal mite lamkaiho luchang ho chu.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 43 Ama toh kipa thanom'un, nangho van ho,  
\q2 chule Pathen vantil hon ama houvun.  
\q2 Ama mite toh kipah thanom'un, nangho Chidan namdang ho,  
\q2 chule valtil jouse ama a ding chun kisuhat uhen.  
\q2 Ajehchu aman achate thisan phu alah ding;  
\q2 aman agal mite phu alah ding ahi. \x + \xo 32:43 \xt Rm 15:10; Rev 19:2\x*   
\b  
\q1
\v 44 Chuin Mose chu Nun chapa Joshua toh ahung kilhon'in Israel mite jouse henga lacheng chu aseilhan ahi.   
\p
\v 45 Mose’n Israel mipi ho jah a hiche thu ho aseilhah jou chun,  
\v 46 aman aseiben: “Tunia keiman naheng uva kagih nau jouse hi na lungthim cheh uvah nakoi sohkei diu ahi. Thupeh bangin na chateu heng'a peson'un chutileh amahon gahna thucheng jouse hi anit diu ahi.  
\v 47 Hiche gahna ho hi thuhomkeo ahipon—hiche ho chu nahin theina diu ahi. Hiche ho chu nanit uva ahileh Jordan Vadung na galkai uva gamsunga khu na hinkhou sot ding ahi.”   
\s1 Mose thi ding kimasei  
\p
\v 48 Chuche nikho ma-ma chun Pakaijin Mose jah a, \x + \xo 32:48 \xt Minbu 27:12-14; Danbu Ni Na 3:23-27\x*  
\v 49 “Moab a chen, vadung solam'a mol akhun, chule Nebo Molsang akhun kal'in, Jericho a kon'a kigalsai ahi. Canaan gam khu gaven, Keiman Israel mite agoulo diuva kapehna gam ahi.  
\v 50 Chuteng khuche molsang chunga chu nathi ding ahitai. Hor Molsang'a na sopipa Aaron apu apate toh akigopkhom banga napu napate toh nakigop ding ahitai.  
\v 51 Ajeh chu Zin gamthip noiya Kadesh mun'a Meribah twiya chun Isarael te lah a nanigel lhon'in nei lhemlha lhon tan ahi.  
\v 52 Hijeh a chu gal'a pat agam chu navet ding, hinlah Israel mite kapehna gamsung vangna chotlut louding ahitai.”   
\c 33  
\s1 Mose’n mipi phatthei aboh  
\p
\v 1 Hiche hi Pathen mipa Mose chun athi masanga Israel mite phatthei abohna ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 2 “Pakai chu Sinai Mol'a konin ahungin  
\q2 chule Seir Mol'a konin ichung uva kho ahin vahsah e;  
\q2 chule Meribah-kadesh a konin ahungin  
\q2 akhut jetlam'a meikong achoijin ahi.   
\q1
\v 3 Tahbeh in, aman amite angailun;  
\q2 amitheng jouse akhut a aum'e.  
\q2 Amahon akhonung ajuiyun  
\q2 chule athuhilna asang uvin ahi.   
\q1
\v 4 Mose’n Pakai gahna chu eipeuvin,  
\q2 Israel mite dia goulupen ahi.   
\q1
\v 5 Japi lamkai ho ahung kikhop khom uva,  
\q2 Israel phung ho khat a akigop phat uchun  
\q2 Pakai chu Israel leng ahung hitai.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 6 Reuben phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “Reuben phung chu lhomcha hijongleu,  
\q2 hingjing uhenlang thi hih uhen.   
\b  
\q1
\v 7 Judah phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “O Pakai, Judah kana khu ngaijin  
\q2 chule mipi toh thakhat ahina diuvin hinpuijin.  
\q2 Aboinauva akivenjou theina diuvin hatna pen;  
\q2 agal mite a konin vengin!”   
\b  
\q1
\v 8 Levi phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “O Pakai, nasoh natong kitah tah Levi te chu  
\q2 nangman na thiltheng—Thummim le Urim chu napen ahi.  
\q2 Nangman Massah achun amaho na patep un  
\q2 chule Meribah twiya chun amaho toh na kidouvin ahi. \x + \xo 33:8 \xt Potdohbu 28:30; \xt Potdohbu 17:7; \xt Potdohbu 17:7; Minbu 20:13\x*   
\q1
\v 9 Levi ten nathu anit uvin  
\q2 chule na kitepna jong avengun ahi.  
\q2 Amahon anu le apateu sangin  
\q2 nang'a din akitahjo uvin  
\q2 chule achate jengu jong ahe tapouvin ahi.   
\q1
\v 10 Amahon na dan ho Jacob ahil'un;  
\q2 na gahna ho Israel apeuvin ahi.  
\q2 Amahon na angsung'ah gimnamtui atohdoh uvin  
\q2 chule maicham'a pumgo thilto atohdoh uvin ahi.   
\q1
\v 11 O Pakai, Levi te natoh hi phatthei boh in  
\q2 chule akhut uva atoh jouseu sanpeh teijin.  
\q2 Agalmi teu atam theipenin deng inlang;  
\q2 agelmi teu jeplhu'n chutileh amaho thoukit louhel diu ahitai.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 12 Benjamin phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q2 “Benjamin mite chu Pakaijin angailun  
\q2 chule ama pong'a bittah in akhosa uve.  
\q2 Aman amaho chu aumkiim jingin  
\q2 chule hahsatna jousea aveng jingin ahi.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 13 Joseph phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “Agamsung hi Pakaijin phatthei boh hen,  
\q2 van ho a kon thilpeh mantam daitwi  
\q2 chule leinoiya kon twijin;   
\q1
\v 14 nisa noiya gathei tamtah keh hen,  
\q2 lhasim leh gasoh tampi sep hen;   
\q1
\v 15 gollui laiya molsang ho a kon muchi phapen pen ho,  
\q2 chule a itih a molnem ho a kon ninglhin nan;   
\q1
\v 16 leiset le aga sepna in aphapen asepdoh a,  
\q2 chule hamboh kong a kilah a chu khohsah tum hi hen.  
\q2 Hiche phattheina ho hi Joseph luchung'a kinga hen,  
\q2 asopite lah a leng chapa lallukhuh kikhuh hen.   
\q1
\v 17 Joseph hin bongchalgol lutna aneijin;  
\q2 aman gam'a bongchal ki apu e.  
\q2 Aman nam dang ho apih ding,  
\q2 leiset kolmong geiya apih ding ahi.  
\q2 Hiche hi Ephriam mipi leh Manasseh mi asang sangho  
\q2 dinga phatthei kabohna ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 18 Zebulun le Issachar phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “Zebulun mipi ho chu alamlhahna uva phatthei chang uhen.  
\q2 Issachar mipi ho chu aponbuh sunga phatthei chang uhen.   
\q1
\v 19 Amahon mol lang'a thilto  
\q2 phatecha toh dingin mipiho akou uve.  
\q2 Amahon dillen haosatna  
\q2 chule nelgam'a gou kisel chu aphatchompi uvin ahi.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 20 Gad phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “Koi hileh Gad dinga gam kehpeh a chu nunnom hen!  
\q2 Gad hi khut le luchang khottel dingin  
\q2 sakei bangin apansan ahi.   
\q1
\v 21 Gad mipi hon gampha laitah amaho dingun akilah tauve;  
\q2 lamkai chan ding chu akipe tauvin ahi.  
\q2 Japi lamkai ho akikhop tengu leh,  
\q2 amahon Pakai thutah chu apodoh un  
\q2 chule Israel a dingin achonna ho chu ajabol'un ahi.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 22 Dan phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 Dan hi Keipi bahkai nou ahin,  
\q2 Bashan a kon'in ahung kichomdoh jin ahi.”.   
\b  
\q1
\v 23 Naptali phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “Vo Naphtali, nangma deisah tum'a nahaovin  
\q2 chule Pakai phatthei bohna na dimset e;  
\q2 lhumlam le lhanglam hin chenpha'n.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 24 Asher phung chungchang'a Mose thusei:  
\b  
\q1 “Chapa dangho sangin Asher phatthei boh chang hen;  
\q2 asopi hon ama hin ngaisang uhen;  
\q2 olive thao in akengphang teni hin chup hen.   
\q1
\v 25 Na kelkot kamna chu thih le sum-eng hihen;  
\q2 na nikho jouse chu houina hihen.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 26 “Israel Pathen tobang adang aumpoi.  
\q2 Nangma panpi dingin vanho a akitol len,  
\q2 vanthamjol a lalna le loupi nan akitollei.   
\q1
\v 27 Tonsot Pathen hi nakiselna ahin,  
\q2 chule tonsot adia abanjang teni chu nanoiya aum'e.  
\q2 Aman nagal mite na masanga anomangin;  
\q2 'Sumangun!' tin apengjah e.   
\q1
\v 28 Hijeh a chu bitna a Israel khosa ding,  
\q2 Jacob phattheina chu bitna hiding,  
\q2 ju thah le chang le mim gam'a chu,  
\q2 van daitwi lha ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 29 Vo Israel, iti hamphat a nahi hitam!  
\q2 Pakaijin ahuhdoh mite, nangho bang koi dang um'em?  
\q2 Ama chu nabit nau pho ahin  
\q2 chule na galjo nau chemjam ahi!  
\q2 Nagal miteu chu na masang uva hung kineosah diu,  
\q2 chule nanghon aphahsam'u na lhopha diu ahi!”   
\p  
\c 34  
\s1 Mose thi  
\p
\v 1 Moab phaicham a kon'in Mose chu Jericho toh kinai Nebo molsang Pisgah molchunga chun akal tou tan ahi. Pakaijin Mose chu gamsung jouse abonchan avetsah sohkeiyin, Gilead apat Dan chan chu avetsah sohkeiyin,  
\v 2 Naphtali gamsung jouse, Ephraim, Mannaseh, Judah gamsung leh lhumlam gamkai sung jouse le Mediterranean chan twipi chan;  
\v 3 Negev gamsung, Jordan phaicham le Jericho—tomthing ho kena khopi— apat Zoar mun chan ahi.  
\v 4 Chuin Pakaijin Mose henga asei tan, Keima Abraham, Isaac leh Jacob henga kakihahselna, 'Keiman nason na chilhah te kapeh ding ahi,' tia kaki tepna gam chu hiche hi ahi. Tun keiman namit a namu dingin ka phalpeh tan, ahinlah hiche gamsung’a hi nangma nalut louhel ding ahitai, ati. \x + \xo 34:4 \xt Semtilbu 12:7; \xt Semtilbu 26:3; \xt Semtilbu 28:13\x*   
\p
\v 5 Hiti chun, Pakai lhacha Mose chu Pakai thusei bang chun Moab gamsung’a athitan ahi.  
\v 6 Pakaijin Mose chu Beth-peor gal lam, Moab phaicham achun avuitan ahi, ahinlah tuni chanin koiman Mose kivuina chet chu ahedoh pon ahi.  
\v 7 Mose athi chun akum 120 alhing tan, hijongleh amit jong athim pon, atha jong ahat nalaiyin ahi.  
\v 8 Israel mipi chu chonna ngaidol'a puldouna phat lhin kahsen Moab phaicham a ni somthum sungin Mose puldounan akap tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Tun Nun chapa Joshua chu lhagaova chihnan adimset e, ajeh chu Mose’n achung’a khut ana ngap ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin Mose ana thupeh bang chun Israel miten jong Joshua thusei ijakai angai tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Pakaijin kimaitoa ana houpi Mose tobang themgao dang Israel lah a aum kit tapon ahi.\x + \xo 34:10 \xt Potdohbu 33:11\x*  
\v 11 Pakaijin Mose chu Egypt gamsunga Pharaoh le asohte, chule agamsung pumpi dounan melchihna le thil kidang tampi bol dingin ana sol'in ahi.  
\v 12 Israel te mitmun Mosen tijat umtah natoh ho thahat tah pum'in ana bol in ahi.   